msgstr "Tesken Tizmilin n Umɛiwen akk yerzan tafyirt n uḍris n Ilɣa n Usnifel."

msgid "If you are subscribed to a note, you can unsubscribe."
msgstr "Ma tettwamekkteḍ deg tezmilt, tzemreḍ ad ter asmekti-nni."

msgid "If a note is assigned to you, you can unassign it."
msgstr "Ma tezmilt tettwabren fell-ak, tzemreḍ ad tekkseḍ asiweḍ-nni."

msgid "When you have a Manager role, you can delete a note."
msgstr "Mi ara tesɛuḍ tamlilt n Umsefrek, tzemreḍ ad tekkseḍ tazmilt."

msgid ""
"You can create a new Consultation Note with a query about the change in the "
"text of the Bible."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tesnulfuḍ Tazmilt n Umɛiwen s usteqsi ɣef usnifel deg uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "This page with change notifications is for you."
msgstr "Asebter-a n yilɣa n yisnifal d ayla-k."

msgid "Your colleagues have their own lists."
msgstr "Imdukkal-ik sɛan tibdarin-nsen."

msgid "Every day it will detect changes in the Bibles."
msgstr "Yal ass ad iwali isnifal deg Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"It will then generate new change notifications based on those changes."
msgstr "Syin ad d-isnulfu ilɣa imaynuten n yisnifal almend n yisnifal-a."

msgid "It will add these new change notifications to the list."
msgstr "Ad yerr ilɣa-a imaynuten n yisnifal ɣer tebdart."

msgid "The change notifications fall into several categories:"
msgstr "Ilɣa n yisnifal ttwabeḍḍen ɣer waṭas n taggayin:"

msgid ""
"Those marked with a smiley face are notifications of changes made by you."
msgstr "Wid yettwacerḍen s udmawen yettbasmen d ilɣa n yisnifal i d-txedmeḍ."

msgid ""
"Those marked with the name of a user are notifications of changes made by "
"this user."
msgstr "Wid yettwacerḍen s yisem n useqdac d ilɣa n yisnifal i d-yexdem useqdac-a."

msgid ""
"Those marked with a book symbol are notifications of changes in the Bible "
"text."
msgstr "Wid yettwacerḍen s tecraḍt n udlis d ilɣa n yisnifal deg uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"They are the result of the combined edits of all users working on this Bible."
msgstr "Ttili d agmuḍ n yibeddlen yemṣadan n yiseqdacen akk i yettxeddmen ɣef Tira iqedsen-a."

msgid ""
"Each category can be enabled or disabled separately in your notifications."
msgstr "Yal taggayt tezmer ad tettwarmed neɣ ad tettwasens weḥd-s deg yilɣa-inek."

msgid "Bible translation is a collaborative effort."
msgstr "Tasuqilt n Tira iqedsen d amahil amɛiwen."

msgid ""
"Changes you enter may be updated by others or merged with their changes."
msgstr "Isnifal i d-tsekcmeḍ zemren ad ttwaleqqmen sɣur wiyaḍ neɣ ad ddukklen d yisnifal-nsen."

msgid ""
"The different categories of change notifications enable you to find out "
"whether a change is now in the Bible text."
msgstr "Taggayin yemgaraden n yilɣa n yisnifal ttmuddunt-ak ad tissineḍ ma yella usnifel yella tura deg uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Bibledit tracks the changes in the text of the Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit yettaḍfar isnifal deg uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "It generates lists of them every day."
msgstr "Yettarra tibdarin-nsen yal ass."

msgid "Generate them now."
msgstr "Sker-itent tura."

msgid "Lists with changes can be downloaded."
msgstr "Tibdarin s yisnifal zemrent ad ttwaslent."

msgid ""
"Bibledit emails lists with the changes to users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr "Bibledit yettazen tibdarin s yisnifal s imayl i yiseqdacen i yermen ilɣa-a."

msgid ""
"It generates change notifications online for users who have enabled that "
"notification."
msgstr "Yettarra ilɣa n yisnifal srid i yiseqdacen i yermen ilɣa-a."

msgid "Notifications."
msgstr "Ilɣa."

msgid ""
"The users who have enabled change notification are listed below, with the "
"number of changes waiting for their review."
msgstr "Iseqdacen i yermen ilɣa n yisnifal llan ddaw-a, s umḍan n yisnifal i yettraǧun tuɣalin-nsen."

msgid "Changes are recorded in the journal."
msgstr "Isnifal ttwaḥrazen deg uɣmis."

msgid ""
"When the Bible text gets pushed to an external git repository, the changes "
"will be visible there."
msgstr "Mi ara yettwazen uḍris n Tira iqedsen ɣer ukaram n yisefka git azɣaray, isnifal ad banen dinna."

msgid "User"
