msgid "There are three rows:"
msgstr "Llan tlata n yizirigen:"

msgid "A top row, a center row, and a bottom row."
msgstr "Izirig n ufella, izirig n wammas, d izirig n wadda."

msgid "Each row has five columns."
msgstr "Yal izirig yesɛa xemsa n tezdiwin."

msgid "Thus there are 15 possible positions."
msgstr "Ɣef waya llan 15 n yidgan izemren ad ilin."

msgid ""
"You can set the relative height of each of the three rows individually."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tsbaduḍ teɣ almend n yal yiwen n tlata n yizirigen s wudem imaṭṭaf."

