msgstr "Neɣ seqdec arwasen 1, 1, d 2 ɣef tlata n tmeẓlayin i wakken ad tesɛuḍ tannect ¼ / ¼ / ½."

msgid ""
"You can enter the URLs of internal Bibledit pages or external pages to "
