msgid "Paratext bridge"
msgstr "Tamnaṭ n Paratext"

msgid ""
"Bibledit can synchronize its Bibles with projects in Paratext installed on "
"the same computer."
msgstr "Bibledit izmer ad yemtawi Tira iqedsen-is d yisenfaren n Paratext yettwasbeddin ɣef yiwen n uselkim."

msgid "The synchronization works in both directions."
msgstr "Amtawa yetteddu deg sin n tnila."

msgid ""
"Changes in the Bible text made in Bibledit will be transferred to Paratext."
msgstr "Isnifal deg uḍris n Tira iqedsen i d-yexdem Bibledit ad ttwanɣalen ɣer Paratext."

msgid "And changes made in Paratext will be transferred to Bibledit."
msgstr "Isnifal i d-yexdem Paratext ad ttwanɣalen ɣer Bibledit."

