msgstr "Asenfar n Paratext"

msgid "Take initial data from"
msgstr "Awi isefka imezwura seg"

msgid ""
"The first time to synchronize the Bible in Bibledit with the project in "
"Paratext, the system needs to have an authoritative copy of Bible data that "
"overwrites the other."
msgstr "Tikkelt tamezwarut ara temtawaḍ Tira iqedsen deg Bibledit d usenfar deg Paratext, anagraw yesra anɣal n isefka n Tira iqedsen ilaqen ara yeffren wayeḍ."

msgid ""
"Either the Bible books in the Paratext project overwrite the Bible books in "
"Bibledit."
msgstr "Ihi idlisen n Tira iqedsen deg usenfar n Paratext ad ffren idlisen n Tira iqedsen deg Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Or the Bible books in Bibledit overwrite the Bible books in the Paratext "
"project"
msgstr "Neɣ idlisen n Tira iqedsen deg Bibledit ad ffren idlisen n Tira iqedsen deg usenfar n Paratext"

msgid "This only occurs once during the setup phase."
msgstr "Aya yeḍra yiwet n tikkelt kan deg usrag n usbadu."

msgid ""
"While the Paratext bridge is active, Bibledit updates Paratext Scripture "
"text."
msgstr "Mi iteddu uqrab n Paratext, Bibledit yettaleqqem aḍris n Tira iqedsen n Paratext."

msgid "The updates occur in the Paratext files."
msgstr "Ileqqmen ḍran deg ifuyla n Paratext."

msgid ""
"When Paratext is running, and displays a chapter, and the chapter would be "
"updated in the files, then Paratext does not notice the updated files, and "
"does not reload the updated Scripture text."
msgstr "Mi iteddu Paratext, u yesken uxef, u uxef ad yettwaleqqem deg ifuyla, Paratext ur yettwali ara ifuyla yettwaleqqmen, u ur d-yessali ara aḍris n Tira iqedsen yettwaleqqem."

msgid ""
"Then when Paratext saves that chapter, it saves an older copy of the "
"Scripture text, and so undoes the updates made by Bibledit."
msgstr "Mbaɛd mi ara isekles Paratext uxef-nni, yeskles anɣal aqbur n uḍris n Tira iqedsen, u ihi isefsex ileqqmen i d-yexdem Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Therefore it is important to take care that Bibledit does not update "
"Paratext Scripture text while Paratext is running."
msgstr "Ɣef waya yeḍra ilaq ad tcudeḍ ad ur yettaleqqem ara Bibledit aḍris n Tira iqedsen n Paratext mi iteddu Paratext."

msgid ""
"The easiest way to achieve this is to not run Bibledit and Paratext "
"simultaneously."
msgstr "Abrid ilhan akk iwakken ad tsemmeḍ aya d ur tseddiḍ ara Bibledit d Paratext deg yiwen n wakud."

