msgstr "Izmer ad tsuqleḍ kan tifyar timeqqranin iwakken ad iddu ugraw-ik n tsuqilt s tutlayt-nsen."

msgid "Your translation will be included with the next Bibledit release."
msgstr "Tasuqilt-ik ad tettwarnu ɣer usuffeɣ i d-iteddun n Bibledit."

msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Tallunt n wakud"

msgid ""
"The timezone for Bibledit as an offset from Coordinated Universal Time in "
