msgstr "Aya yettallal deg unɣal n Tira iqedsen d tizmilin n umɛiwen d yiɣbula seg yiwen n umsaɣ n Bibledit ɣer wayeḍ."

msgid ""
"This helps translators with slow Internet connections to quickly setup new "
"Bibledit clients."
msgstr "Aya yettallal imsuqal s tuqqniwin n Internet ibaṭṭalen ad sbedden s tazzla imsaɣen imaynuten n Bibledit."

msgid "You can produce a file with all relevant data."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tesnulfuḍ afaylu s isefka meṛṛa ilaqen."

msgid "Get that file."
msgstr "Awi afaylu-nni."

msgid "Copy it to the new Bibledit client."
msgstr "Nɣel-it ɣer umsaɣ amaynut n Bibledit."

