msgstr "Amedya tezmer ad tsuqel Uneggaru Amaynut Agrik ɣer tutlayt-ik tamaneɣt."

msgid "Or it can translate another resource into that language."
msgstr "Neɣ tezmer ad tsuqel aɣbalu-nniḍen ɣer tutlayt-nni."

msgid ""
"That gives the translators easier access to those resources in a language "
