msgid "Hyphenation"
msgstr "Aṭṭekkul n wawalen"

msgid "Hyphenation can be used when preparing a Bible for printing."
msgstr "Aṭṭekkul n wawalen izmer ad yettwaseqdec mi ara tuggadeḍ Tira iqedsen i usiggez."

msgid ""
"It allows for more efficient usage of paper, and for more regular appearance "
"of margins at the end of the lines without requiring spacing adjustments."
msgstr "Yettmuddu aseqdec ɣer wazal n wara d usentel ugar n yimsekkilen n yimirant n yizirigen war ma yettwaseqdec asenfel n tallunt."

msgid ""
"The details of hyphenating properly are complex and dependent on the "
"language, and can interact with other orthographic and typesetting practices."
msgstr "Tilɣa n uṭṭekkul n wawalen i d-yelhan d tuggdiyin ɣef tutlayt, u zemrent ad ddukklent d tarrayin-nniḍen n tira d tenyaḍt n uḍris."

msgid ""
"Hyphenation may not be so important when preparing a Bible for proofreading. "
"It is usually regarded important for production quality Bibles."
msgstr "Aṭṭekkul n wawalen yezmer ad yili ur yelli ara d ahil mi ara tuggadeḍ Tira iqedsen i uselqim. Ɣas akken yettwaḥseb d ahil i Tira iqedsen n tmellit n usentel."

msgid ""
"When preparing a Bible in LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, en so on, the "
"wordprocessor itself provides hyphenation algorithms for many languages."
msgstr "Mi ara tuggadeḍ Tira iqedsen deg LibreOffice, OpenOffice, AbiWord, d wayen-nniḍen, aseɣyad n uḍris iman-is yettmuddu tarrayin n uṭṭekkul n wawalen i waṭas n tutlayin."

msgid ""
"If no suitable hyphenation algorithm can be used, perhaps Bibledit can "
"assist to a limited degree."
msgstr "Ma yella ulac tarrayt n uṭṭekkul n wawalen yelhan, ahat Bibledit izmer ad yallal s wudem yettwasbaddan."

msgid ""
"Bibledit can take the data from a Bible, insert soft hyphens in the words "
"according to a certain algorithm, and then save this data as a new Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit izmer ad yeṭṭef isefka seg Tira iqedsen, ad yeddem tinneɣruftin d yemlellay deg wawalen almend n tarrayt yettwabren, syin ad isekles isefka-a am Tira iqedsen tamaynut."

msgid ""
"This new Bible can then be exported to OpenDocument format, and opened in a "
"wordprocessor."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen-a tamaynut tezmer ad tettwasifeḍ ɣer umasal OpenDocument, u ad tettwaldi deg useɣyad n uḍris."

msgid ""
"The wordprocessor sees these soft hyphens. When a soft hyphen occurs near "
"the end of the line, it breaks the word there."
msgstr "Aseɣyad n uḍris ittwali tinneɣruftin-a imlellayen. Mi ara tella tinneɣruft tamlellayt qrib i taggara n yizirig, ad teqqen awal dinna."

msgid ""
"Bibledit has one hyphenating algorithm. When there is a transition in the "
"text from any character of a first set of characters, to any character of a "
"second set of characters, then the soft hyphen will be inserted at that "
"location in the text."
msgstr "Bibledit isɛa yiwet n tarrayt n uṭṭekkul n wawalen. Mi ara yili abeddel deg uḍris seg yiwen n usekkil n tebdart tamezwarut n yisekkilen, ɣer yiwen n usekkil n tebdart tis snat n yisekkilen, tinneɣruft tamlellayt ad tettwarnu deg wadig-nni deg uḍris."

msgid "First set of characters"
msgstr "Tabdart tamezwarut n yisekkilen"

msgid "Second set of characters"
msgstr "Tabdart tis snat n yisekkilen"

msgid "Enter the sets of characters, and press Save."
msgstr "Sekcem tibdarin n yisekkilen, u ssed ɣef Sekles."

