msgid "Bibledit Cloud connection"
msgstr "Tuqqna ɣer Bibledit Cloud"

msgid "Connected to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Teqqneḍ ɣer Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Connection information."
msgstr "Talɣut n tuqqna."

msgid "Internet address"
msgstr "Tansa n internet"

msgid "Your role:"
msgstr "Tamlilt-ik:"

msgid ""
"To connect to Bibledit Cloud, enter the details of the server, and your "
"credentials, and click Connect."
msgstr "I wakken ad teqqneḍ ɣer Bibledit Cloud, sekcem talɣut n uqeddac, d inekcam-ik, u sit ɣef Qqen."

msgid "Port number"
msgstr "Uṭṭun n tcuṭṭut"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Awal uffir"

msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Qqen"

msgid "Or else connect to the Bibledit Cloud demo."
msgstr "Neɣ qqen ɣer unamek ameẓlay n Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "To get access to Bibledit Cloud, install a server instance."
msgstr "I wakken ad tesɛuḍ anekcum ɣer Bibledit Cloud, sbedd tamsiwelt n uqeddac."

msgid ""
"Bibledit is not like some programs that can work faster if you log out and "
"log back in."
msgstr "Bibledit mačči am kra n wahilen i izemren ad xedmen s tazzla ma yella tefeɣḍeḍ u tkecmeḍ i tikelt-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"If you log out, then any verses you drafted or changed will not be sent to "
"the Cloud."
msgstr "Ma tefeɣḍeḍ, tifyar i tuggadeḍ neɣ i tbeddleḍ ur ttwaznent ara ɣer Agu."

msgid ""
"Bibledit has been designed so that the user never has to log out under "
"normal circumstances."
msgstr "Bibledit yettwaxdem akken aseqdac ur d-yettaǧǧa ara ad yeffeɣ deg tegnatin tamagnuyin."

msgid "I understand it and want to disconnect from the Cloud."
msgstr "Fhmeɣ-t u bɣiɣ ad ffɣeɣ seg Agu."

msgid "This page deals with setting up the email system."
msgstr "Asebter-a yerza asbadu n unagraw n yimayl."

msgid ""
"Bibledit sends out email. It also collects email every five minutes and acts "
"upon these emails."
msgstr "Bibledit yettazen imaylen. Yettaṭṭaf-iten daɣen yal xemsa n tesdatin u yettxeddem fell-asen."

msgid "It needs an external email account for sending and receiving email."
msgstr "Yesra amiḍan n imayl n beṛṛa i uzen d uṭṭaf n yimaylen."

msgid "The help information on this page uses a sample Google mail account."
msgstr "Talɣut n tallalt deg usebter-a tesseqdac amedya n umiḍan Google mail."

msgid "You will have your own email account dedicated to Bibledit."
msgstr "Ad tesɛuḍ amiḍan n imayl-ik i Bibledit kan."

msgid ""
"The sample email address is bibletranslation@gmail.com, and the password is "
"pazzwrd."
msgstr "Tansa n imayl n umedya d bibletranslation@gmail.com, u awal uffir d pazzwrd."

msgid "Google now recommends two-factor authentication to be enabled."
msgstr "Tura Google yettwasumer ad tettwarmed usentem s sin n yisurifen."

msgid ""
"The password to log into the Google account will not work in Bibledit."
msgstr "Awal uffir i unekcum ɣer umiḍan Google ur yettxeddem ara deg Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Instead create an App Password on Google and use that as the password below."
msgstr "Wlaha snulfu Awal uffir n usnas deg Google u seqdec-it d awal uffir ddaw-a."

msgid ""
"In case the setup fails to work, all diagnostics can be seen in the Journal."
msgstr "Ma yella usbadu ur yettxeddem ara, isenqad meṛṛa zemren ad ttwalin deg Uɣmis."

msgid "Site name and email address"
msgstr "Isem n usmel d tansa n imayl"

msgid "Our own sample values are given below. Yours will be different."
msgstr "Izalen n umedya-nneɣ ttwamuddan ddaw-a. Wid-ik ad ilin yemgaraden."

msgid "To switch the mailer off, leave the fields empty."
msgstr "I wakken ad tsenseḍ amazan, eǧǧ iɣerfan d ilmen."

msgid "Enter the name and the email address, and press Submit."
msgstr "Sekcem isem d tansa n imayl, u ssed ɣef Azen."

msgid "Email address"
msgstr "Tansa n imayl"

msgid "Retrieving mail"
msgstr "Aṭṭaf n yimaylen"

msgid "Sample values:"
msgstr "Izalen n umedya:"

msgid "POP3 Host:"
msgstr "Aqeddac POP3:"

msgid "Username:"
msgstr "Isem n useqdac:"

msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Awal uffir:"

msgid "Protocol:"
msgstr "Aneggaf:"

msgid "Port:"
msgstr "Tcuṭṭut:"

msgid "Enter the account details, and press Submit."
msgstr "Sekcem talɣut n umiḍan, u ssed ɣef Azen."

msgid ""
"When you submit the values, Bibledit will attempt to contact this email "
"account and tell the number of messages in the Inbox."
msgstr "Mi ara tazneḍ izalen, Bibledit ad yeɛreḍ ad yeqqen ɣer umiḍan-a n imayl u ad d-yini amḍan n yiznan deg tfeṛka n unekcum."

msgid "POP3 Host"
msgstr "Aqeddac POP3"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "Aneggaf"

msgid "Port"
msgstr "Tcuṭṭut"

msgid "Sending mail"
msgstr "Azen n yimaylen"

msgid "SMTP Host:"
msgstr "Aqeddac SMTP:"

msgid ""
"If the SMTP server does not need authentication, just leave the fields for "
"username and password empty."
msgstr "Ma yella aqeddac SMTP ur yesra ara asentem, eǧǧ iɣerfan n yisem n useqdac d wawal uffir ilmen."

msgid "Any port other than 25 will use a secure connection."
msgstr "Yal tcuṭṭut ɣer 25 ad tesseqdac tuqqna taɣellsant."

msgid ""
"When you submit new values, Bibledit will attempt to send an email to the "
"email address of Bibledit."
msgstr "Mi ara tazneḍ izalen imaynuten, Bibledit ad yeɛreḍ ad yazen imayl ɣer tansa n imayl n Bibledit."

msgid "SMTP Host"
msgstr "Aqeddac SMTP"

msgid "Select editor"
msgstr "Fren abeddel"

msgid ""
"This shows how many verses each chapter of the Bible has according to this "
"versification system, and how many chapters each book has."
msgstr "Aya yeskan acḥal n tefyar i yesɛa yal uxef n Tira iqedsen almend n unagraw-a n tefyar, d acḥal n yixfawen i yesɛa yal adlis."

msgid "It can be edited further down the page."
msgstr "Yezmer ad yettwaẓreg ɣer wadda n usebter."

msgid "Delete this versification."
msgstr "Kkes anagraw-a n tefyar."

msgid "You can modify this versification system."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ anagraw-a n tefyar."

msgid "To do that, edit the data below, and then submit it."
msgstr "I wakken ad txedmeḍ aya, ẓreg isefka ddaw-a, syin azen-iten."

msgid "It will overwrite whatever was there before."
msgstr "Ad yeffer ayen yellan send."

msgid "This lists the currently available versification systems."
msgstr "Aya yesbadu inagrawen n tefyar yellan tura."

msgid "You can create a new versification system."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tesnulfuḍ anagraw amaynut n tefyar."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Chrome OS"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Chrome OS"

msgid "Enable Android apps on Chrome OS."
msgstr "Rmed isnasen Android ɣef Chrome OS."

msgid "Install Bibledit from Google Play on Chrome OS."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit seg Google Play ɣef Chrome OS."

msgid "Start the Bibledit app."
msgstr "Bdu asnas Bibledit."

msgid "Leave it shortly to initialize."
msgstr "Eǧǧ-it kra n wakud i usenker."

msgid "Connect to Bibledit Cloud via menu Settings / Cloud."
msgstr "Qqen ɣer Bibledit Cloud s umuɣ Iɣewwaṛen / Agu."

msgid "Discussions"
msgstr "Idiwenniyen"

msgid ""
"It is important that the more difficult or important passages of the "
"translation are discussed by the Translation Team."
msgstr "Yewjeb ad nemmeslay deg ugraw n tsuqilt ɣef tefyar iweɛren neɣ timeqqranin n tsuqilt."

msgid ""
"All the members of the Translation Team have the intention to produce a "
"reliable translation."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen n ugraw n tsuqilt akk bɣan ad xedmen tasuqilt taɣellsant."

msgid ""
"But the views of the members about how to best put this reliable translation "
"into words may differ."
msgstr "Maca iwellihen n yimɛiwanen ɣef wamek ara d-tefk tasuqilt-a taɣellsant s wawalen zemren ad ilin yemgaraden."

msgid ""
"All members will listen to each other's arguments, bring their own "
"arguments, and come to a conclusion."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen akk ad ɛekkzen i yimeslayen n wiyaḍ, ad d-awin imeslayen-nsen, u ad d-awin tagrayt."

msgid ""
"The conclusion can be reached because everybody agrees, or it can be reached "
"by vote, or by consulting others, or a combination of this."
msgstr "Tagrayt tezmer ad tt-ilin mi ara qebḷen akk, neɣ s ufran, neɣ s uɣer n wiyaḍ, neɣ s wallal n sin n wid-agi."

msgid "Discussions shall be guided by the following rules:"
msgstr "Idiwenniyen ad ddun s ukala n ɣrayen-a:"

msgid ""
"If a member of the Team wishes to raise an issue for discussion, that member "
"shall create a consultation note for the team."
msgstr "Ma yella yiwen seg ugraw bɣa ad d-yessali yiwet n tsuta i udiwenni, imɛiwan-a ad isnulfu tazmilt n umɛiwen i ugraw."

msgid "The consultation note will be distributed to all members of the team."
msgstr "Tazmilt n umɛiwen ad tettwabḍa i yimɛiwanen akk n ugraw."

msgid ""
"To give members time to think about the issues, and thus make the discussion "
"more productive, the consultation note shall not be discussed immediately, "
"but after a day or more."
msgstr "I wakken ad d-awin imɛiwanen akud ad xemmmen ɣef tsutiwin, u ihi ad yili udiwenni d aṭas n tamsalt, tazmilt n umɛiwen ur ttwadiwennin ara tura, maca mbaɛd yiwen n wass neɣ ugar."

msgid "The consultation note clearly describes the issue or question."
msgstr "Tazmilt n umɛiwen tesfeḍ s tefrak tasuta neɣ asteqsi."

msgid ""
"If the member desires a change, the member shall include a clear suggestion "
"for change in the consultation note."
msgstr "Ma yella amɛiwan yebɣa asnifel, amɛiwan ad yerr deg tezmilt n umɛiwen asumer ifrak i usnifel."

msgid "The members of the team shall choose a chair person."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen n ugraw ad fernen amɛiwan-nniḍen d ameṭṭa."

msgid ""
"The chair person leads the discussions, keeps the discussions on topic, "
"ensures that procedures are followed, and keeps the time."
msgstr "Ameṭṭa yettawi udiwenni, yeǧǧa udiwenni ɣef usentel, yettwali ma yella tarrayin ttwaḍfaren, u yeḥrez akud."

msgid "The members of the team are all busy and their time is valuable."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen n ugraw akk ɛeggalen u akud-nsen yesɛa azal."

msgid "Therefore discussions should be kept short and to the point."
msgstr "Ɣef waya idiwenniyen ilaq ad ilin d imezwura u d iɣzaf kan."

msgid ""
"Personal reflections and deliberations about a passage shall not be done in "
"the team, while others are held in suspense."
msgstr "Tamawt tuṭṭunt d tuɣalin ɣef tefyirt ur ilaq ara ad ddunt deg ugraw, mi ara yeqqim yiwen-nniḍen ittraǧu."

msgid ""
"Everybody shall hold such deliberations in his own time without disturbing "
"others."
msgstr "Yal yiwen ad ixdem tuɣalin-a deg wakud-is war ma yesɛewwiq wiyaḍ."

msgid ""
"If discussion of a consultation note is dragging on, let's say for more than "
"5 minutes, a vote shall be taken so as to arrive at a decision."
msgstr "Ma yella udiwenni ɣef tezmilt n umɛiwen yettɣerru aṭas, ad nini ɣef 5 n tesdatin, tafḍut tettwakkat iwakken ad d-tawiḍ afran."

msgid ""
"If a member is not satisfied with the outcome of a discussion, that member "
"can forward the consultation note to other appropriate bodies who are able "
"to advise the translation team."
msgstr "Ma yella amɛiwan ur yeqbil ara iwenniten n udiwenni, amɛiwan-a izmer ad yazen tazmilt n umɛiwen ɣer yimdanen-nniḍen iwatan izemren ad ɛawnen agraw n tsuqilt."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the original language, then it will be forwarded to "
"the Bible Society."
msgstr "Ma yella tsuta tuɣal ɣer tutlayt taẓaṛt, ad tettwazen ɣer Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"If the matter concerns the local language, the matter should be forwarded to "
"the group of language scholars."
msgstr "Ma yella tsuta tuɣal ɣer tutlayt tamaneɣt, tsuta ad tettwazen ɣer ugraw n yinaẓuren n tutlayt."

msgid ""
"If the answer from the scholars does not satisfy any member of the team, the "
"matter can be forwarded to the panel consisting of local Church leaders and "
"scholars."
msgstr "Ma yella tiririt n yinaẓuren ur tweɛd ara yiwen n yimɛiwan n ugraw, tsuta tezmer ad tettwazen ɣer ugraw yebnan seg yinezgumen n tegnatin d yinaẓuren idigganen."

msgid ""
"If a consultation notes has gone through the advising bodies, and a "
"rendering is arrived at by the majority of the members of the translation "
"team, and this rendering does not satisfy a team member, that member can ask "
"the matter to be forwarded to three able Church leaders."
msgstr "Ma yella tazmilt n umɛiwen tɛedda seg yimdanen n uwellih, u d-tuɣal tsuqilt s waṭas n yimɛiwanen n ugraw n tsuqilt, u tsuqilt-a ur teqbil ara amɛiwan n ugraw, amɛiwan-a izmer ad yeṭṭlb ad tettwazen tsuta ɣer tlata n inezgumen n tegnatin i yezmeren."

msgid ""
"Those able Church leaders have knowledge of Hebrew and Greek, of good "
"commentaries and other reference materials."
msgstr "Inezgumen-a n tegnatin yesɛan tamusni n Tebrit d Tagrikit, n usentel ilhan d yiɣbula-nniḍen n udɣar."

msgid ""
"The questions sent to them should be worded such that it places a low demand "
"on their time."
msgstr "Isteqsiyen i ten-nettazen ilaq ad ttwarun s wudem ara d-yeǧǧen akud drus."

msgid ""
"The matter shall include the discussions of the translation team, the answer "
"given by the Bible Society, shall state the rendering chosen by the majority "
"of the team, and the alternate rendering."
msgstr "Tsuta ad tesɛu idiwenniyen n ugraw n tsuqilt, tiririt i d-yefka Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen, ad d-tebder tasuqilt i d-yettwafernen sɣur waṭas n ugraw, akked tsuqilt-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"The able Church leaders shall be asked whether they choose the majority "
"rendering or the alternate."
msgstr "Inezgumen n tegnatin ad ttwasteqsin ma yella ferrnen tasuqilt n waṭas neɣ tin-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"They shall be informed that their choice defaults to the majority if no "
"response has been received by the translation team within a month."
msgstr "Ad ttwasɛelmen belli afran-nsen yettwaḥseb d win n waṭas ma yella ur d-yeṭṭif ara ugraw n tsuqilt tiririt deg yiwen n wayyur."

msgid ""
"A vote shall be taken from the answers given by the Bible Society and each "
"of the able Church leaders."
msgstr "Tafḍut ad tettwakkat seg tririyin i d-yefka Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen d yal yiwen seg inezgumen n tegnatin."

msgid ""
"If the vote needs to be split, equal votes will be given to each of the "
"members of the translation team."
msgstr "Ma yella tafḍut ilaq ad tettwabḍu, tafḍut tamṣada ad tettwafk i yal yiwen seg yimɛiwanen n ugraw n tsuqilt."

