msgstr "Imɛiwanen"

msgid "Teams"
msgstr "Igrawen"

msgid "Typesetting"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen"

msgid "Tips and tricks"
msgstr "Iwellihen d tmuɣliwin"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Ɣef"

msgid "The Free Bible"
msgstr "Tira iqedsen tilelli"

msgid ""
"While Bibledit may be used for making any Bibles, there are some distinct "
"advantages to releasing Bibles under a free license."
msgstr "Ɣas akken Bibledit izmer ad yettwaseqdec i usnulfu n yal Tira iqedsen, llan kra n yismanyiyen yemgaraden n usuffeɣ n Tira iqedsen s turagt tilelli."

msgid ""
"Others will feel free to publish the open Bible. You don't need to do "
"everything yourself: Others will help spreading the Word of God."
msgstr "Wiyaḍ ad ṭṭfen tilelli ad suffɣen Tira iqedsen tiruranit. Ur teḥwaǧeḍ ara ad txedmeḍ yal tiɣawsiwin weḥd-ek: Wiyaḍ ad ɛawnen deg uzzuzer n Wawal n Ṛebbi."

msgid ""
"It becomes easy to publish Bibles in a variety of formats by a variety of "
"people: on paper, phones, the Internet."
msgstr "Ad yuɣal d fessus ad tettwasuffɣent Tira iqedsen deg waṭas n yimasalen sɣur waṭas n yimdanen: ɣef tehri, ɣef tiliɣriwin, deg Internet."

msgid ""
"If you think that the Bible you translated is good and reliable, and you "
"release it under an open license, it will rapidly spread over the Internet."
msgstr "Ma tḥemmleḍ belli Tira iqedsen i tsuqleḍ d tameɣtut u taɣellsant, u tessuffeɣ-itt s turagt tilelli, ad tezzuzer s tazzla deg Internet."

msgid ""
"Compare an open Bible to the Greek minuscules: They were copied freely, and "
"they can now be found all over the place."
msgstr "Seddy Tira iqedsen tilelli d iḍrisen imeẓẓyanen n Tagrikit: ttwanɣalen s tilelli, u tura llan ula d wanda llan."

msgid "Freely you received, freely give."
msgstr "Tqebleḍ s tilelli, efk s tilelli."

msgid ""
"Various church people regularly express a desire to have a more accurate "
"Bible than what they have now."
msgstr "Iɣerfan yemgaraden n tegnatin ttbeyyin yal tikkelt tiɣbalu n Tira iqedsen i d-ittmeẓẓayen ɣef wayen yellan tura."

msgid "The years pass by and the desire becomes stronger."
msgstr "Isemmaḍen ttɛeddin u tiɣbalu tuɣal tettaǧǧa s tezmert."

msgid ""
"They pray about the matter, discuss it, and decide to start the work on "
"improving the Bible themselves, with the help of a booklet with directions."
msgstr "Ttrajun ɣef tsuta, ttmeslayen fell-as, u qqarent ad bduɣ axeddim n usnerni n Tira iqedsen deg wudem-nsen, s tallalt n yiwen n udlis amecṭuḥ s yiwellihen."

msgid "The booklet is published by the Bible Society."
msgstr "Adlis amecṭuḥ yettwasuffeɣ sɣur Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"Over the years some people join the group, and others leave the group."
msgstr "Seg yisemmaḍen kra n yimdanen ttnaɣen ɣer ugraw, wiyaḍ ttaǧǧan ugraw."

msgid ""
"The church now has a translation team consisting of four people who by the "
"grace of God work full time on the revision of the Bible."
msgstr "Tegnatin tura tesɛa agraw n tsuqilt yebnan seg 4 n yimdanen i yettxeddmen ɣef usnerni n Tira iqedsen s ṛṛaḥma n Ṛebbi."

msgid "Each of the four people bring in their own expertise."
msgstr "Yal yiwen seg 4 n yimdanen-a yettawi tamusni-ines."

msgid "Two of them focus on the target language."
msgstr "Sin seg-sen ttwalin ɣer tutlayt n uɣbalu."

msgid ""
"They aim at using accurate, faithful, beautiful and contemporary language."
msgstr "Bɣan ad seqdcen tutlayt taɣellsant, tameɣtut, ihuzzan d tin n tura."

msgid "One of them focuses on the original Greek and Hebrew."
msgstr "Yiwen seg-sen yettwali ɣer Tagrikit d Tebrit n tazwara."

msgid "He ensures that the translated text matches the originals."
msgstr "Yettaǧǧa aḍris n tsuqilt ad yemṣada d wid n tazwara."

msgid "One of them focuses, more than the others, on the recipients."
msgstr "Yiwen seg-sen yettwali, ugar n wiyaḍ, ɣer yimekkatiyen."

msgid "She aims at acceptance of the language by the future readers."
msgstr "Tebɣa ad teqbel tutlayt sɣur imɣuran n ufus."

msgid "Many proof-readers contribute to the work."
msgstr "Aṭas n yimsiggilen ttallalen deg uxeddim."

msgid ""
"The translation team regularly consults with language scholars and church "
"representatives about the Bible translation."
msgstr "Agraw n tsuqilt yettmeslay yal tikkelt d inaẓuren n tutlayt d yimessuyen n tegnatin ɣef tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"The Bible Society answers queries about how to translate difficult passages."
msgstr "Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen tettiririt i yisteqsiyen ɣef wamek ara tettwasuqlent tefyar iweɛren."

msgid "After several years the New Testament becomes ready."
msgstr "Mbaɛd kra n yiseggasen Uneggaru Amaynut yewjed."

msgid "The manuscript is submitted to the Bible Society for publishing."
msgstr "Aḍris yettwazen i Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen i usuffeɣ."

msgid "The manuscript is formatted and uploaded to the church website."
msgstr "Aḍris yettwamsel u yettwasali ɣer usmel web n tegnatin."

msgid ""
"It can now be used by whoever wants to do so before it would be published in "
"paper form."
msgstr "Tura izmer ad yettwaseqdec sɣur yal win ibɣan, send ma yettwasuffeɣ s tseddart."

msgid "The translation team starts to translate the Old Testament."
msgstr "Agraw n tsuqilt ibeddu tasuqilt n Uneggaru Aqbur."

msgid "The years pass by."
msgstr "Isemmaḍen ttɛeddin."

msgid ""
"The team eagerly awaits news from the Bible Society about publishing the New "
"Testament."
msgstr "Agraw ittraǧu s wuḥeqqi ineɣmisen seg Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen ɣef usuffeɣ n Uneggaru Amaynut."

msgid ""
"Five years later the news arrives that the Bible Society starts the "
"preparations for publishing it."
msgstr "Xemsa n yiseggasen mbaɛd, tikti d-tewweḍ belli Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen tebda tuggdiyin n usuffeɣ."

msgid ""
"Another year later the team sees the first copies of the New Testament in "
"book form."
msgstr "Aseggas-nniḍen mbaɛd, agraw iwala tikkelt tamezwarut ineɣmisen n Uneggaru Amaynut deg udlis."

msgid ""
"During all those years the New Testament has been locked up in the offices "
"of the Bible Society."
msgstr "Deg yiseggasen-a meṛṛa Uneggaru Amaynut yella yettwaɣlaq deg yimeẓẓuɣen n Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"It was not free to go out to the people in book form, but was kept locked up."
msgstr "Ur yelli ara d ilelli ad yeffeɣ i yimdanen deg udlis, maca yettwaǧǧa yettwaɣlaq."

msgid "It was enslaved."
msgstr "Yella d aɛebdi."

msgid "The team keeps working on the Old Testament during many years."
msgstr "Agraw yettkemmil axeddim ɣef Uneggaru Aqbur deg waṭas n yiseggasen."

msgid "They are enabled to do so by the Lord God."
msgstr "Ṛebbi i ten-yefka tazmert n waya."

msgid "The Old Testament becomes ready."
msgstr "Uneggaru Aqbur yewjed."

msgid ""
"The manuscript of the whole Bible is submitted to the Bible Society for "
"publishing."
msgstr "Aḍris n Tira iqedsen meṛṛa yettwazen i Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen i usuffeɣ."

msgid ""
"One member of the translation team suggests to upload the formatted "
"manuscript to the church website, just as was done with the New Testament."
msgstr "Yiwen n umɛiwan n ugraw n tsuqilt yessuter ad tettwasali tseddart yettwamselen ɣer usmel web n tegnatin, am akken yettwaxdem i Uneggaru Amaynut."

msgid ""
"The team leader decides to not do this, but let the Bible Society be the "
"first to publish the Bible."
msgstr "Aqeddam n ugraw yeqqen ur d-xedmeɣ ara aya, maca ad yeǧǧ Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen ad d-tesuffeɣ Tira iqedsen send."

msgid ""
"The translator feels disappointed, because the Bible, now complete and "
"accurate, is not free to go out to the people."
msgstr "Amsuqel yeḥzen, acku Tira iqedsen, tura tewjed u tameɣtut, ur tellit ara d tilelli ad teffeɣ i yimdanen."

msgid "Not in paper form, not in digital form."
msgstr "Mačči s tseddart, mačči s uẓṭṭa."

msgid "It is enslaved, again."
msgstr "Tella d taɛebdit, i tikelt-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"Over the years the translator heard stories from others who had similar "
"experiences."
msgstr "Deg yiseggasen amsuqel yesla i yimeslayen n wiyaḍ i yesɛan tɣuri am tin-a."

msgid "It occurs to him that the current way of doing things is not right."
msgstr "Yeḍra-yas belli abrid-a n uxeddim ur yelhi ara."

msgid ""
"It leads to a situation where the Bible is not free to go where it is needed "
"most:"
msgstr "Yeḍfer aya ɣer wannect anda Tira iqedsen ur tellit d tilelli ad teddu ɣer wanda i teḥwaǧ ugar:"

msgid "To the people."
msgstr "Ɣer yimdanen."

msgid ""
"The translator begins to see more clearly that Christians should have "
"freedom to publish Bibles or portions of it any time they wish to do so."
msgstr "Amsuqel ibeddu ad iwali s wudem ilhan ugar belli Aklaniyen ilaq ad sɛun tilelli ad suffɣen Tira iqedsen neɣ iḥricen seg-s melmi i bɣan."

msgid "The translator becomes the leader of the translation team."
msgstr "Amsuqel yuɣal d ameṭṭa n ugraw n tsuqilt."

msgid "The team leader is acquainted with open licenses."
msgstr "Ameṭṭa n ugraw issen turagin ldin."

msgid ""
"He chooses the GNU Free Documentation License as an appropriate license for "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Yeɣra Turagt n Tsemlit Tilelli n GNU d turagt tameɣtut i Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"He is of the view that it is appropriate for the Word of God to be created "
"under an open license to allow it to have free course."
msgstr "Yettwali belli yelha ad tettwasnulfu Awal n Ṛebbi s turagt tiyaḍ i wakken ad yesɛu abrid ilelli."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows noncommercial distribution of the "
"Bible by anyone who accepts the license."
msgstr "Turagt n Tsemlit Tilelli n GNU tettaǧǧa aseddu war aɣdal n Tira iqedsen i yal win yeqbilen turagt."

msgid ""
"That is a good thing because this enables anyone to print the Bible and give "
"it to someone else."
msgstr "Aya yelha acku ittaǧǧa yal yiwen ad isiggez Tira iqedsen u ad t-yefk i wayeḍ."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows commercial distribution of the "
"Bible by any publisher who accepts the license."
msgstr "Turagt n Tsemlit Tilelli n GNU tettaǧǧa aseddu s uɣdal n Tira iqedsen i yal amsuffeɣ iqebblen turagt."

msgid ""
"This is good, because it maximizes the distribution potential by allowing "
"sales of printed Bibles."
msgstr "Aya yelha, acku yettaǧǧa ugar n tmeẓẓayt n useddu s uzenzi n Tira iqedsen yettwasiggzen."

msgid "It also harnesses the profit motive for distribution."
msgstr "Yettaǧǧa daɣen tirmit n uṛbaḥ i useddu."

msgid "It limits overcharging with competitive pressure on prices."
msgstr "Yessenqes tuɣalin n yisurifen s tḥezzɣa n yisefka."

msgid ""
"The GNU Free Documentation License allows to update the Bible, provided the "
"updated version is shared under the same license."
msgstr "Turagt n Tsemlit Tilelli n GNU tettaǧǧa aleqqem n Tira iqedsen, ma yella lqem yettwaleqqmen yettwabḍa s turagt-nni kan."

msgid ""
"This is a good thing because it allows legitimate updates, revisions, "
"adaptations with no hassle to the translators and no delay for getting "
"permission."
msgstr "Aya yelha acku yettaǧǧa ileqqmen, iseɣyaḍen, ibeddlen yelhan war ṣṣeḥḥa i yimsuqal d war tikli n usuter n turagt."

msgid ""
"A disadvantage is that changes can be made by people who might not be "
"qualified or called to make changes, with possibly heretical results."
msgstr "Ugur yellan d akken isnifal zemren ad ttwaxedmen sɣur yimdanen ur nelli ara d imaqranen neɣ ur ttwasdeɣen ara i usnifel, s yigmuḍen izemren ad ilin d imenɣaren."

msgid ""
"There is some fear that granting permission to make revisions would make it "
"easier for somebody to make heretical changes to the Bible."
msgstr "Llan kra n tugdiyin belli tizirag n usnifel tettaǧǧa wiyaḍ ad xedmen isnifal imenɣaren ɣer Tira iqedsen."

msgid "But copyright law is not about preventing this."
msgstr "Maca ccrayeɛ n yizerfan n umeskar ur yettwali ara aya."

msgid "If anyone wants to make those changes, he would still do it."
msgstr "Ma yella yiwen yebɣa ad xdem isnifal-a, ad ten-yexdem akken i yella."

msgid ""
"There is no need for this fear, because it is God who protects His own work."
msgstr "Ulac ccek n tugdi-a, acku Ṛebbi i yettḥerzen axeddim-is."

msgid "He makes clear what is a good translation, and what is not."
msgstr "Ittbeyyin amek tella tsuqilt yelhan, d ayen ur nelhi ara."

msgid ""
"If a Bible Society is so protective about a Bible, so as not to grant a "
"license to make revisions, then there is a bigger danger than that of heresy."
msgstr "Ma yella Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen tettḥerrez Tira iqedsen aṭas, ur d-tettefk ara turagt n usnifel, imiren yella lxuṭṭ ameqqran ugar n win n tmenɣirt."

msgid ""
"The bigger danger is that the copyright holder holds on to the Bible, or "
"disappears, or dies, or fails to be a good steward of it."
msgstr "Lxuṭṭ ameqqran d akken ameskar yeṭṭef Tira iqedsen, neɣ ittuɣal d aẓaṛ, neɣ immut, neɣ ur yelhi ara deg uḥraz-is."

msgid "Nobody would be allowed to improve or update the text."
msgstr "Yiwen ur yettwaǧǧa ad ixdem aleqqem i uḍris."

msgid "Trust God."
msgstr "Ḥkem ɣef Ṛebbi."

msgid "He takes care of His Word."
msgstr "Ittṭṭef Awal-is."

msgid "He deals with anyone who might abuse it."
msgstr "Ittarra ayen yellan ɣer win ibɣan ad t-yessexdem s lbaṭel."

msgid "The Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen tenna:"

msgid ""
"We own copyright, not in any way to restrict distribution, but to preserve "
"the text."
msgstr "Neṭṭef azerf n umeskar, mačči i usuddes n useddu, maca i uḥraz n uḍris."

msgid "Protecting the text may at times restrict distribution."
msgstr "Aḥraz n uḍris izmer ad iseddu useddu kra n tikkal."

msgid ""
"For example, the Bible must be distributed by us, or under our supervision."
msgstr "Amedya, Tira iqedsen ilaq ad tettwabḍu sɣur-neɣ, neɣ ddaw uɛessas-nneɣ."

msgid "We have made a big investment in the Bible."
msgstr "Nxedmen tiggi tameqqrant ɣef Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Nobody may improve it without our authority."
msgstr "Yiwen ur izmir ad t-yesnerni war turagt-nneɣ."

msgid ""
"If anybody gives us details as to where the Bible can be improved, they can "
"improve it, but only when we agree."
msgstr "Ma yella yiwen yefka-yaɣ talɣut ɣef wanda izmer ad tettwasnerni Tira iqedsen, zemren ad tt-snernin, maca kan mi ara neqbel."

msgid "This Bible is our property."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen-a d ayla-nneɣ."

msgid "We share it."
msgstr "Nebḍa-tt."

msgid "It is not entirely ours, so there is a shared property."
msgstr "Mačči d tin-nneɣ meṛṛa, ihi d ayla yettwabḍan."

msgid "The Free Documentation License is good in an ideal world."
msgstr "Turagt n Tsemlit Tilelli telha deg umaḍal ilhan."

msgid ""
"But the world is evil, so we need a license where we can protect the "
"integrity of the text."
msgstr "Maca amaḍal d aɣelnaw, ihi nesra turagt anda nezmer ad neḥrez ayen yellan deg uḍris."

msgid "The proponent of the free Bible says:"
msgstr "Win yeṭṭfen Tira iqedsen tilelli yenna:"

msgid "A free license enables spreading the Word of God more quickly."
msgstr "Turagt tilelli tettaǧǧa Awal n Ṛebbi ad yezzuzer s tazzla."

msgid "The Bible Society has made such a reliable and good Bible."
msgstr "Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen txedmen Tira iqedsen taɣellsant d tilhan."

msgid "Is it not worthy of being spread as far and wide as possible?"
msgstr "Ur yelli ara yewwi azal n usuffeɣ aɛelli ɣer wanda izmer?"

msgid ""
"A restrictive license confines the Word to one publisher, one channel."
msgstr "Turagt taḥerricɣent tettḥerrez Awal ɣer yiwen n umsuffeɣ, yiwen n wabrid."

msgid "A free license opens up the Word to being spread by more channels."
msgstr "Turagt tilelli teldi Awal i uzzuzer s waṭas n yibriden."

msgid ""
"If the license is restrictive, it is not the bad people who are afraid of "
"illegally copying the Word of God, making changes, then publish it."
msgstr "Ma yella turagt taḥerricɣent, mačči d yimdanen ibeddi i yuggaden ad snɣlen Awal n Ṛebbi s wudem arusid, ad xdmen isnifal, syin ad t-suffɣen."

msgid ""
"But it's the good people who would be worried to violate copyright law when "
"spreading the Word, thinking that God's blessing cannot be on something "
"illegal."
msgstr "Maca d yimdanen ilhan i ttagaden ad sɛun amgirad n ccrayeɛ n umeskar mi ara zzuzren Awal, ixemmmen belli ṛṛaḥma n Ṛebbi ur tezmir ara ad tili ɣef kra n lbaṭel."

msgid ""
"The free license does not aid bad people much, but it assists good people in "
"many ways."
msgstr "Turagt tilelli ur tettallal ara aṭas imdanen imejhaden, maca tettallal imdanen ilhan deg waṭas n yibriden."

msgid ""
"A restrictive license does not stop heretics in any way, but it stops good "
"people from spreading the Word."
msgstr "Turagt taḥerricɣent ur tettɛeddi ara ɣef ineɣmisen s yiwen n wabrid, maca tettɛeddi imdanen ilhan seg uzzuzer n Wawal."

msgid "The restrictive Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen taḥerricɣent tenna:"

msgid "If you revise our Bible, we'll see you in court."
msgstr "Ma yella tsnerniḍ Tira iqedsen-nneɣ, nettwali-kem deg lqaḍi."

msgid "The free and open Bible Society says:"
msgstr "Tagrawt n Tira iqedsen tilelli yeldin tenna:"

msgid ""
"If you revise and spread our Bible, we thank God for opening another channel "
"for distribution."
msgstr "Ma yella tsnerniḍ u tzuzreḍ Tira iqedsen-nneɣ, nesṭṭeɛfu ɣef Ṛebbi i yeldin abrid-nniḍen i usuffeɣ."

msgid "God wanted property rights to be there for the benefit of humans."
msgstr "Ṛebbi yebɣa izerfan n usḍḥef ad llan i usnerni n yimdanen."

msgid "But did he also want copyright on Bibles?"
msgstr "Maca d acu, yebɣa daɣen azerf n umeskar ɣef Tira iqedsen?"

msgid "Show from the Word where this is the case."
msgstr "Sken seg Wawal anida i yella wagi."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud on Linux"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit Cloud ɣef Linux"

msgid "Bibledit Cloud can be installed in several ways."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud izmer ad yettwasbedd s waṭas n yibriden."

msgid "Installation from packages."
msgstr "Asbadu seg yiɣazen."

msgid "Installation from source."
msgstr "Asbadu seg uɣbalu."

msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Turagin"

msgid "Typesetting in Adobe InDesign CS5.5"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen deg Adobe InDesign CS5.5"

msgid ""
"See the online help about typesetting for more information and general "
"principles."
msgstr "Wali tallalt srid ɣef taɣessa n yisekkilen i wakken ad tesɛuḍ ugar n talɣut d ɣrayen imatuten."

msgid "Chapter numbers in drop caps"
msgstr "Uṭṭunen n yixfawen s yisekkilen imeqqranen"

msgid ""
"Bibledit normally exports chapter numbers in bigger font in a text frame."
msgstr "Bibledit s wudem amagnu yessifeḍ uṭṭunen n yixfawen s tsefsit tameqqrant deg yiwen n uzirig n uḍris."

msgid "In InDesign it is helpful to have these in drop caps."
msgstr "Deg InDesign yelha ad ten-tesɛuḍ s yisekkilen imeqqranen."

msgid "Go to Bibledit, menu Export."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer Bibledit, umuɣ Asifeḍ."

msgid "There is a setting for using frames in the drop caps. Switch it off."
msgstr "Llan iɣewwaṛen n useqdec n yiɣzaz deg yisekkilen imeqqranen. Sens-it."

msgid "Do a fresh export."
msgstr "Xdem asifeḍ amaynut."

msgid "Creating a new document"
msgstr "Asnulfu n isemli amaynut"

msgid "Typesetting in InDesign starts with creating a new document."
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen deg InDesign tebda s usnulfu n usemli amaynut."

msgid "Choose menu File / New / Document, or press Ctrl-N."
msgstr "Fren umuɣ Afaylu / Amaynut / Asemli, neɣ ssed Ctrl-N."

msgid "In the New Document dialog, make some settings."
msgstr "Deg usatal n Usemli amaynut, xdem kra n yiɣewwaṛen."

msgid "Facing Pages: on."
msgstr "Isebtar imḍillen: yermed."

msgid "Page width: 138 mm."
msgstr "Tehri n usebter: 138 mm."

msgid "Page height: 210 mm."
msgstr "Teɣzi n usebter: 210 mm."

msgid "Number of columns: 2."
msgstr "Amḍan n tgejdiyin: 2."

msgid "Gutter: 4.2 mm."
msgstr "Talunt gar tgejdiyin: 4.2 mm."

msgid "Top, Bottom and Outside margins: 10 mm."
msgstr "Iɣrimen n ufella, n wadda d n beṛṛa: 10 mm."

msgid "Untick the option to set all margins the same."
msgstr "Kkes aferdis n usbadu n yiɣrimen meṛṛa am yiwen."

msgid "Inside margin: 12 mm."
msgstr "Aɣrim n daxel: 12 mm."

msgid ""
"Click Save Preset, and save the settings as 'Ndebele'. Next time, use this "
"preset to quickly make another new document with the same settings as this "
"one."
msgstr "Sit ɣef Sekles aseqmu, u sekles iɣewwaṛen am 'Ndebele'. Tikkelt i d-iteddun, seqdec aseqmu-a i wakken ad tesnulfuḍ s tazzla asemli-nniḍen amaynut s yiɣewwaṛen am wid."

msgid "Click OK to create the new document."
msgstr "Sit ɣef IH i wakken ad tesnulfuḍ asemli amaynut."

msgid "Setting up the baseline grid"
msgstr "Asbadu n tkalyin n yizirig"

msgid "All our text will stick to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Aḍris-nneɣ meṛṛa ad yeṭṭef ɣer tkalyin n yizirig."

msgid "This is a key factor to good typography."
msgstr "Wagi d ayen ilaqen i tbeddiyin tilhanin."

msgid "My leading is 12 points, and I will set up a grid to reflect this."
msgstr "Tallunt-iw gar yizirigen d 12 n tneqqiḍin, u ad sbaduɣ takala ara d-tesken aya."

msgid "Go to menu Edit / Preferences / Grids."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Ẓreg / Ismenyifen / Tikalyin."

msgid "Start the baseline grid at 0 mm relative to the top margin."
msgstr "Bdu takala n yizirig deg 0 mm almend n uɣrim n ufella."

msgid "Increment it every 12 points."
msgstr "Rnu-yas yal 12 n tneqqiḍin."

msgid "Press OK. The grid is now set up."
msgstr "Ssed ɣef IH. Takala tettwasbadu tura."

msgid ""
"Optionally, to make it visible, go to menu View / Grids and Guides / Show "
"Baseline Grid."
msgstr "Ma tebɣiḍ, i wakken ad tt-tesḥeqqeḍ, ddu ɣer wumuɣ Askan / Tikalyin d Yimuggaren / Sken takala n yizirig."

msgid "Placing text"
msgstr "Asaker n uḍris"

msgid "I am going to show how to place Bible text in InDesign."
msgstr "Ad sekneɣ amek ara tserseḍ aḍris n Tira iqedsen deg InDesign."

msgid "The text is available from Bibledit as OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Aḍris yella seg Bibledit am yifuyla OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"Open the book of Genesis, the version with text and note citations, in "
"OpenOffice."
msgstr "Ldi adlis n Genesis, lqem s uḍris d yitennaren n yizmilen, deg OpenOffice."

msgid "Save it as a Microsoft Word 97-2003 (.doc) document."
msgstr "Sekles-it am isemli Microsoft Word 97-2003 (.doc)."

msgid "Create a new document in InDesign."
msgstr "Snulfu asemli amaynut deg InDesign."

msgid "Go to menu File / Place, or press Ctrl-D."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Afaylu / Sers, neɣ ssed Ctrl-D."

msgid "Select the document in MS Word (.doc) format."
msgstr "Fren asemli s umasal MS Word (.doc)."

msgid ""
"Move the cursor through the document in InDesign. Notice that the cursor "
"shows some of the text to be placed."
msgstr "Sker aḍfar n useqdac deg usemli deg InDesign. Ẓer belli aḍfar yeskan kra seg uḍris ara yettwasersen."

msgid ""
"Move the cursor to the corner of the first column where the text will start. "
"Click there. Notice that the first bit of the text will be placed in the "
"first column."
msgstr "Sker aḍfar ɣer tiɣmert n tgejdit tamezwarut anda ara yebdu uḍris. Sit dinna. Ẓer belli aḥric amezwaru n uḍris ad yettwasers deg tgejdit tamezwarut."

msgid ""
"There is much more text than what fits in just one column. This extra text "
"is not visible. What is visible, though, is a red plus near the end of the "
"first column. This shows that more text is available."
msgstr "Llan aṭas n uḍris ugar n wayen izemren ad yeqqim deg yiwet n tgejdit. Aḍris-a ugar ur d-ibin ara. Maca ayen i d-ibanen d aqerru azegzaw qrib i taggara n tgejdit tamezwarut. Aya yeskan belli llan ugar n uḍris."

msgid "I would like to place this extra text in the second column."
msgstr "Bɣiɣ ad sersen aḍris-a ugar deg tgejdit tis snat."

msgid ""
"Click the Selection Tool or press V. The cursor changes to a selection arrow."
msgstr "Sit ɣef Allal n usafran neɣ ssed V. Aḍfar ad yuɣal d tineɣruft n usafran."

msgid ""
"Select the first column, and then click the red plus near the end of the "
"first column. Notice that the cursor will now show some text."
msgstr "Fren tgejdit tamezwarut, u sit ɣef uqerru azegzaw qrib i taggara n tgejdit tamezwarut. Ẓer belli aḍfar ad d-yesken tura kra n uḍris."

msgid ""
"Place this text in the second column, in the same way as it was placed in "
"the first column."
msgstr "Sers aḍris-a deg tgejdit tis snat, am akken yettwasers deg tgejdit tamezwarut."

msgid ""
"There is still more text than fits in the second column. I estimate that "
"there is enough text to fill many pages."
msgstr "Mazal aḍris ugar n wayen izemren ad yeqqim deg tgejdit tis snat. Ḥseɣ belli llan aṭas n uḍris iwakken ad d-yeččur aṭas n yisebtar."

msgid ""
"I am going to insert an extra page, so that we get more space to place the "
"text."
msgstr "Ad rnuɣ asebter ugar, akken ad nesɛu ugar n tallunt i usersu n uḍris."

msgid ""
"To add blank pages, I need to have the Pages palette visible. If the Pages "
"palette is not visible, choose Window > Pages to open the palette."
msgstr "I wakken ad rnuɣ isebtar ilmen, ilaq ad d-banen yisebtar n Usebtar. Ma yella Asebtar ur d-iban ara, fren Asfaylu > Isebtar i wakken ad teldiḍ asebtar."

msgid ""
"In the Pages palette, click Create new page. A new page will be added. This "
"is page 2. Press F12 to close the palette."
msgstr "Deg Usebtar, sit ɣef Snulfu asebter amaynut. Asebter amaynut ad yettwarnu. Wagi d asebter 2. Ssed F12 i wakken ad tmedleḍ asebtar."

msgid ""
"Page 2 shows guides for two columns. I can fill these with text in the "
"manner as described above."
msgstr "Asebter 2 yeskan iminigen n sin n tgejdiyin. Zemreɣ ad ten-ččureɣ s uḍris akken ibanen send."

msgid ""
"I can then add as many pages as are needed, and fill each page with text."
msgstr "Zemreɣ daɣen ad rnuɣ isebtar am akken ilaq, u ad čureɣ yal asebter s uḍris."

msgid "Span headlines across columns"
msgstr "Azwel yezzin ɣef tgejdiyin"

msgid ""
"The headline I have in this example is 'The first book of Moses called "
"Genesis'. I'd like it to span across the two columns."
msgstr "Azwel i sɛiɣ deg umedya-a d 'Adlis amezwaru n Musa i d-yettwasemman Genesis'. Bɣiɣ ad yezzi ɣef sin n tgejdiyin."

msgid ""
"Select the left column, and drag the top to make it shorter, so creating "
"space above it."
msgstr "Fren tgejdit tazelmaḍt, u jbed afella-s i wakken ad tt-tserreḥeḍ, i usnulfu n tallunt ɣef-s."

msgid "Do the same with the right column."
msgstr "Xdem am akken i tgejdit tayeffust."

msgid ""
"Select the text 'The first book of Moses called Genesis'. Cut it to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr "Fren aḍris 'Adlis amezwaru n Musa i d-yettwasemman Genesis'. Gzem-it ɣer tfeṛka."

msgid "Click the Type tool or type Escape T."
msgstr "Sit ɣef Allal n tira neɣ sekcem Escape T."

msgid ""
"Create a new text box above the two columns. Let it span across the two "
"columns. Estimate the size it needs to be."
msgstr "Snulfu tenkarant n uḍris tamaynut ɣef sin n tgejdiyin. Eǧǧ-it tezzi ɣef sin n tgejdiyin. Ḥseb teɣzi i d-teḥwaǧ."

msgid "Paste the text into that text box."
msgstr "Senteḍ aḍris deg tenkarant n uḍris-a."

msgid ""
"Resize the text box so it looks smart. Then resize both columns so that all "
"looks good."
msgstr "Beddel teɣzi n tenkarant n uḍris i wakken ad d-tban tlelli. Syin beddel teɣzi n sin n tgejdiyin akken ad d-banen meṛṛa akken iwata."

msgid "Making text align to the grid"
msgstr "Asenti n uḍris ɣer tkalyin"

msgid "Text aligned to the grid is key to good typesetting."
msgstr "Aḍris yettwasenṭen ɣer takala d tabɣest n taɣessa n yisekkilen tilhanin."

msgid "Select all text you would like to stick to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Fren aḍris meṛṛa i tebɣiḍ ad yeṭṭef ɣer takala n yizirig."

msgid "Go to menu Type / Paragraph, or press Alt-Ctrl-T."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Aru / Taseddart, neɣ ssed Alt-Ctrl-T."

msgid ""
"Press the Align to baseline grid button in the bottom right hand corner."
msgstr "Ssed ɣef tqeffalt Senti ɣer takala n yizirig deg yiɣrim ayeffus n wadda."

msgid ""
"The leading of the text should be equal to the baseline grid. If the leading "
"of the text is bigger, then it is like as if you have double line spacing."
msgstr "Tallunt gar yizirigen n uḍris ilaq ad tili am takala n yizirig. Ma yella tallunt gar yizirigen n uḍris tameqqrant, d akken tesɛiḍ tallunt tuẓẓint."

msgid "Total page count"
msgstr "Amḍan n yisebtar meṛṛa"

msgid ""
"The publisher may set limits to the number of pages the typeset Bible may "
"contain."
msgstr "Amsuffeɣ izmer ad isbadu tilisa i umḍan n yisebtar i izemren Tira iqedsen yettwarun ad tesɛu."

msgid ""
"In this example, we expect an entire Bible, with singable Psalms added as an "
"appendix, to contain no more than 2000 pages. Normal range is 1500 to 1800 "
"pages."
msgstr "Deg umedya-a, nettraǧu Tira iqedsen meṛṛa, s Tisefra n yimeɣbunen yettwarnan am usɣar, ur tesɛi ara ugar n 2000 n yisebtar. Amrar amagnu d 1500 ɣer 1800 n yisebtar."

msgid "We suppose that the singable Psalms take up no more than 200 pages."
msgstr "Nettxemmim belli Tisefra n yimeɣbunen ur zɛiken ara 200 n yisebtar."

msgid ""
"Usually the inclusion of the singable Psalms in a Bible will add about 10 "
"percent to the number of pages."
msgstr "S wudem amagnu rnu n Tisefra n yimeɣbunen ɣer Tira iqedsen ad yerr azal n 10 deg tmiya ɣer yisebtar."

msgid ""
"The Bible will have footnotes and crossreferences, all lumped together into "
"a single textframe at the bottom of each page."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen ad tesɛu tizmilin n uduɣ d tuccḍa n tuɣalin, meṛṛa deg yiwen n uzirig n uḍris deg wadda n yal asebter."

msgid "Let us now measure how many pages the notes are likely to take up."
msgstr "Ahat tura ad nɣeṛ acḥal n yisebtar i ara yeṭṭef tizmilin."

msgid ""
"Open the file with all notes in LibreOffice. It is 00_Bible_notes.odt. Save "
"it in the correct format for InDesign."
msgstr "Ldi afaylu s tizmilin meṛṛa deg LibreOffice. Yella d 00_Bible_notes.odt. Sekles-it s umasal ameɣtu i InDesign."

msgid ""
"Place the text as described above. But I am going to use Autoflow this time. "
"Autoflow will automatically create new text boxes and new page till all text "
"has been placed. This allows us quickly to see how many pages the notes will "
"take up."
msgstr "Sers aḍris am akken yettwazen send. Maca ad seqdceɣ Autoflow tikkelt-a. Autoflow ad isnulfu s wudem awurman tinkarin n uḍris timaynutin d yisebtar imaynuten armi ara yettwasers aḍris meṛṛa. Aya yettaǧǧa-aɣ ad nwali s tazzla acḥal n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef tizmilin."

msgid "This is how to use Autoflow."
msgstr "Wagi d wamek ara tseqdceḍ Autoflow."

msgid ""
"When you are about the click where you want the text to go, keep the Shift "
"key down."
msgstr "Mi ara tebɣiḍ ad tsit anda ara iṛuḥ uḍris, eǧǧ tqeffalt Shift teṭṭef."

msgid ""
"I can now roughly see the total number of pages that the notes will take up."
msgstr "Zemreɣ ad wali tura s wudem azeggaɣ amḍan n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef tizmilin."

msgid "This is sufficient for an estimate."
msgstr "Wagi yeɣla i uḥsab."

msgid ""
"Let us now find out how many pages the main text body is likely to take up."
msgstr "Tura ad nwali acḥal n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef agdil agejdan n uḍris."

msgid "The text is in the file called 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."
msgstr "Aḍris yella deg ufaylu i d-yettwasemman 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."

msgid "Place this text and use Autoflow."
msgstr "Sers aḍris-a u seqdec Autoflow."

msgid ""
"It appears that, on my system, all text cannot be placed at once. It will "
"cut off after some point."
msgstr "Yettban belli, ɣef unagraw-iw, aḍris meṛṛa ur izmir ara ad yettwasers yiwet n tikkelt. Ad yettwagzem deffir kra n wadig."

msgid "I will place 01_Genesis_text_and_note_citations.odt instead."
msgstr "Ad sersɣ 01_Genesis_text_and_note_citations.odt deg wadeg-is."

msgid ""
"I can now roughly see the total number of pages that the text of Genesis "
"will take up."
msgstr "Zemreɣ ad wali tura s wudem azeggaɣ amḍan n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef uḍris n Genesis."

msgid ""
"The size of the whole Bible is about 22 times more than the size of Genesis."
msgstr "Teɣzi n Tira iqedsen meṛṛa d azal n 22 n tikkal ugar n teɣzi n Genesis."

msgid ""
"The font is of particular influence on the page count. This is not dealt "
"with here."
msgstr "Tasefsit tesɛa tazmert tameqqrant ɣef umḍan n yisebtar. Aya ur nettwali ara dagi."

msgid "Editing a paragraph style"
msgstr "Abeddel n tɣessa n taseddart"

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, and placing this text into "
"InDesign, the USFM styles appear in InDesign."
msgstr "Mbaɛd asifeḍ n uḍris USFM ɣer OpenDocument, u asersu n uḍris-a deg InDesign, tɣessiwin USFM ttbanen deg InDesign."

msgid ""
"For example, normal paragraphs usually have style 'p', and section heading "
"'s'."
msgstr "Amedya, tiseddarin tamagnuyin sɛant tɣessa 'p', u azwel n tigzemt 's'."

msgid ""
"If you like to update a paragraph style, you may update each section heading "
"individually, but this is a lot of work. It is faster to update the style "
"for 's', so that this updates all paragraphs that have this style."
msgstr "Ma tebɣiḍ ad tleqqmeḍ tɣessa n taseddart, tzemreḍ ad tleqqmeḍ yal azwel n tgezmi s wudem yemgaraden, maca aya d axeddim ameqqran. Yelha ad teleqqmeḍ tɣessa n 's', iwakken ad yeleqqem tiseddarin meṛṛa i yesɛan tɣessa-a."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, place the cursor in it, and on the palette "
"choose Paragraph Styles. Right-click the style you want and choose Edit."
msgstr "I wakken ad tleqqmeḍ tɣessa n taseddart, sers aḍfar deg-s, u deg usebtar fren Tɣessiwin n taseddart. Sit s yiffus ayeffus ɣef tɣessa i tebɣiḍ u fren Ẓreg."

msgid ""
"Section headings look better after ticking ‘Balance ragged lines’ in the "
"paragraph options."
msgstr "Izwal n tgezmi ttbanen yelhan ugar mbaɛd ma tcrḍeḍ ‘Balance ragged lines’ deg yifernen n taseddart."

msgid "Running headers"
msgstr "Izwal n yizirig"

msgid ""
"The Bible will have running headers. The headers contain the page number "
"near the inside margin. At the right margin it shows book and chapter "
"numbers on that page."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen ad tesɛu izwal n yizirig. Izwal ad ṭṭfen uṭṭun n usebter qrib i uɣrim n daxel. Deg uɣrim ayeffus yeskan uṭṭunen n udlis d uxef deg usebter-nni."

msgid "Enter the page numbers on the master pages."
msgstr "Sekcem uṭṭunen n yisebtar deg yisebtar imeqqranen."

msgid "On the Pages palette, double-click the master pages."
msgstr "Deg usebtar, sit snat n tikkal ɣef yisebtar imeqqranen."

msgid ""
"On the left master page, create a text frame, and enter the page number at "
"the inside margin."
msgstr "Deg usebter ameqqran azelmaḍ, snulfu tenkarant n uḍris, u sekcem uṭṭun n usebter ɣer uɣrim n daxel."

msgid ""
"Page numbers can be found in menu Type / Insert Special Character / Marker / "
"Current Page Number."
msgstr "Uṭṭunen n yisebtar zemren ad ttwafen deg wumuɣ Aru / Sekcem asekkil uzzig / Tacreḍt / Uṭṭun n usebter amiran."

msgid ""
"On the right master page, create a text frame, and enter the page number at "
"the inside margin too."
msgstr "Deg usebter ameqqran ayeffus, snulfu tenkarant n uḍris, u sekcem uṭṭun n usebter ɣer uɣrim n daxel daɣen."

msgid ""
"On page 1, create a new text frame at the top, and put the book and chapter "
"at the outside margin."
msgstr "Deg usebter 1, snulfu tenkarant n uḍris tamaynut deg ufella, u err adlis d uxef ɣer uɣrim n beṛṛa."

msgid "This text frame can be copied to each odd page as it is generated."
msgstr "Tenkarant n uḍris-a tezmer ad tettwanɣel ɣer yal asebter n wuḍfir mi ara yettwasnulfu."

msgid "The same applies for page 2, and any subsequent even pages."
msgstr "Ayen yellan ɣef waya yeṭṭef i usebter 2, d yisebtar-nniḍen n wuḍfir."

msgid "The page where a book starts normally does not display a page number."
msgstr "Asebter anda yebda adlis s wudem amagnu ur d-yesken ara uṭṭun n usebter."

msgid ""
"In order to do that, apply master page [None] to that particular page."
msgstr "I wakken ad txedmeḍ aya, snes asebter ameqqran [Ulac] ɣer usebter-nni."

msgid "Space between drop caps and text"
msgstr "Talunt gar yisekkilen imeqqranen d uḍris"

msgid ""
"It may be visually pleasant to have some space between the drop caps chapter "
"numbers and the text beside it."
msgstr "Izmer ad yili d ilhan i wallaɣ ad tesɛuḍ kra n tallunt gar yisekkilen imeqqranen n uṭṭunen n yixfawen d uḍris yellan ɣer yidis-nsen."

msgid ""
"All that is needed is a fixed space after the chapter numbers. Pick any one "
"from a hair space to an em space. The number of characters in drop caps is "
"now increased by one. Set this value in the drop cap settings. All lines "
"after the first will automatically line up."
msgstr "Ayen ilaqen d talunt yettwasbadun deffir yuṭṭunen n yixfawen. Fren yiwet ɣef yiwet seg talunt tafessast ɣer talunt n em. Amḍan n yisekkilen deg yisekkilen imeqqranen yettwarna s yiwen. Sbadu azal-a deg yiɣewwaṛen n yisekkilen imeqqranen. Izirigen meṛṛa mbaɛd win amezwaru ad ttwasentṭen s wudem awurman."

msgid "Managing widows or orphans"
msgstr "Asefrek n tzuri d yeɛzaren"

msgid ""
"Widows and orphans are words or short lines at the beginning or end of a "
"paragraph, which are left dangling at the top or bottom of a column, "
"separated from the rest of the paragraph."
msgstr "Tizuri d yeɛzaren d awalen neɣ izirigen imecṭuḥen deg tazwara neɣ taggara n taseddart, i yettwaǧǧan ttdeggren deg ufella neɣ deg wadda n tgejdit, yebḍan ɣef wayen yeqqimen n taseddart."

msgid ""
"There is some disagreement about the definitions of widow and orphan; what "
"one calls a widow the other calls an orphan."
msgstr "Llan kra n tmgirad ɣef yimasalen n tzurit d uɛzar; ayen i s-yettaru yiwen azuri, wayeḍ yettaru-yas aɛzar."

msgid "There are some ways to avoid widows or orphans."
msgstr "Llan kra n yibriden i wakken ad nettekkes tizuri neɣ yeɛzaren."

msgid ""
"- Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser "
"paragraphs."
msgstr "- Beddel talunt gar wawalen i wakken ad d-tesnulfuḍ tiseddarin ɣer tizdayin neɣ ɣer tilmatin."

msgid ""
"- Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified "
"paragraphs this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it "
"looking too out of place."
msgstr "- Beddel aḍfar n uḍris. Wagi d talunt tamatut n yisekkilen deg taseddart neɣ ɣef yizirig. S tsefsit tilhant deg tiseddarin yettwasenṭen wagi izmer ad yettwabeddel arma d -25 neɣ +15 war ma yettban d ayen ur nelli ara deg wadeg-is."

msgid "- Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."
msgstr "- Beddel aṭṭekkul n wawalen deg taseddart."

msgid "- Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."
msgstr "- Rẓem awal ɣer yizirig i d-iteddun s tmeẓṛiwt tamlellayt."

msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "Aselkim"

msgid "Here is a sample script."
msgstr "Ha-t-an umedya n uselkim."

msgid "It runs in InDesign."
msgstr "Yettwaseqdac deg InDesign."

msgid "It shows how to replace text, and how to update the formatting."
msgstr "Yeskan amek ara tbeddleḍ aḍris, u amek ara tleqqmeḍ amasal."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Ubuntu"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Ubuntu"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit."
msgstr "Ḍfer iḥricen-a ddaw-a i wakken ad tsebdeḍ Bibledit."

msgid "Open a terminal."
msgstr "Ldi tanafit."

msgid "On older versions of Ubuntu, or to get updated Bibledit software:"
msgstr "Ɣef yilqamen iqburen n Ubuntu, neɣ i wakken ad d-tawiḍ aseɣzan n Bibledit amaynut:"

msgid "Add the Bibledit repository:"
msgstr "Rnu akaram n yisefka n Bibledit:"

msgid "As of Ubuntu 18.04, the above is no longer needed."
msgstr "Seg Ubuntu 18.04, ayen n ufella ur yelli ara d ilaq."

msgid "Read the repository:"
msgstr "Ɣeṛ akaram n yisefka:"

msgid "Install Bibledit:"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit:"

msgid "Bibledit can be started from the menu."
msgstr "Bibledit izmer ad yettwabdu seg wumuɣ."

msgid "More information:"
msgstr "Ugar n talɣut:"

msgid "The Notes are an important part of Consultations."
msgstr "Tizmilin d aḥric ameqqran n Yimɛiwanen."

msgid ""
"The notes help to record the discussions with consultants and other people."
msgstr "Tizmilin ttallalent deg uḥraz n yidiwenniyen d yimɛiwanen d yimdanen-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"Normally, when going to the Consultation Notes, you will see a list of notes."
msgstr "S wudem amagnu, mi ara teddiḍ ɣer Tizmilin n Umɛiwen, ad twaliḍ tabdart n tizmilin."

msgid "It would say, for example: Displaying notes 1 - 5 / 5."
msgstr "Ad d-yini amedya: Askan n tizmilin 1 - 5 / 5."

msgid "This means that it would display notes 1 to 5, out of 5 notes total."
msgstr "Aya yeɛni belli ad d-yesken tizmilin seg 1 ɣer 5, seg 5 n tizmilin meṛṛa."

msgid "You can edit the display."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tẓergeḍ askan."

msgid ""
"That means that you can edit the number of notes that will display in that "
"list."
msgstr "Aya yeɛni belli tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ amḍan n tizmilin ara d-yettwaskanen deg tebdart-a."

msgid "Clicking [edit] takes you to a new page, called Edit Notes Display."
msgstr "Asit ɣef [ẓreg] ad k-yawi ɣer usebter amaynut, i d-yettwasemman Ẓreg askan n tizmilin."

msgid ""
"This enables you to edit how the notes will be displayed, and how many."
msgstr "Aya ittaǧǧa-k ad tẓergeḍ amek ara d-banent tizmilin, u acḥal."

msgid "The first thing that you can edit is how many notes will be selected."
msgstr "Tamsalt tamezwarut i izemren ad tt-tẓergeḍ d acḥal n tizmilin ara yettwafernen."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to any passage, then notes will be selected "
"that refer to any passage, from Genesis to Revelation."
msgstr "Ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yerzan yal tafyirt, imiren tizmilin ara yettwafernen ad yerzent yal tafyirt, seg Genesis armi d Tuɣalin."

msgid ""
"But when you select notes that refer to the current verse, then only those "
"notes will be selected that refer to the currently opened verse."
msgstr "Maca mi ara tferneḍ tizmilin i yerzan tafyirt tamirant, imiren d tizmilin kan i yerzan tafyirt tamusrint ara yettwafernen."

msgid ""
"In case you have Genesis 2.2 open in the navigator, then only notes that "
"refer to that particular verse are displayed."
msgstr "Ma yella tesɛiḍ Genesis 2.2 yeldin deg unaway, imiren tizmilin kan i yerzan tafyirt-nni i d-ttbanent."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that have been edited at any time, then all notes would "
"be selected."
msgstr "Ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yettwaẓergen deg yal akud, imiren tizmilin meṛṛa ad ttwafernent."

msgid ""
"But when you select notes that have been edited on Today, then only today's "
"notes are displayed."
msgstr "Maca ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yettwaẓergen Ass-a, imiren d tizmilin n ass-a kan i d-ttbanent."

msgid ""
"The note selection mechanism combines all selection methods that have been "
"set."
msgstr "Anagraw n ufran n tizmilin yeddukkel akk tarrayin n ufran i yettwasbadun."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to the current verse, for example, and that "
"have been edited today, and only those notes that both refer to the current "
"verse, and that also have been edited today, are displayed."
msgstr "Ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yerzan tafyirt tamirant, amedya, u yettwaẓergen ass-a, d tizmilin kan i yerzan tafyirt tamirant u i yettwaẓergen ass-a i d-ttbanent."

msgid "There are other notes selection mechanisms as well."
msgstr "Llan daɣen tarrayin-nniḍen n ufran n tizmilin."

msgid "See the relevant page for all selection mechanisms."
msgstr "Wali asebter yerzan akk tarrayin n ufran."

msgid ""
"Things should be plain and there should be no need for any further "
"information."
msgstr "Tiɣawsiwin ilaq ad ilint d tilemmasin u ur yelli ara ilaq n talɣut-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"One thing that would need explanation would be the mechanism that selects "
"notes that contain certain text."
msgstr "Yiwen n wayen ilaqen aglam d unagraw i yettafren tizmilin i yesɛan aḍris yettwabren."

msgid "This is intended to be used to search notes for text."
msgstr "Aya yettwaxdem i unadi deg tizmilin ɣef uḍris."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that contain Any text, then searching for text in the "
"note is not done."
msgstr "Ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yesɛan Yal aḍris, imiren unadi n uḍris deg tezmilt ur yettwaxdem ara."

msgid ""
"Searching for text can be done by selecting notes that contain specific "
"words or text."
msgstr "Unadi n uḍris izmer ad yettwaxdem s ufran n tizmilin i yesɛan awalen neɣ aḍris yettwabren."

msgid ""
"When you select this option, you will see that an entry becomes visible."
msgstr "Mi ara tferneḍ afran-a, ad twaliḍ belli yiwen n usekcem yettban."

msgid "Search text should be entered there."
msgstr "Aḍris n unadi ilaq ad yettwaru dinna."

msgid "Then the Save button should be pressed."
msgstr "Syin tqeffalt Sekles ilaq ad tettwassed."

msgid "This is to save that search text."
msgstr "Aya i usekles n uḍris-a n unadi."

msgid ""
" Or just pressing Enter while the cursor is in that entry will do also."
msgstr " Neɣ kan assed ɣef Kcem mi ara yili uḍfar deg usekcem-a ad yeṣṣeḥ daɣen."

msgid ""
"When you search for, for example, 'house', then notes that contain the word "
"'house' will be selected."
msgstr "Mi ara tnadiḍ, amedya, 'axxam', imiren tizmilin i yesɛan awal 'axxam' ad ttwafernent."

msgid ""
"Notes that contain the word 'houses' (in plural) would not be selected."
msgstr "Tizmilin i yesɛan awal 'ixxamen' (deg wuṭṭun amatu) ur ttwafernent ara."

msgid "To select this plural form, you can use wildcards."
msgstr "I wakken ad tferneḍ talɣa-a n uṭṭun amatu, tzemreḍ ad tesseqdceḍ ticraḍin n wuzzal."

msgid "Instead of entering 'house, enter 'house*'."
msgstr "Deg wadeg n usekcem n 'axxam, sekcem 'axxam*'."

msgid "Notice the asterisk."
msgstr "Ẓer asteriks."

msgid "This will select notes that contains the word 'house' or 'houses."
msgstr "Aya ad yefren tizmilin i yesɛan awal 'axxam' neɣ 'ixxamen."

msgid "You can also enter two or more words to search for."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tsekcmeḍ sin neɣ ugar n wawalen i unadi."

msgid ""
"The search routine will then do its best to select these notes that contain "
"some or all of these words."
msgstr "Unadi ad yexdem ayen izemren i wakken ad yefren tizmilin-a i yesɛan kra neɣ akk awalen-a."

msgid ""
"Notes that contain all words are given first, and notes that contains only "
"one or a few of the words will be given later."
msgstr "Tizmilin i yesɛan akk awalen ttwafk send, u tizmilin i yesɛan kan yiwen neɣ kra n wawalen ad ttwafk mbaɛd."

msgid ""
"If you select notes that refer to the current verse, and then also search "
"for some text, then only the notes that refer to the current verse would be "
"searched."
msgstr "Ma tferneḍ tizmilin i yerzan tafyirt tamirant, u tnadiḍ daɣen ɣef kra n uḍris, imiren tizmilin kan i yerzan tafyirt tamirant ara yettwanadin."

msgid "It is important to be aware of this."
msgstr "Yeɣla ad tissineḍ aya."

msgid ""
"At times one may search for words or phrases, and get zero results, yet he "
"is sure that there should be some results."
msgstr "Kra n tikkal yiwen yezmer ad inadi awalen neɣ tinfaliyin, u ur d-yufi ara akk iɣmisen, maca yeṭṭef belli yessefk ad llan kra n yigmuḍen."

msgid ""
"This would happen because the user does not search the whole Bible, but only "
"the current verse."
msgstr "Aya yeḍra acku aseqdac ur yettnadi ara deg Tira iqedsen meṛṛa, maca kan deg tefyirt tamirant."

msgid "The same applies to other selection mechanisms."
msgstr "Ayen yellan ɣef waya yeṭṭef ɣer tarrayin-nniḍen n ufran."

msgid ""
"Therefore, when searching notes for text, you may want to set all other "
"selection mechanisms to Any."
msgstr "Ɣef waya, mi ara tnadiḍ deg tizmilin ɣef uḍris, tzemreḍ ad tsbaduḍ tarrayin-nniḍen meṛṛa n ufran ɣer Yal yiwen."

msgid "There is more that can be said about searching notes."
msgstr "Llan ugar n wayen ara yettwaqqen ɣef unadi deg tizmilin."

msgid "The wildcard operator already has been mentioned."
msgstr "Amsawaḍ n wuzzal yettwabder yakan."

msgid "Here is a list of possible operators:"
msgstr "Ha-t-an tabdart n yimsawaḍen izemren ad llin:"

msgid ""
"By default, when no operator specified, the word is optional, but the result "
"that contain it will be rated higher."
msgstr "S wudem amezwer, mi ara ulac amsawaḍ i yettwasbadun, awal d uferrig, maca igmuḍen i yesɛan-t ad ttwaḥsben d ugar."

msgid ""
"A leading plus sign indicates that this word must be present in every result "
"returned."
msgstr "Tacreḍt n tmerna deg tazwara tesken belli awal-a ilaq ad yili deg yal agmuḍ i d-yettwarran."

msgid ""
"A leading minus sign indicates that this word must not be present in any "
"result returned."
msgstr "Tacreḍt n tukksa deg tazwara tesken belli awal-a ur ilaq ara ad yili deg ula yiwen n ugmuḍ i d-yettwarran."

msgid ""
"A leading tilde acts as a negation operator, causing the word's contribution "
"to the result relevance to be negative."
msgstr "Tacreḍt n tmerna n yiɣer tettxeddem am amsawaḍ n tuggdiyin, d ayen ara yerren azal n uwal deg usentel n ugmuḍ d anegzum."

msgid "It's useful for marking noise words."
msgstr "Yelha i uṣerrew n wawalen n uḍbel."

msgid ""
"A result that contains such a word will be rated lower than others, but will "
"not be excluded altogether, as it would be with the minus operator."
msgstr "Agmuḍ i yesɛan awal am wa ad yettwaḥseb d ukessar ɣef wiyaḍ, maca ur d-yettwakkes ara akk, am akken yella s umsawaḍ n tukksa."

msgid "An asterisk is the wildcard operator."
msgstr "Asteriks d amsawaḍ n uzzuzal."

msgid ""
"Unlike the other operators, it is appended to the word, or fragment, not "
"prepended."
msgstr "Yemgarad ɣef yimsawaḍen-nniḍen, yettwarna ɣer wawal, neɣ aḥric, mačči send-s."

msgid ""
"This means that if there is a note with the word 'house', and you search for "
"'*ouse', this note will not be selected."
msgstr "Aya yeɛni belli ma tella tezmilt s wawal 'axxam', u tnadiḍ ɣef '*xxam', tazmilt-a ur tettwafren ara."

msgid "Yes, this is unusual, but this is how the database search works."
msgstr "Ih, aya d ayen ur nelli ara d amagnu, maca wagi d wamek ara yettxeddem unadi n taffa n yisefka."

msgid ""
"To minimize the pain of this, measures have been taken that if you type any "
"part of the word, the expected result will still be found."
msgstr "I usenqes n waya, nexdem tiɣawsiwin akken ma yella tsekcmeḍ kra n uḥric n wawal, agmuḍ i yettwarǧun ad d-yettwaf daɣen."

msgid ""
"Double quotes at the beginning and end of a phrase, gives only the notes "
"that contain the complete phrase, as it was typed."
msgstr "Tiwenniyin tuẓẓinin deg tazwara d taggara n tefyirt, tefk kan tizmilin i yesɛan tafyirt meṛṛa, am akken tettwaru."

msgid "Each note can be assigned to somebody."
msgstr "Yal tazmilt tezmer ad tettwabren i yiwen."

msgid ""
"The person to whom the note is assigned then knows that action should be "
"taken on this note."
msgstr "Amdan i yettwabren fell-as tazmilt yeẓra imiren belli ilaq ad yexdem kra n tigawt fell-as."

msgid "Or the person can be automatically emailed if the note gets changed."
msgstr "Neɣ amdan-nni izmer ad yettwazen imayl s wudem awurman ma yella tazmilt tettwabeddel."

msgid "The Consultation Notes can partly be operated by email."
msgstr "Tizmilin n Umɛiwen zemrent ad ddunt s wudem aḥric s yimayl."

msgid ""
"When you receive an email from Bibledit, and this email contains a "
"Consultation Note, then you can reply to this email."
msgstr "Mi ara teṭṭfeḍ imayl seg Bibledit, u imayl-a yesɛa Tazmilt n Umɛiwen, tzemreḍ ad terreḍ ɣer imayl-a."

msgid ""
"Your reply will be added as a comment to this particular Consultation Note."
msgstr "Tiririt-ik ad tettwarnu am awennit ɣer Tezmilt-a n Umɛiwen."

msgid ""
"The reply should come from the email address which you registered with "
"Bibledit when you created your  account."
msgstr "Tiririt ilaq ad d-tefk seg tansa n imayl i tsekcmeḍ deg Bibledit mi ara tesnulfuḍ amiḍan-ik."

msgid "The reply should also have (CSID123456789) in the subject line."
msgstr "Tiririt ilaq daɣen ad tesɛu (CSID123456789) deg yizirig n usentel."

msgid "The number 123456789 is a Consultation Note Identifier."
msgstr "Uṭṭun 123456789 d asulay n Tezmilt n Umɛiwen."

msgid "It is different for every Note."
msgstr "Yemgarad i yal tazmilt."

msgid ""
"Just replying to a Consultation Note you received is usually all that is "
"needed."
msgstr "Kan tiririt ɣer Tezmilt n Umɛiwen i d-teṭṭfeḍ s wudem amagnu ayen ilaqen."

msgid "Only replies that are typed before the quoted text are considered."
msgstr "Kan tririyin yettwarun send aḍris yettwabder ara yettwaḥsben."

msgid "This is called top-posting."
msgstr "Wagi yettwasemma top-posting."

msgid ""
"When the quoted text gets posted too, then it is necessary to remove that "
"from your email reply."
msgstr "Mi ara d-yettwazen aḍris yettwabder daɣen, ilaq ad t-tekkseḍ seg tririt n imayl-ik."

msgid "You can also submit a new Consultation Note by email."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tazneḍ Tazmilt n Umɛiwen tamaynut s imayl."

msgid "This is how to do it:"
msgstr "Wagi d wamek ara txedmeḍ aya:"

msgid "Create a new email to the site's email address."
msgstr "Snulfu imayl amaynut ɣer tansa n imayl n usmel."

msgid ""
"The subject line contains 'New note', then the passage, and finally the "
"summary."
msgstr "Izirig n usentel yesɛa 'Tazmilt tamaynut', syin tafyirt, u taggara agzul."

msgid "The body of the email will be the first comment on that note."
msgstr "Tadda n imayl ad tili d awennit amezwaru ɣef tezmilt-a."

msgid "Lean Bible translation management"
msgstr "Asefrek ilɣaḍ n tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen"

msgid "What is lean management?"
msgstr "D acu i d asefrek ilɣaḍ?"

msgid ""
"Lean management is about the systematic pursuit of desired translation "
"competence and conditions by utilizing human capabilities in a coordinated "
"manner."
msgstr "Asefrek ilɣaḍ yerza anadi imṣaḍan n tezmert d tegnatin n tsuqilt s useqdec n tezmert n yimdanen s wudem amsedday."

msgid "Two things are essential for this:"
msgstr "Sin n tɣawsiwin ilaqen i waya:"

msgid "Developing desired conditions."
msgstr "Asnerni n tegnatin yellan."

msgid "Developing capable people who can develop the desired conditions."
msgstr "Asnerni n yimdanen izemren ad snernin tegnatin yellan."

msgid "External reference"
msgstr "Aɣbalu n beṛṛa"

msgid "Bibledit software"
msgstr "Aseɣzan Bibledit"

msgid "Copyright (©) 2003-2025 Teus Benschop."
msgstr "Azerf n umeskar (©) 2003-2025 Teus Benschop."

msgid ""
"This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it "
"under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free "
"Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) "
"any later version."
msgstr "Ahil-a d aseɣzan ilelli: tzemreḍ ad t-tazneḍ i tikelt-nniḍen u/neɣ ad t-tbeddleḍ s tmerna n tewtilin n Turagt Tamatut n GNU am akken tt-yessuffeɣ Tasbeddit n Tsemlit Tilelli, ama lqem 3 n turagt, neɣ (s ufran-ik) lqem yellan deffir-s."

msgid ""
"This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but without "
"any warranty; without even the implied warranty of merchantability or "
"fitness for a particular purpose. See the GNU General Public License for "
"more details."
msgstr "Ahil-a yettwabḍa s tamṣaḍa ad yelhu, maca war ula d yiwen n wuḍmen; war ula d aḍmen uffir n tzenzit neɣ n usnadi i wazal ibanen. Wali Turagt Tamatut n GNU i ugar n talɣut."

msgid ""
"You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with "
"this program. See also"
msgstr "Ilaq ad tesɛuḍ tanɣalt n Turagt Tamatut n GNU yeddan d ahil-a. Wali daɣen"

msgid "ETCBC4 Hebrew text database"
msgstr "Taffa n yisefka n Tebrit ETCBC4"

msgid ""
"The ETCBC database of the Hebrew Bible contains the scholarly text of the "
"Hebrew Bible with linguistic markup."
msgstr "Taffa n yisefka ETCBC n Tira iqedsen n Tebrit tesɛa aḍris n uselmed n Tira iqedsen n Tebrit s yimsal n tutlayt."

msgid "Original data source:"
msgstr "Aɣbalu aẓar n yisefka:"

msgid "Bibledit's data source:"
msgstr "Aɣbalu n yisefka n Bibledit:"

msgid "SHEBANQ, a search engine for the Hebrew Bible"
msgstr "SHEBANQ, amsedday n unadi i Tira iqedsen n Tebrit"

msgid "License:"
msgstr "Turagt:"

msgid "Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License"
msgstr "Turagt Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International"

msgid "You may not use the data for commercial applications without consent."
msgstr "Ur tzemreḍ ara ad tesqedceḍ isefka i yisnasen n useddu war tamurt."

msgid "Other code and data"
msgstr "Tangalt d yisefka-nniḍen"

msgid ""
"All the code and data included in Bibledit that does not fall in the above "
"license categories has been licensed as mentioned in various bits of source "
"code included in Bibledit."
msgstr "Tangalt akked yisefka meṛṛa i yellan deg Bibledit ur yeqqimen ara deg taggayin n turagin n ufella ttwasirgen am akken yella deg kra n yiḥricen n tangalt aɣbalu yellan deg Bibledit."

msgid "See the source code repository."
msgstr "Wali akaram n yisefka n tangalt aɣbalu."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud from a package"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit Cloud seg uɣaz"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Ḍfer iḥricen-a ddaw-a i wakken ad tsebdeḍ Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Step"
msgstr "Aḥric"

msgid ""
"Install fixed version of Bibledit as it comes with the operating system."
msgstr "Sbedd lqem usbiḍ n Bibledit am akken d-yusa d unagraw n usenqed."

msgid "Install most recent version of Bibledit."
msgstr "Sbedd lqem amaynut n Bibledit."

msgid "Install required software:"
msgstr "Sbedd aseɣzan ilaqen:"

msgid "Bibledit will be accessible through the IP address port 8080."
msgstr "Bibledit ad yettwaweḍ s tcuṭṭut 8080 n tansa IP."

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Imedyaten:"

msgid ""
"Open the web address in a browser, follow the instructions on the screen to "
"configure Bibledit Cloud, and log in."
msgstr "Ldi tansa web deg yiminig, ḍfer iwellihen ɣef ugdil i usbadu n Bibledit Cloud, u qqen."

msgid "The following command shows the status of Bibledit Cloud:"
msgstr "Taladna-a tesken addad n Bibledit Cloud:"

msgid "Install Bibledit on Windows"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Windows"

msgid "Bibledit runs on Windows 10 and 11."
msgstr "Bibledit yetteddu ɣef Windows 10 d 11."

msgid "Install Bibledit."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit."

msgid "Start it through the menu."
msgstr "Bdu-t s wumuɣ."

msgid "Give it enough time to download all the data from Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Eǧǧ-it kra n wakud i wakken ad isider isefka meṛṛa seg Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Bibledit is now ready for online and offline use."
msgstr "Bibledit yewjed tura i useqdec s tuqqna d war tuqqna."

msgid ""
"There's a version for better performance and battery life on Windows on Arm."
msgstr "Llan lqem i wanect yelhan ugar d tmezzit n tabaṭri ɣef Windows ɣef Arm."

msgid "Bibledit runs a number of checks on the text of the Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit yexdem kra n yisenqad ɣef uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "It does that every night."
msgstr "Yexdem aya yal iḍ."

msgid "Act on the results of the checks."
msgstr "Xdem ayen ilaqen s yigmuḍen n yisenqad."

msgid "Receive the results by email."
msgstr "Ṭṭef igmuḍen s imayl."

msgid "Notes."
msgstr "Tizmilin."

msgid "You deal with checks on the Bibles you have write access to."
msgstr "Tesɛiḍ ayen yerzan isenqad n Tira iqedsen i tesɛiḍ anekcum n tira ɣer-sent."

msgid "Install Bibledit iOS"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit iOS"

msgid "Install Bibledit via the App Store."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit s App Store."

msgid "This works on an iPad or an iPhone running iOS 12 or higher."
msgstr "Aya yetteddu ɣef iPad neɣ iPhone s iOS 12 neɣ ugar."

msgid "Hint."
msgstr "Tikti."

msgid "Switch off backup of Bibledit to iCloud via iOS."
msgstr "Sens aḥraz n Bibledit ɣer iCloud s iOS."

msgid "Bibledit Cloud already backs up Bibledit iOS."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud yeḥrez yakan Bibledit iOS."

msgid "If there were two backup mechanisms, that might  clash."
msgstr "Ma llan sin n tarrayin n uḥraz, ahat ad msaren."

msgid "Read more."
msgstr "Ɣeṛ ugar."

msgid "Bibledit can host many Bibles."
msgstr "Bibledit izmer ad yeṭṭef aṭas n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Many users can create an account."
msgstr "Aṭas n yiseqdacen zemren ad snulfun amiḍan."

msgid ""
"A translation team is formed by giving a group of users access to a Bible."
msgstr "Agraw n tsuqilt yettwasnulfa s ufkan n unekcum i ugraw n yiseqdacen ɣer Tira iqedsen."

msgid "A user may be granted read-only access to a Bible, or write access."
msgstr "Aseqdac izmer ad d-yeṭṭef anekcum n tɣuri kan ɣer Tira iqedsen, neɣ anekcum n tira."

msgid "The type of access also depends on the role of a user."
msgstr "Anaw n unekcum yettwali daɣen tamlilt n useqdac."

msgid "Manage users."
msgstr "Sefrek iseqdacen."

msgid "Bibles can be made viewable by all users."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen zemrent ad ttwaskent i yiseqdacen akk."

msgid "Manage Bibles."
msgstr "Sefrek Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Typesetting in Scribus 1.4 or higher"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen deg Scribus 1.4 neɣ ugar"

msgid ""
"See the Scribus online help for more information and general principles."
msgstr "Wali tallalt n Scribus srid i ugar n talɣut d ɣrayen imatuten."

msgid "Typesetting in Scribus starts with creating a new document."
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen deg Scribus tebda s usnulfu n usemli amaynut."

msgid "Choose menu File / New."
msgstr "Fren umuɣ Afaylu / Amaynut."

msgid "Document Layout: Double Sided."
msgstr "Aɣessa n usemli: Sin n yiɣarsen."

msgid "To make the grid visible, go to menu View / Show Baseline Grid."
msgstr "I wakken ad d-tbanen takala, ddu ɣer wumuɣ Askan / Sken takala n yizirig."

msgid "Pick a Bible book, the version with text and note citations."
msgstr "Fren adlis n Tira iqedsen, lqem s uḍris d yitennaren n yizmilen."

msgid "Create a text frame in Scribus."
msgstr "Snulfu tenkarant n uḍris deg Scribus."

msgid "Add the text of the OpenDocument to this frame."
msgstr "Rnu aḍris n OpenDocument ɣer tenkarant-a."

msgid "I would like to place this extra text on a second page."
msgstr "Bɣiɣ ad sersɣ aḍris-a ugar ɣer usebter wis sin."

msgid "Create a new text frame on a new page."
msgstr "Snulfu tenkarant n uḍris tamaynut deg usebter amaynut."

msgid "Link the new text frame with the previous text frame."
msgstr "Qqen tenkarant n uḍris tamaynut d tenkarant n uḍris tuzwirt."

msgid ""
"There is still more text than fits on the second page. I estimate that there "
"is enough text to fill many pages."
msgstr "Mazal aḍris ugar n wayen izemren ad yeqqim ɣef usebter wis sin. Ḥseɣ belli llan aṭas n uḍris iwakken ad d-yeččur aṭas n yisebtar."

msgid "Place headlines"
msgstr "Sers izwal"

msgid "The headline I have in this example is:"
msgstr "Azwel i sɛiɣ deg umedya-a d:"

msgid "'The first book of Moses called Genesis'."
msgstr "'Adlis amezwaru n Musa i d-yettwasemman Genesis'."

msgid ""
"I'd like it to place it at the top of the page, and to span across any "
"columns."
msgstr "Bɣiɣ ad t-sersɣ deg ufella n usebter, u ad yezzi ɣef tgejdiyin meṛṛa."

msgid ""
"Select the relevant text frames, and drag the top to make it shorter, so "
"creating space above it."
msgstr "Fren tinkarin n uḍris iwatan, u jbed afella-sent i wakken ad tt-tserreḥeḍ, i usnulfu n tallunt ɣef-s."

msgid "Create a new text frame at the top of the page."
msgstr "Snulfu tenkarant n uḍris tamaynut deg ufella n usebter."

msgid "Estimate the size it needs to be."
msgstr "Ḥseb teɣzi i d-teḥwaǧ."

msgid "Paste the text into that text frame."
msgstr "Senteḍ aḍris deg tenkarant n uḍris-a."

msgid "Resize the text frame so it looks smart."
msgstr "Beddel teɣzi n tenkarant n uḍris i wakken ad d-tban tlelli."

msgid ""
"Then resize the main text frame or frames so that everything looks good."
msgstr "Syin beddel teɣzi n tenkarant (neɣ tinkarin) tagejdant n uḍris i wakken ad d-banen meṛṛa akken iwata."

msgid "Make the setting to align it to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Xdem iɣewwaṛen i usenti ɣer takala n yizirig."

msgid "The leading of the text should be equal to the baseline grid."
msgstr "Tallunt gar yizirigen n uḍris ilaq ad tili am takala n yizirig."

msgid ""
"If the leading of the text is bigger, then it is like as if you have double "
"line spacing."
msgstr "Ma yella tallunt gar yizirigen n uḍris tameqqrant, d akken tesɛiḍ tallunt tuẓẓint."

msgid "In this example, we expect an entire Bible to have about 1600 pages."
msgstr "Deg umedya-a, nettraǧu Tira iqedsen meṛṛa ad tesɛu qrib 1600 n yisebtar."

msgid "Create a new document in Scribus."
msgstr "Snulfu asemli amaynut deg Scribus."

msgid "Take the file with all notes in OpenDocument format."
msgstr "Awi afaylu s tizmilin meṛṛa s umasal OpenDocument."

msgid "It is 00_Bible_notes.odt."
msgstr "Yella d 00_Bible_notes.odt."

msgid "Place the text as described above."
msgstr "Sers aḍris am akken yettwazen send."

msgid ""
"Keep adding new text frames and linking them till all text has been placed."
msgstr "Kemmel timerna n tinkarin n uḍris timaynutin u aqqen-itent armi ara yettwasers uḍris meṛṛa."

msgid "This allows us to see how many pages the notes will take up."
msgstr "Aya yettaǧǧa-aɣ ad nwali acḥal n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef tizmilin."

msgid "Place this text in the same way as above."
msgstr "Sers aḍris-a am akken yettwaxdem ufella."

msgid "The font is of particular influence on the page count."
msgstr "Tasefsit tesɛa tazmert tameqqrant ɣef umḍan n yisebtar."

msgid "This is not dealt with here."
msgstr "Aya ur nettwali ara dagi."

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, and properly placing this text "
"into Scribus, the USFM styles appear in Scribus."
msgstr "Mbaɛd asifeḍ n uḍris USFM ɣer OpenDocument, u asersu akken iwata n uḍris-a deg Scribus, tɣessiwin USFM ttbanen deg Scribus."

msgid ""
"If you like to update a paragraph style, you may update each section heading "
"individually, but this is a lot of work."
msgstr "Ma tebɣiḍ ad tleqqmeḍ tɣessa n taseddart, tzemreḍ ad tleqqmeḍ yal azwel n tgezmi s wudem yemgaraden, maca aya d axeddim ameqqran."

msgid ""
"It is faster to update the style for 's', so that this updates all "
"paragraphs that have this style."
msgstr "Yelha ad teleqqmeḍ tɣessa n 's', iwakken ad yeleqqem tiseddarin meṛṛa i yesɛan tɣessa-a."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, place the cursor in it, and use the menu to "
"view or edit the style."
msgstr "I wakken ad tleqqmeḍ tɣessa n taseddart, sers aḍfar deg-s, u seqdec umuɣ i wakken ad twaliḍ neɣ ad tẓergeḍ tɣessa."

msgid "The Bible will have running headers."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen ad tesɛu izwal n yizirig."

msgid "The headers contain the page number near the inside margin."
msgstr "Izwal ṭṭfen uṭṭun n usebter qrib i uɣrim n daxel."

msgid "At the right margin it shows book and chapter numbers on that page."
msgstr "Deg uɣrim ayeffus yeskan uṭṭunen n udlis d uxef deg usebter-nni."

msgid "To do that, apply no master page to that particular page."
msgstr "I wakken ad txedmeḍ aya, ur tsenseḍ ara asebter ameqqran ɣef usebter-nni."

msgid "All that is needed is a fixed space after the chapter numbers."
msgstr "Ayen ilaqen d talunt yettwasbadun deffir yuṭṭunen n yixfawen."

msgid "Pick any one from a hair space to an em space."
msgstr "Fren yiwet ɣef yiwet seg talunt tafessast ɣer talunt n em."

msgid "The number of characters in drop caps is now increased by one."
msgstr "Amḍan n yisekkilen deg yisekkilen imeqqranen yettwarna s yiwen."

msgid "Set this value in the drop cap settings."
msgstr "Sbadu azal-a deg yiɣewwaṛen n yisekkilen imeqqranen."

msgid "All lines after the first will automatically line up."
msgstr "Izirigen meṛṛa mbaɛd win amezwaru ad ttwasentṭen s wudem awurman."

msgid ""
"Adjusting the spacing between words to produce tighter or looser paragraphs."
msgstr "Beddel talunt gar wawalen i wakken ad d-tesnulfuḍ tiseddarin ɣer tizdayin neɣ ɣer tilmatin."

msgid ""
"Adjusting the tracking of the text. This is the overall spacing of the "
"letters in a paragraph or on a line. With a good font in justified "
"paragraphs this can usually be adjusted by up to -25 or +15 without it "
"looking too out of place."
msgstr "Beddel aḍfar n uḍris. Wagi d talunt tamatut n yisekkilen deg taseddart neɣ ɣef yizirig. S tsefsit tilhant deg tiseddarin yettwasenṭen wagi izmer ad yettwabeddel arma d -25 neɣ +15 war ma yettban d ayen ur nelli ara deg wadeg-is."

msgid "Adjusting the hyphenation of words within the paragraph."
msgstr "Beddel aṭṭekkul n wawalen deg taseddart."

msgid "Forcing a word down onto the next line using a soft return."
msgstr "Rẓem awal ɣer yizirig i d-iteddun s tmeẓṛiwt tamlellayt."

msgid "Tips and Tricks"
msgstr "Iwellihen d tmuɣliwin"

msgid "Extensions and plugins"
msgstr "Isenfaren d yismal"

msgid "Browser extensions and plugins may interfere with Bibledit."
msgstr "Isenfaren n yiminigen d yismal zemren ad sɛewwiqen Bibledit."

msgid "There was a case that the USFM editor didn't load the text."
msgstr "Yella lḥala anda abeddel USFM ur yessali ara aḍris."

msgid "Disabling an extension in Chrome resolved it."
msgstr "Asensi n usenfar deg Chrome yesfeḍ ugur."

msgid "Enable consultants to view the Bible in a workspace"
msgstr "Eǧǧ inezgumen ad walin Tira iqedsen deg tallunt n umahil"

msgid ""
"Just add the desired Bible to the Resources through the link organizer."
msgstr "Kan rnu Tira iqedsen i tebɣiḍ ɣer Iɣbula s useɣwen n umsefrek."

msgid "Then add the Resources to the workspace through URL resource/index."
msgstr "Syin rnu Iɣbula ɣer tallunt n umahil s URL resource/index."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Aḥraz"

msgid "Bibledit does not do any backups of its own."
msgstr "Bibledit ur yexdim ula d aḥraz ucuddi n yiman-is."

msgid "Backup is very important."
msgstr "Aḥraz yewɛer aṭas."

msgid ""
"The system administrator should have a reliable backup strategy in place."
msgstr "Anedbal n unagraw ilaq ad yesɛu ustratiji n uḥraz yelhan."

msgid "Bibledit uses SQLite for data storage."
msgstr "Bibledit yesseqdac SQLite i uḥraz n yisefka."

msgid ""
"If a database is backed up while SQLite is storing data in it, the database "
"may get malformed."
msgstr "Ma yella taffa n yisefka tettwaḥrez mi ara isekles SQLite isefka deg-s, taffa n yisefka tezmer ad tuɣal d tameɣtut."

msgid "Information."
msgstr "Talɣut."

msgid "This applies to any database software, not just SQLite."
msgstr "Aya yettwaxdem i yal aseɣzan n taffa n yisefka, mačči SQLite kan."

msgid ""
"To accommodate backup, Bibledit does not access databases from 0:00 to 0:05 "
"at midnight."
msgstr "I wakken ad yettwaxdem uḥraz, Bibledit ur yettwaweḍ ara ɣer yifafen n yisefka seg 0:00 armi d 0:05 deg ɛeddi n yiḍ."

msgid ""
"If no users access Bibledit during that time, then there is no database "
"access at all."
msgstr "Ma yella ulac iseqdacen i d-yettwaweḍen ɣer Bibledit deg wakud-a, imiren ulac anekcum ɣer taffa n yisefka akk."

msgid "Backup can be safely done during that time."
msgstr "Aḥraz yezmer ad yettwaxdem s wudem aɣellsan deg wakud-a."

msgid "If syncing no longer works, check the Journal for clues."
msgstr "Ma yella umtawa ur yettxeddem ara ugar, senqed Aɣmis i wakken ad tafeḍ ayen yeḍran."

msgid "The Journal may indicate any of the following:"
msgstr "Aɣmis yezmer ad yesken yiwen seg wayen i d-iteddun:"

msgid "This may be resolved in two ways:"
msgstr "Aya yezmer ad yettwasefru s sin n yibriden:"

msgid ""
"Manually run the two commands in the appropriate directory from a terminal."
msgstr "Sker s ufus sin n teladnin deg ukaram iwatan seg tnafit."

msgid "Redo the setup of the Collaboration."
msgstr "Ales usbadu n Umɛiwen."

msgid "It will run those two commands for you."
msgstr "Ad yexdem sin n teladnin-nni i kečč."

msgid "Bible books in custom order"
msgstr "Idlisen n Tira iqedsen s umyalel yettwabeddlen"

msgid "To sort the Bible books in a custom order, do this:"
msgstr "I wakken ad tserseḍ idlisen n Tira iqedsen s umyalel yettwabeddlen, xdem aya:"

msgid "Go to menu Bible / Bibles."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Tira iqedsen / Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Select a Bible."
msgstr "Fren Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Go to Book order."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer Umyalel n yedlisen."

msgid "Drag the books into the desired order."
msgstr "Jbed idlisen ɣer umyalel yettwasuteren."

msgid "Font, text direction and writing mode of the Bible editors"
msgstr "Tasefsit, tanila n uḍris d askar n tira n yibeddlen n Tira iqedsen"

msgid ""
"To set the font, the text direction, or the writing mode for the Bible text "
"editors, do this:"
msgstr "I wakken ad tsbaduḍ tasefsit, tanila n uḍris, neɣ askar n tira i yibeddlen n uḍris n Tira iqedsen, xdem aya:"

msgid "Go to Font and text direction."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer Tasefsit d tanila n uḍris."

msgid "Make the settings."
msgstr "Xdem iɣewwaṛen."

msgid "Restore a Bible from a git repository"
msgstr "Err Tira iqedsen seg ukaram n yisefka git"

msgid ""
"A Bible that has been backed up to a git repository, can also be restored "
"again from that repository."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen yettwaḥrezen ɣer ukaram n yisefka git, tezmer daɣen ad tettwaɛawed seg ukaram n yisefka-nni."

msgid ""
"While linking this Bible to that repository afresh, take the Bible data from "
"that repository."
msgstr "Mi ara tqqneḍ Tira iqedsen-a ɣer ukaram n yisefka-nni i tikelt-nniḍen, awi isefka n Tira iqedsen seg ukaram n yisefka-nni."

msgid "That will restore the Bible."
msgstr "Aya ad yeɛawed Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"When there is a need to restore the Bible to an older commit in the "
"repository, copy the data from that older commit to the master branch, "
"commit it, then link this Bible afresh."
msgstr "Mi ara yili yesra ad teɛawdeḍ Tira iqedsen ɣer usentem aqbur deg ukaram n yisefka, nɣel isefka seg usentem aqbur ɣer ubrid agejdan, sentem-it, syin qqen Tira iqedsen-a i tikelt-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"When the Navigator is displayed, enter the passage to focus through the "
"keyboard."
msgstr "Mi ara d-yettwaskan Unaway, sekcem tafyirt ara tgeḍ fell-as asɣel s unasiw."

msgid "Escape"
msgstr "Escape"

msgid "Cancel any navigation or style operation."
msgstr "Sefsex yal tigawt n unnig neɣ n tɣessa."

msgid "Alt-Down Arrow"
msgstr "Alt-Aneɣruf Ɣer Wadda"

msgid "Navigate to the next verse."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer tefyirt i d-iteddun."

msgid "Alt-Up Arrow"
msgstr "Alt-Aneɣruf Ɣer Ufella"

msgid "Navigate to the previous verse."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer tefyirt yezrin."

msgid "Open the styles from the Bible editor."
msgstr "Ldi tɣessiwin seg ubeddel n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Find text."
msgstr "Af aḍris."

msgid "Find next."
msgstr "Af ayen i d-iteddun."

msgid "Print."
msgstr "Siggez."

msgid "Cycle through the available Bible editors."
msgstr "Ddu gar yibeddlen n Tira iqedsen yellan."

msgid "Scrum-based Translation"
msgstr "Tasuqilt s Scrum"

msgid "What is Scrum-based translation?"
msgstr "D acu i d tasuqilt s Scrum?"

msgid ""
"A translation team that works with Scrum frequently releases portions of "
"translated Scripture."
msgstr "Agraw n tsuqilt i yettmahalen s Scrum yettssuffu s tikkelt iḥricen n tira iqedsen yettwasuqlen."

msgid ""
"This makes it clear to involved parties where the translation project is "
"going."
msgstr "Aya ittbeyyin i yimdanen yettekkan ɣer wanida iteddu usenfar n tsuqilt."

msgid ""
"It enables the translation team to make course corrections based on the "
"facts."
msgstr "Yettaǧǧa agraw n tsuqilt ad ixdem ibeddlen n abrid almend n ṣṣeḥ."

msgid ""
"Burndown charts and the product backlog provide the product owner and others "
"with a permanent overview over the translation status and progress."
msgstr "Takersiwin n burndown d umeskar n yisefka n ufaris ttmuddunt i bab n ufaris d wiyaḍ asnas aɣelnaw ɣef waddad d usnerni n tsuqilt."

msgid ""
"Scrum is an agile process that enables self-organizing translation teams to "
"deliver high translation output and accuracy in a short time."
msgstr "Scrum d tarrayt n tmuɣli i ttaǧǧan igrawen n tsuqilt ad d-ssufɣen aṭas n tsuqilt taɣellsant deg wakud ameẓẓyan."

msgid ""
"Using iterative translation, it releases portions of translated Scripture "
"every iteration, say, every month."
msgstr "S tsuqilt s usenfali, tettssuffu iḥricen n tira iqedsen yettwasuqlen yal asenfali, ad nini, yal ayyur."

msgid ""
"At the end of the every sprint, anyone can see the translated portion, and "
"decide whether to release it to the congregations and community for feedback "
"or continue to enhance it."
msgstr "Deg taggara n yal asprint, yal yiwen izmer ad iwali aḥric yettwasuqlen, u ad yefru ma yella ad t-yessuffeɣ i tmetti i yiwen n tmuɣliwt neɣ ad ikemmel asnerni-s."

msgid ""
"The introduction and the following explanation just outlines the mechanics "
"of Scrum-based Translation."
msgstr "Tazwart d uzrar i d-iteddun kan ttmuddun tankulin n tsuqilt s Scrum."

msgid ""
"It does not make clear what difficulties and issues you will run into trying "
"to implement it."
msgstr "Ur d-ssken ara tuccḍa d tsuta ara ak-d-yekkes mi ara tɛerḍeḍ ad t-tsebdeḍ."

msgid "It only hints at the agile spirit that's required to make it work."
msgstr "Yeskan kan taɣessa n tmuɣli yettwasumeren iwakken ad yeddu."

msgid ""
"If you're interested in implementing Scrum-based translation, do some "
"reading, watch videos, follow a course, find a mentor or coach."
msgstr "Ma tehwiḍ asenfali n tsuqilt s Scrum, ɣer, ẓer tividyutin, ḍfer aselmed, af amɛiwan neɣ amnadi."

msgid "Product Owner"
msgstr "Bab n ufaris"

msgid "The Product Owner represents the stakeholders."
msgstr "Bab n ufaris yettwali ɣef yimkufaten."

msgid ""
"He or she is the voice of the target audience, that is the Bible reader."
msgstr "D awal n wid i d-iṭṭfen, d nutni imɣuran n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "He understands the requirements for the Bible."
msgstr "Yeẓra ayen ilaqen i Tira iqedsen."

msgid "The Product Owner may also be a group of people in a committee."
msgstr "Bab n ufaris yezmer ad yili d agraw n yimdanen deg tfekkit."

msgid ""
"He is responsible for ensuring that the team delivers accuracy and "
"reliability to the Bible translation."
msgstr "Yella d amsuɣel i usemmed belli agraw yettmuddu tameɣtut d wuḍmen i tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "He knows about accuracy and reliability."
msgstr "Yessen tameɣtut d wuḍmen."

msgid "He defines items that focus on desired features."
msgstr "Yessbadu iferdisen i yettwalin ɣer tmeẓẓayt yettwasumren."

msgid ""
"He makes decisions as to whether to implement footnotes or leave them out."
msgstr "Yettwali ma yella ad ssbadun tizmilin n uduɣ neɣ ad ten-yeǧǧ."

msgid ""
"In the same way, he defines other features, like headers, introductions, or "
"decides to leave them out."
msgstr "S wudem am wa, yessbadu timeẓẓayin-nniḍen, am izwal, tazwart, neɣ ad ten-yeǧǧ."

msgid "He decides about use or non-use of a dialect."
msgstr "Yesbadu aseqdec neɣ ur yeseqdac ara tutlayt n tmurt."

msgid "He sets the priorities for the work to be done."
msgstr "Yesbadu tisebtayin i uxeddim ara yettwaxdem."

msgid "He adds the items to the product backlog."
msgstr "Yerna iferdisen ɣer umeskar n yisefka n ufaris."

msgid "Scrum teams should have one Product Owner."
msgstr "Igrawen n Scrum ilaq ad sɛun yiwen n Bab n ufaris."

msgid ""
"The Product Owner may be part of the Translation Team, but it is recommended "
"that his role not be combined with the role of Scrum Master."
msgstr "Bab n ufaris yezmer ad yili d aḥric n Ugraw n Tsuqilt, maca yettwasumer ad ur yeddukkel ara tamlilt-is d tin n Scrum Master."

msgid "Release Planning"
msgstr "Asenfar n usuffeɣ"

msgid ""
"The release planning shows which parts of the Bible will be translated and "
"delivered during which Sprint."
msgstr "Asenfar n usuffeɣ yeskan anta iḥricen n Tira iqedsen ara yettwasuqlen u ara d-ttwakfen deg wanta Asprint."

msgid ""
"It is convenient to define a Sprint in months, so that the release planning "
"mentions January, February, and so on."
msgstr "Yelha ad tesbadeḍ Asprint s yiyyuren, iwakken asenfar n usuffeɣ ad d-yini Yennayer, Furar, d wayen-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"It is often helpful to stick the release planning to the wall so that "
"everybody can see the grand picture."
msgstr "Yelha aṭas ad tcebbeḍ asenfar n usuffeɣ ɣef yiɣed iwakken yal yiwen ad iwali tugna tameqqrant."

msgid "The advantages of a release planning are:"
msgstr "Imestawen n usenfar n usuffeɣ d:"

msgid ""
"1. It gives the team a common vision about what needs to be achieved, and "
"when."
msgstr "1. Yefka i ugraw tamuɣli tamatut ɣef wayen ilaqen ad yettwaxdem, u melmi."

msgid "2. It guides the team to make decisions during detailed planning."
msgstr "2. Yessiweḍ agraw ad yeṭṭef isenfaren deg usenfar anaẓi."

msgid "3. It helps prioritize the actions."
msgstr "3. Yettallal deg usbadu n tisebtayin n tigawin."

msgid ""
"4. It resolves conflicts and guides the teams toward the right balance on "
"trade-offs."
msgstr "4. Yessefru imgirad u yettawi igrawen ɣer twuri tameɣtut deg tarrayin."

msgid ""
"Release each completed Bible book to the community and get their feedback."
msgstr "Suffeɣ yal adlis n Tira iqedsen yemmden i tmetti u ṭṭef tikti-nsen."

msgid "This implements the important principle of continual improvement."
msgstr "Aya yeṭṭef ɣer ukala yelhan n usnerni ittkemmilen."

msgid "The release planning is a simple way of doing top-down planning."
msgstr "Asenfar n usuffeɣ d abrid fessus n usenfar seg ufella ɣer wadda."

msgid "It is an estimate, simple and quick to do."
msgstr "D aḥsab, d afessas u d aɣezzfan ad yettwaxdem."

msgid "It is based on the Product Backlog."
msgstr "Yeṭṭef ɣef umeskar n yisefka n ufaris."

msgid "Product Backlog"
msgstr "Umeskar n yisefka n ufaris"

msgid ""
"The product backlog is an ordered list of requirements that is maintained "
"for the Bible translation."
msgstr "Umeskar n yisefka n ufaris d tabdart yettwamyalen n tasebtayin yettwaḥrezen i tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"It consists of translation tasks, checking tasks, testing tasks, "
"comprehension tasks, whatever needs to be done to deliver a reliable "
"manuscript."
msgstr "Yesɛa timahilin n tsuqilt, timahilin n usenqed, timahilin n usentem, timahilin n lmeɛna, ayen yellan yeḥwaǧ ad yettwaxdem i wakken ad d-yettwaxdem uḍris yettwaḥrezen."

msgid "The Product Owner prioritizes the items on this list."
msgstr "Bab n ufaris yesbadu tazrawt n iferdisen deg tebdart-a."

msgid "It is used to determine the work for the next sprints."
msgstr "Yettwaseqdac i usbadu n uxeddim n isprinten i d-iteddun."

msgid "Each item has an associated estimated time to complete."
msgstr "Yal aferdis yesɛa akud yettwahsben i usgami."

msgid "A sprint typically takes one month."
msgstr "Asprint yettruzu, s wudem amagnu, yiwen n wayyur."

msgid ""
"This is where the translaton work (translate, review, approve, test) occurs."
msgstr "Wagi d wanda i ḍran tuxeddimin n tsuqilt (suqel, ẓer, qbel, ɛreḍ)."

msgid ""
"Each member of the team translates independently and in a responsible manner."
msgstr "Yal amɛiwan n ugraw yettsuqul weḥd-s s wudem amsuɣel."

msgid ""
"In case a translator is sure of a required change, he enters it without "
"consulting others."
msgstr "Ma yella amsuqel yettamen ɣef usnifel yesran, yekcem-it war ma yenɛeḍ yiwen."

msgid ""
"If a translator thinks a proposed change needs discussion, he notifies his "
"colleagues."
msgstr "Ma yella amsuqel yettwali belli asnifel yettwasumer yeḥwaǧ udiwenni, yessiweḍ-it i yimdukkal-is."

msgid ""
"All members of the translation team review the changes made by the team."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen akk n ugraw n tsuqilt ttwaliyen isnifal i d-yexdem ugraw."

msgid ""
"This is to make sure that all changes are reviewed by all members, that no "
"mistakes occur."
msgstr "Aya iwakken ad d-yettwali belli isnifal akk ttwalin sɣur imɛiwanen akk, u ur d-yettili ara tuccḍa."

msgid "The reviews take place every day."
msgstr "Iseɣyaḍen ḍran yal ass."

msgid ""
"This way of working is based on personal responsibility and mutual trust."
msgstr "Abrid-a n uxeddim yeṭṭef ɣef tsuɣelt tuman d wuḍmen n gar-asen."

msgid ""
"It speeds up the translation procedure because there's more actual "
"translation work going on, and less discussions."
msgstr "Yessurez tarrayt n tsuqilt acku yella aṭas n uxeddim n tsuqilt tidet, u drus n udiwenni."

msgid ""
"The newer members of the team learn from the more experienced ones through "
"the daily reviews."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen imaynuten n ugraw ttmuggren seg wid yesɛan tamusni s iseɣyaḍen n yal ass."

msgid "Bibledit has the concept of daily Change Notifications."
msgstr "Bibledit yesɛa tamuɣli n Yilɣa n Usnifel n yal ass."

msgid "A member can opt to receive the Change Notifications through email."
msgstr "Amɛiwan yezmer ad yefren ad yeṭṭef Ilɣa n Usnifel s imayl."

msgid "This email can be viewed online also."
msgstr "Imayl-a izmer ad yettwali daɣen srid."

msgid ""
"Or a member can opt to have the Change Notifications generated for him "
"online, and can review and approve them there."
msgstr "Neɣ amɛiwan yezmer ad yefren ad d-yettwasnulfun fell-as Ilɣa n Usnifel srid, u ad ten-yeẓr u ad ten-yeqbel dinna."

msgid "Sprint Planning Meeting"
msgstr "Tagrayt n usenfar n usprint"

msgid ""
"During this meeting the team selects the portions to translate, review and "
"test it believes it can commit to in a sprint."
msgstr "Deg tagrayt-a agraw yefren iḥricen ara yettwasuqlen, ara yettwaẓren, u ara yettwaɛerḍen i yettwasumren ad ten-yexdem deg yiwen n usprint."

msgid ""
"The team breaks the portions down into tasks and provided estimates for "
"those tasks as to the time it takes to complete them."
msgstr "Agraw yebḍa iḥricen ɣer tmahilin, u yefk azal n wakud n umdan i usemmed n yal yiwet."

msgid "Sprint Backlog"
msgstr "Umeskar n isefka n usprint"

msgid "The sprint backlog is a list of tasks to be completed in a sprint."
msgstr "Umeskar n isefka n usprint d tabdart n tmahilin ara yettwaxdmen deg yiwen n usprint."

msgid ""
"The tasks are created by breaking down the product backlog items during the "
"planning meeting."
msgstr "Tamahilin ttwasnulfent s ubeḍḍu n yiferdisen n umeskar n isefka n ufaris deg tagrayt n usenfar."

msgid "The tasks have estimates in hours or days associated with them."
msgstr "Timahilin sɛant azal s tsaɛtin neɣ s wussan yettwaqqnen."

msgid ""
"For a team it is vitally important to have a clear goal to work towards."
msgstr "I wagraw d ayen yewɛer aṭas ad yesɛu iswi ibanen ara yeddu ɣer-s."

msgid ""
"Thus everybody is focused on the desired outcome, and keeps a good pace."
msgstr "Ihi yal yiwen yettwali ɣer ugmud ibɣan, u iṭṭaf aɣawal ilhan."

msgid ""
"Without a clear goal, the team may still do a lot of things and work hard, "
"but the produced results may not have the desired value."
msgstr "War iswi ibanen, agraw izmer ad ixdem aṭas n tɣawsiwin u ad yexdem aṭas n uxeddim, maca igmuḍen i d-yettwarran zemren ad ur sɛun azal i yettwarǧun."

msgid "Team"
msgstr "Agraw"

msgid ""
"The team consistes of the Bible translators, their assistants, and the "
"consultants."
msgstr "Agraw yesɛa imsuqal n Tira iqedsen, imɛiwanen-nsen, d inezgumen."

msgid ""
"The team organizes itself to carry out the work and deliver a reliable and "
"good Bible translation."
msgstr "Agraw ittsefrek iman-is i uxeddim u i usuffeɣ n tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen taɣellsant u tilhant."

msgid "The team is quick but does not hurry."
msgstr "Agraw yettaɛǧel maca ur yettqerrib ara."

msgid "The team goes fast, but always has an eye on translation quality."
msgstr "Agraw yettddu s tazzla, maca yettwali yal tikkelt ɣer teɣzi n tsuqilt."

msgid "Scrum Master"
msgstr "Scrum Master"

msgid "The scrum master organizes the translation process."
msgstr "Scrum master yesfrek tarrayt n tsuqilt."

msgid "He or she keeps track of the progress of the translation team."
msgstr "Yettaḍfar asnerni n ugraw n tsuqilt."

msgid "He removes obstacles from the path of the team."
msgstr "Yekkes ineɛtafen seg ubrid n ugraw."

msgid "Daily Scrum Meeting"
msgstr "Tagrayt n scrum n yal ass"

msgid ""
"On each day of a sprint, the Bible translation team holds daily meetings."
msgstr "Deg yal ass n usprint, agraw n tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen yesɛa tigrayin n yal ass."

msgid "These meetings are called: Daily scrum meetings."
msgstr "Tigrayin-a ttusemman: Tigrayin n scrum n yal ass."

msgid "The scrum meetings are held in the same place and at the same time."
msgstr "Tigrayin n scrum ttxeddment deg yiwen n wadeg u deg yiwen n wakud."

msgid "The meetings are typically held in front of Task Board."
msgstr "Tigrayin s wudem amagnu ttxeddment zdat Takersiwt n Tmahilin."

msgid ""
"The daily scrum meeting is best held in the morning, because it assists in "
"setting the context for the work of that day."
msgstr "Tagrayt n scrum n yal ass tettwaxdem akken iwata deg uzizwu, acku tettallal ad tessbadu asatal i uxeddim n wass-nni."

msgid ""
"During the meeting, all members stand, as this keeps the discussion short "
"and relevant."
msgstr "Deg tagrayt, imɛiwanen akk ttebdan, acku aya yeǧǧa udiwenni d aɣezzfan u d ayen yerzan."

msgid "The scrum meeting is strictly time-boxed to 15 minutes."
msgstr "Tagrayt n scrum tettwaḥseb s wakud n 15 n tesdatin."

msgid ""
"There is a difference between people who are 'committed' to the Bible "
"translation project, and those who are 'involved' in it."
msgstr "Llan imgirad gar yimdanen 'yettwaqqnen' ɣer usenfar n tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen, d wid 'yettekkan' deg-s."

msgid "Scrum affords special status to those who are committed."
msgstr "Scrum yefka addad ixusen i wid yettwaqqnen."

msgid ""
"Many teams enforce a rule in which only those who are committed are allowed "
"to talk during the daily scrum meeting."
msgstr "Aṭas n yigrawen ssnewɛen ɣrayen anda kan wid yettwaqqnen i yettwaǧǧan ad meslayen deg tagrayt n scrum n yal ass."

msgid "All team members are required to attend the scrum meetings."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen akk n ugraw ilaq ad kecmen ɣer tigrayin n scrum."

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master and the and Product Owner (usually the Bible Translation "
"Manager) are committed team members."
msgstr "Scrum Master d Bab n ufaris (s wudem amagnu d Amsefrek n Tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen) d imɛiwanen n ugraw yettwaqqnen."

msgid "They are expected to attend and participate."
msgstr "Ttraǧun-ten ad d-kecmen u ad ttekkan."

msgid ""
"Anyone else, for example a Church leader, a Committee member, or a "
"Translator from another team, is allowed to attend but is there to listen "
"only."
msgstr "Yal win-nniḍen, amedya, amɛiwan n tegnatin, amɛiwan n tfekkit, neɣ amsuqel seg ugraw-nniḍen, yettwaǧǧa ad d-yekcem maca ad yeslu kan."

msgid ""
"This makes the daily scrum meeting an excellent way for a scrum team to "
"disseminate information."
msgstr "Aya yerra tagrayt n scrum n yal ass d abrid yelhan i ugraw n scrum akken ad yebḍu talɣut."

msgid ""
"If you are interested in hearing the status of the project, attend that "
"day's meeting."
msgstr "Ma tḥemmleḍ ad tesleḍ ɣef waddad n usenfar, ɣer tagrayt n wass-nni."

msgid ""
"The scrum meeting is not the place for solving problems or resolving issues."
msgstr "Tagrayt n scrum mačči d adig n usefru n yiɣerfan neɣ n tsutiwin."

msgid ""
"Issues that are raised are usually dealt with by one or two team members "
"immediately after the scrum."
msgstr "Tisutiwin i d-yettwasalin s wudem amagnu ttwasefrant sɣur yiwen neɣ sin n yimɛiwanen n ugraw tikkelt kan mbaɛd scrum."

msgid ""
"During the daily Scrum, each team member answers the following three "
"questions:"
msgstr "Deg scrum n yal ass, yal amɛiwan n ugraw yettarra i yisteqsiyen-a n tlata:"

msgid "What did you do yesterday?"
msgstr "D acu i txedmeḍ iḍelli?"

msgid "What are you going to do today?"
msgstr "D acu ara txedmeḍ ass-a?"

msgid "Are there any impediments in your way?"
msgstr "Llan ineɛtafen deg wabrid-ik?"

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master asks each team member to answer these questions, the member "
"speaks, the Scrum Master thanks the member, and then goes to the next member."
msgstr "Scrum Master yessuter seg yal amɛiwan ad d-yerr i yisteqsiyen-a, amɛiwan yettmeslay, Scrum Master yeṭṭseḥ-as, syin iteddu ɣer umɛiwan i d-iteddun."

msgid ""
"By focusing on what each person did yesterday and will do today, the team "
"gains an understanding of what work has been done and what work remains."
msgstr "S wazal i wayen i xedmen yal yiwen iḍelli d wayen ara xedmen ass-a, agraw yettwali ayen yettwaxdem d wayen yeqqimen."

msgid ""
"The daily scrum meeting is not a status update meeting in which the boss is "
"finding out about who is slow in his work."
msgstr "Tagrayt n scrum n yal ass mačči d tagrayt n uleqqem n waddad anda bab yettafen anwa i yettɛewwiq deg uxeddim-is."

msgid ""
"Rather, it is a meeting in which team members make commitments to each other."
msgstr "Maca d tagrayt anda imɛiwanen n ugraw ttarran iwaɛdan gar-asen."

msgid ""
"If a translator says: Today, I will prepare chapter 10 and 11 of Matthew, "
"everyone knows that in tomorrow's meeting, he will say whether or not he did "
"finish."
msgstr "Ma yella amsuqel yenna: Ass-a, ad heggiɣ uxef 10 d 11 n Matta, yal yiwen yeẓra belli deg tagrayt n azekka, ad d-yini ma yekfa neɣ xaṭi."

msgid ""
"This has the wonderful effect of helping a team realize the significance of "
"these commitments, and that their commitments are to each other, and not to "
"anyone else."
msgstr "Aya yesɛa afud yelhan i wagraw ad yelmed azal n iwaɛdan-a, u belli iwaɛdan-nsen d gar-asen, mačči i yiwen-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"Any impediments that are raised in the daily scrums become the Scrum "
"Master's responsibility to resolve as quickly as possible."
msgstr "Ineɛtafen akk i d-yettwasalin deg scrum n yal ass ttuɣalen d lxedma n Scrum Master i usefru-nsen s tazzla."

msgid "Typical impediments are:"
msgstr "Ineɛtafen imagnuyen d:"

msgid "My ... broke and I need a new one today."
msgstr "... n-iw yeṛẓa u ḥwaǧeɣ amaynut ass-a."

msgid "I still haven't got the ... I requested a month ago."
msgstr "Mazal ur d-ṭṭfeɣ ara ... i ssutreɣ yiwen n wayyur aya."

msgid ""
"I'm struggling to understand ... and would like to discuss it with someone."
msgstr "Ssexṣaɣ ad fhmeɣ ... u bɣiɣ ad mmeslayeɣ fell-as d yiwen."

msgid "The ... has asked me to work on something else for a few days."
msgstr "... iṭṭlb-iyi ad xedmeɣ ayen-nniḍen deg kra n wussan."

msgid ""
"In cases where the Scrum Master cannot remove these impediments directly "
"himself, he still takes responsibility for making sure someone on the team "
"does quickly resolve the issue."
msgstr "Ma yella Scrum Master ur izmir ara ad yekkes ineɛtafen-a s yiman-is, ad yeṭṭef lxedma n usentem belli yiwen deg ugraw ad yefru tamsalt s tazzla."

msgid "Every day a different person leads the daily scrum meeting."
msgstr "Yal ass yiwen wayeḍ i yettawi tagrayt n scrum n yal ass."

msgid "This gets the entire team involved."
msgstr "Aya yerra agraw meṛṛa yettekkan."

msgid "It opens up new channels for communication."
msgstr "Yeldi inagrawen imaynuten n unermis."

msgid "It builds trust between the Translators and the Scrum Master."
msgstr "Yesnerni tuman gar Imsuqal d Scrum Master."

msgid "Team members can learn from one another's techniques."
msgstr "Imɛiwanen n ugraw zemren ad ttmuggren seg tarrayin n yiwen-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"The Scrum Master ensures to set a good example for leading the daily scrum "
"meeting."
msgstr "Scrum Master yettamen ad yefk amedya ilhan i uɣer n tegrayt n scrum n yal ass."

msgid ""
"The scrum master uses the information from the meeting to update the "
"burndown chart illustrating progress."
msgstr "Scrum master yesseqdac talɣut seg tegrayt iwakken ad yelleqqem takersiwt n burndown yeskan asnerni."

msgid "Side conversations are taken offline."
msgstr "Imeslayen n yidis ttwarnant ɣer ssebba-nniḍen."

msgid "Burn down chart"
msgstr "Takersiwt n burn down"

msgid ""
"A burn down chart is a graphical representation of work left to do versus "
"time."
msgstr "Takersiwt n burn down d tmerniwt n wuxeddim yeqqimen ad yettwaxdem ɣef wakud."

msgid "The outstanding work is on the vertical axis."
msgstr "Uxeddim yeqqimen yella ɣef uzirig ufrawan."

msgid "The days of the sprint are on the horizontal axis."
msgstr "Ussan n usprint llan ɣef uzirig aglawan."

msgid "It is useful for predicting when all of the work will be completed."
msgstr "Yelha i usumer n wakud ara yekfu uxeddim meṛṛa."

msgid "Sprint Review"
msgstr "Aɣeṛ n usprint"

msgid ""
"The Product Owner looks through the sprint’s work and provides feedback."
msgstr "Bab n ufaris yettwali axeddim n usprint u yefk tikti."

msgid "The Translators may demonstrate features."
msgstr "Imsuqal zemren ad sekneɣ tiɣawsiwin."

msgid "The Team owns up to deficiencies with the translation."
msgstr "Agraw yeqbel tuccḍiwin n tsuqilt."

msgid "This attitude helps to build trust with the Product Owner."
msgstr "Aɣerbaz-a ittallal deg usnulfu n tuman d Bab n ufaris."

msgid "Sprint Retrospective"
msgstr "Tikli n usprint"

msgid "The Team reviews what went well and what went poorly."
msgstr "Agraw yettwali ayen yellan d wayen ur nelli ara yelhan."

msgid "They use retrospection techniques to find potential for improvement."
msgstr "Seqdacen tarrayin n tikli iwakken ad ufan tiziri n usnerni."

msgid "They pick one or two areas to focus for improvement."
msgstr "Fernen yiwen neɣ sin n yinaḍen i usnerni."

msgid "Typesetting Bibles"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen n Tira iqedsen"

msgid "Bibledit can assist with typesetting."
msgstr "Bibledit izmer ad yallal deg taɣessa n yisekkilen."

msgid "But Bibledit is not designed for typesetting."
msgstr "Maca Bibledit ur yettwaxdem ara i taɣessa n yisekkilen."

msgid "It is for Bible editing."
msgstr "D i ubeddel n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "No more than that."
msgstr "Ur d-yettili ara ugar."

msgid "Having said this, and despite this, let's press on."
msgstr "Ɣas akken, ɣas akken llan, ad nekkemmel."

msgid "The Bible has been translated. It is time to publish it."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen tettwasuqel. Tura d akud ad tettwasuffeɣ."

msgid "This article assists with typesetting the Bible."
msgstr "Amagrad-a yettallal deg taɣessa n yisekkilen n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"At the end of all, you will have a PDF file with part of the Bible, or the "
"whole Bible, typeset, ready for publishing."
msgstr "Deg taggara n meṛṛa, ad tesɛuḍ afaylu PDF s uḥric n Tira iqedsen, neɣ Tira iqedsen meṛṛa, yettwaɣessen, yewjed i usuffeɣ."

msgid "Basic assumptions"
msgstr "Tiɣawsiwin n tazwara"

msgid "The Bible is available in USFM code."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen llan s tangalt USFM."

msgid "The USFM code is clean and adheres to the standards."
msgstr "Tangalt USFM d tazeggaɣt u tettwali ɣer ɣrayen."

msgid "You have access to Bibledit."
msgstr "Tesɛiḍ anekcum ɣer Bibledit."

msgid "You have OpenOffice, LibreOffice or an equivalent."
msgstr "Tesɛiḍ OpenOffice, LibreOffice neɣ yiwen n wayen i yemṣadan."

msgid "Importing the USFM files"
msgstr "Aktar n yifuyla USFM"

msgid ""
"This section describes the steps to take to prepare the USFM code for export."
msgstr "Aḥric-a yesfeḍ iḥricen ara txedmeḍ i usewjed n tangalt USFM i usifeḍ."

msgid "Each Bible book is stored as one USFM file."
msgstr "Yal adlis n Tira iqedsen yettwaḥrez am yiwen n ufaylu USFM."

msgid ""
"Create a new Bible in Bibledit. Give the Bible a name. The example calls it "
"'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Snulfu Tira iqedsen tamaynut deg Bibledit. Efk-as isem. Amedya yesemma-tt 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Click the 'Ndebele' Bible."
msgstr "Sit ɣef Tira iqedsen 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Import data into it."
msgstr "Kter isefka deg-s."

msgid "Choose the option to upload a file."
msgstr "Fren afran n usali n ufaylu."

msgid ""
"You can upload 66 separate files, or you can put all the 66 files into one "
"zipped file, and then upload that zipped file. Import takes a while. The "
"Journal shows the progress."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tsaliḍ 66 n yifuyla yemgaraden, neɣ ad terreḍ 66 n yifuyla meṛṛa deg yiwen n ufaylu yettwasekken, u ad tsaliḍ afaylu-nni yettwasekken. Aktar yeṭṭef kra n wakud. Aɣmis yeskan asnerni."

msgid ""
"Create a new stylesheet in menu Styles. Give it a name. The example calls it "
"'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Snulfu tasebtayt tamaynut deg wumuɣ n Tɣessiwin. Efk-as isem. Amedya yesemma-tt 'Ndebele'."

msgid ""
"All the data is now in Bibledit. Everthing is ready for export to "
"OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Isefka meṛṛa llan tura deg Bibledit. Kra yewjed i usifeḍ ɣer yifuyla OpenDocument."

msgid "The OpenDocument files are used as a starting point for typesetting."
msgstr "Ifuyla OpenDocument ttwaseqdacen d tazwara n taɣessa n yisekkilen."

msgid ""
"Some of the words in the OpenDocument files are long. This results in too "
"much space between some words."
msgstr "Kra n wawalen deg yifuyla OpenDocument d iɣezzfanen. Aya yerra talunt aṭas gar kra n wawalen."

msgid ""
"The words need to get hyphens so that part of the word goes on the next line."
msgstr "Awalen ilaq ad sɛun tinneɣruftin iwakken aḥric n wawal ad iṛuḥ ɣer yizirig i d-iteddun."

msgid ""
"LibreOffice and Adobe InDesign and Scribus have hyphenation algorithms for "
"many languages. That would solve the problem."
msgstr "LibreOffice d Adobe InDesign d Scribus sɛan tarrayin n uṭṭekkul n wawalen i waṭas n tutlayin. Aya ad yefru ugur."

msgid ""
"But the programs do not have hyphenation algorithms for all languages."
msgstr "Maca ahilen ur sɛin ara tarrayin n uṭṭekkul n wawalen i tutlayin meṛṛa."

msgid "Bibledit has a hyphenater that could assist."
msgstr "Bibledit yesɛa amṭekkul n wawalen izemren ad yallal."

msgid "In Bibledit, go to this menu:"
msgstr "Deg Bibledit, ddu ɣer wumuɣ-a:"

msgid "Enter the first set of characters, and the second set, and save it."
msgstr "Sekcem tabdart tamezwarut n yisekkilen, d tin tis snat, u sekles-iten."

msgid ""
"Set the Bible where to take the data from. In this case it is 'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Sbadu Tira iqedsen anda ara yettwaṭṭef isefka. Deg tegnatin-a d 'Ndebele'."

msgid ""
"Insert the soft hyphens according to the setting. It takes a while to "
"complete."
msgstr "Rnu tinneɣruftin timlellayin almend n yiɣewwaṛen. Yeṭṭef kra n wakud ad yekfu."

msgid "The output Bible is called 'Ndebele-hyphenated'."
msgstr "Tira iqedsen n tuffɣa teɣ 'Ndebele-hyphenated'."

msgid "Use this Bible from now on."
msgstr "Seqdec Tira iqedsen-a seg tura."

msgid "Exporting to OpenDocument files"
msgstr "Asifeḍ ɣer yifuyla OpenDocument"

msgid "Make an initial export just to see how the text looks."
msgstr "Xdem asifeḍ amezwaru kan i wakken ad twaliḍ amek d-ttban uḍris."

msgid "In Bibledit, go to menu Exports."
msgstr "Deg Bibledit, ddu ɣer wumuɣ Asifeḍ."

msgid "Add Bible 'Ndebele' to the ones that will be exported."
msgstr "Rnu Tira iqedsen 'Ndebele' ɣer wid ara yettwasifḍen."

msgid "Use stylesheet 'Ndebele'."
msgstr "Seqdec tasebtayt 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Output the chapter number in drop caps. Do not use frames."
msgstr "Suffeɣ uṭṭun n uxef s yisekkilen imeqqranen. Ur seqdec ara tiɣzaz."

msgid "Set the page size. I use this: width: 138 mm; height: 210 mm."
msgstr "Sbadu teɣzi n usebter. Seqdceɣ aya: tehri: 138 mm; teɣzi: 210 mm."

msgid ""
"Set the margins. I use this: 10 mm for top and bottom margins, 12 mm for the "
"outer margins, and 14 mm for the inner margins."
msgstr "Sbadu iɣrimen. Seqdceɣ aya: 10 mm i yiɣrimen n ufella d wadda, 12 mm i yiɣrimen n beṛṛa, u 14 mm i yiɣrimen n daxel."

msgid ""
"Do not display the date in the running headers. Switch that setting off."
msgstr "Ur skan ara azemz deg yizwal n yizirig. Sens iɣewwaṛ-a."

msgid "Insert the 'en space' after verse numbers."
msgstr "Rnu 'talunt n en' deffir uṭṭunen n tefyar."

msgid "The Logbook shows the progress. Proceed when it is ready."
msgstr "Aɣmis yeskan asnerni. Kemmel mi ara yewjed."

msgid ""
"Go to menu Exports and choose your Bible there. Then go to the OpenDocument "
"folder."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Asifeḍ u fren Tira iqedsen-ik dinna. Syin ddu ɣer ukaram OpenDocument."

msgid "You will see the Bible exported into several formats."
msgstr "Ad twaliḍ Tira iqedsen yettwasifḍen deg waṭas n yimasalen."

msgid "Open the books in LibreOffice to see how they look."
msgstr "Ldi idlisen deg LibreOffice i wakken ad twaliḍ amek d-ttbanen."

msgid "The divine name will be underlined in the OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Isem aṛebbani ad yettwajerreḍ deg yifuyla OpenDocument."

msgid "The divine name is within this markup:"
msgstr "Isem aṛebbani yella deg tecraḍt-a:"

msgid "Some prefer this in small capitals, not underlined."
msgstr "Kra yettḥemmil-it s yisekkilen imeqqranen imeẓẓyanen, mačči yettwajerreḍ."

msgid "This can be changed in the stylesheet."
msgstr "Aya izmer ad yettwabeddel deg tsebtayt."

msgid "Go to menu Styles, and choose the 'Ndebele' stylesheet."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Tɣessiwin, u fren tasebtayt 'Ndebele'."

msgid "Click the 'nd' style."
msgstr "Sit ɣef uɣawen 'nd'."

msgid "Switch 'Underline' off."
msgstr "Sens 'Aderrer'."

msgid "Switch 'Small caps' on."
msgstr "Rmed 'Isekkilen imeqqranen imeẓẓyanen'."

msgid ""
"Do a new export, wait a while, and review the OpenDocument files again."
msgstr "Xdem asifeḍ amaynut, rǧu kra n wakud, u ɛiwed wali ifuyla OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"The verse numbers are in superscript. The verse numbers are small and "
"difficult to read."
msgstr "Uṭṭunen n tefyar llan s uzzig. Uṭṭunen n tefyar d imeẓẓyanen u d iweɛran ad ttwaɣren."

msgid "The intended audience prefers the verse numbers in bigger print."
msgstr "Ineɣmisen yettwaqqnen ttḥemmilen uṭṭunen n tefyar s tira tameqqrant."

msgid "Go to the relevant stylesheet and choose the 'v' style."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer tsebtayt iwatan u fren aɣawen 'v'."

msgid "Switch 'Superscript' off."
msgstr "Sens 'Uzzig'."

msgid "Do a new export and review the OpenDocument files."
msgstr "Xdem asifeḍ amaynut u wali ifuyla OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"The text in the OpenDocument files has been divided into paragraphs. New "
"paragraphs start when appropriate in the context. This is how the USFM files "
"have been marked up."
msgstr "Aḍris deg yifuyla OpenDocument yebḍa ɣer tiseddarin. Tiseddarin timaynutin bdant mi ara ilaq deg usatal. Wagi d amek yettwacerḍent ifuyla USFM."

msgid ""
"The people who are going to read this Bible prefer each verse to start a new "
"paragraph."
msgstr "Imdanen ara yeɣren Tira iqedsen-a ttḥemmilen yal tafyirt ad tebdu taseddart tamaynut."

msgid "Go to the stylesheet, and choose the 'v' style."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer tsebtayt, u fren aɣawen 'v'."

msgid "Set 'Restart paragraph' on."
msgstr "Rmed 'Ales taseddart'."

msgid "Export again."
msgstr "Sifeḍ i tikelt-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"Since each verse starts a new paragraph, there is no longer any need to "
"indent the first line of that paragraph."
msgstr "Acku yal tafyirt tebda taseddart tamaynut, ulac ilaq ad tsentṭeḍ izirig amezwaru n taseddart-a."

msgid "In the stylesheet, edit the 'p' style."
msgstr "Deg tsebtayt, ẓreg aɣawen 'p'."

msgid "Set the 'First line indent' to 0 mm."
msgstr "Sbadu 'Aɣwen n uzirig amezwaru' ɣer 0 mm."

msgid ""
"Some verses are short. Chapters that start with short verses no longer have "
"the chapter number in drop caps in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Kra n tefyar d timeẓẓyanin. Ixfawen i yebdan s tefyar timeẓẓyanin ur sɛin ara uṭṭun n uxef s yisekkilen imeqqranen deg LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"This is because this verse is all on one line, and thus there is no space "
"for drop caps, as these need two lines of text."
msgstr "Aya acku tafyirt-a d izirig yiwen, u ihi ulac talunt i yisekkilen imeqqranen, acku sɛan sin n yizirigen n uḍris."

msgid ""
"Setting the text in two columns in LibreOffice solves the problem. The drop "
"caps are back."
msgstr "Asbadu n uḍris deg sin n tgejdiyin deg LibreOffice yessefru ugur. Isekkilen imeqqranen uɣalen."

msgid ""
"The letters of the Bible text are too big. This takes up a lot of space. The "
"Bible would get too many pages."
msgstr "Isekkilen n uḍris n Tira iqedsen d imeqqranen aṭas. Aya yeṭṭef aṭas n tallunt. Tira iqedsen ad tesɛu aṭas n yisebtar."

msgid ""
"Find out which styles start paragraphs. In the Ndebele Bible, these are the "
"styles p, s, nb, d."
msgstr "Af anta tɣessiwin ibdun tiseddarin. Deg Tira iqedsen n Ndebele, wigi d tɣessiwin p, s, nb, d."

msgid "Set these styles to have a font size of 10 points."
msgstr "Sbadu tɣessiwin-a ad sɛun teɣzi n tsefsit n 10 n tneqqiḍin."

msgid "The letters of the notes and crossreferences are too big."
msgstr "Isekkilen n tizmilin d tuccḍa n tuɣalin d imeqqranen aṭas."

msgid "Set the fontsize of the styles ft and xt to 6 points."
msgstr "Sbadu teɣzi n tsefsit n tɣessiwin ft d xt ɣer 6 n tneqqiḍin."

msgid ""
"Parts of the footnotes are in bold or italics or both. You may prefer it all "
"in normal script."
msgstr "Iḥricen n tizmilin n uduɣ llan s uzuran neɣ s uneɣli neɣ s sin. Ahat tḥemmleḍ aya meṛṛa s tira tamagnut."

msgid ""
"Update the relevant footnote styles and switch bold and italics off. The "
"styles are fk, fl, fq, fqa."
msgstr "Leqqem tɣessiwin n tizmilin n uduɣ iwatan u sens uzuran d uneɣli. Tɣessiwin llan fk, fl, fq, fqa."

msgid "Typesetting guidelines"
msgstr "Iwellihen n taɣessa n yisekkilen"

msgid ""
"The following needs consideration if the Bible includes more than one book."
msgstr "Ayen i d-iteddun yessefk ad yettwaxemmem ma yella Tira iqedsen tesɛa ugar n yiwen n udlis."

msgid ""
"Does the next book follow on the same page on which the previous book "
"finished, or do the books follow on from one another in a different way?"
msgstr "Adlis i d-iteddun yeḍfer ɣef yiwen n usebter anda yekfa adlis yezrin, neɣ idlisen ttḍafaren yiwen-nniḍen s tarrayt-nniḍen?"

msgid ""
"Whatever method is chosen, it needs to be applied consistently throughout "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Ayen yellan abrid i d-yettwafernen, ilaq ad yettwaseqdac s wudem imṣadan deg Tira iqedsen meṛṛa."

msgid ""
"Line spacing should be consistent throughout and should be placed line on "
"line across all pages."
msgstr "Tallunt gar yizirigen ilaq ad tili tamṣada deg yal adig, u ad tettwasers izirig ɣef yizirig deg yisebtar meṛṛa."

msgid ""
"It means that all lines should line up with each other all the way down the "
"page and across all pages."
msgstr "Aya yeɛni belli izirigen meṛṛa ilaq ad msaren s wudem amṣadan deg usebter meṛṛa d yisebtar meṛṛa."

msgid ""
"Then when the Bible is printed, the printed text will be back to back and "
"not show through from one side of the page to the other."
msgstr "Imiren mi ara tettwasiggez Tira iqedsen, aḍris yettwasiggzen ad yili deffir n wayeḍ u ur d-yettban ara seg yiwet n tama n usebter ɣer tayeḍ."

msgid ""
"In the typesetting software, this can be implemented by setting up a grid in "
"the document, and then aligning all text to this grid."
msgstr "Deg useɣzan n taɣessa n yisekkilen, aya yezmer ad yettwaxdem s usbadu n takala deg usemli, u syin asenti n uḍris meṛṛa ɣer takala-a."

msgid "The space after the verse numbers would be the same and consistent."
msgstr "Talunt deffir uṭṭunen n tefyar ad tili tamṣada u tamṣadant."

msgid ""
"Bibledit exports the text to OpenDocument format using 'en spaces' after "
"each verse."
msgstr "Bibledit yessifeḍ aḍris ɣer umasal OpenDocument s 'talunt n en' deffir yal tafyirt."

msgid ""
"This ensures a consistent width of the spaces after the verse numbers."
msgstr "Aya yettamen teɣzi tamṣadant n tlunt deffir uṭṭunen n tefyar."

msgid ""
"The verse numbers should be set closer to the text that follows than to the "
"preceding text."
msgstr "Uṭṭunen n tefyar ilaq ad ttwasbaden qrib ɣer uḍris i d-iteddun ugar n uḍris yezrin."

msgid ""
"Many fonts have half spaces and hair spaces that can be used for this."
msgstr "Aṭas n tsefsiyin sɛant tallunin n nnuṣ d tallunin imecṭuḥen i izemren ad ttwaseqdacen i waya."

msgid "Or set the kerning to a specific amount for the verse numbers."
msgstr "Neɣ sbadu aserreḥ ɣer azal yettwabren i uṭṭunen n tefyar."

msgid "Superscript numerals could also be considered for verse numbers."
msgstr "Uṭṭunen uzzigen zemren daɣen ad ttwaxemmem i uṭṭunen n tefyar."

msgid ""
"They are less intrusive while at the same time just as readable and easily "
"found if they are not made too small."
msgstr "Ttmuddun drus n tɛewwiqt, u d iɣran ɣef yiwen n wakud, u ttwafen s tazzla ma yella ur ttwarran ara d imeẓẓyanen aṭas."

msgid "They should be larger than any note citations in the text."
msgstr "Ilaq ad ilin d imeqqranen ugar n yizmilen akk i d-yettwabdren deg uḍris."

msgid ""
"The size of the superscript would be between 70 and 80 percent of the size "
"of the main text."
msgstr "Teɣzi n uzzig ad tili gar 70 d 80 deg tmiya n teɣzi n uḍris agejdan."

msgid ""
"The alignment of the drop caps chapter numbers to the text beside it is to "
"be consistent."
msgstr "Asenti n uṭṭunen n yixfawen s yisekkilen imeqqranen ɣer uḍris i d-iteddun ilaq ad yili imṣadan."

msgid "There should be some space between the numbers and the text."
msgstr "Ilaq ad tili kra n tallunt gar uṭṭunen d uḍris."

msgid ""
"Drop cap characters should not be too large and not rise too far above the "
"height of the other letters on the first line."
msgstr "Isekkilen imeqqranen ur ilaq ara ad ilin d imeqqranen aṭas u ur ilaq ara ad ilin d iɛlayen aṭas ɣef yisekkilen-nniḍen n yizirig amezwaru."

msgid "The top of the highest letters should reach to about the same height."
msgstr "Afella n yisekkilen imeqqranen ilaq ad yewweḍ ɣer teɣzi nniṭen."

msgid ""
"The drop cap characters in the body of the text should not be indented."
msgstr "Isekkilen imeqqranen deg uḍris agejdan ur ilaq ara ad ttwasentṭen."

msgid ""
"The chapter divisions would also benefit from some more space between them "
"and the text of the preceding chapter."
msgstr "Tabeḍḍit n yixfawen ad d-tsebḥ ɣer wacu ugar n tallunt gar-asen d uḍris n uxef yezrin."

msgid ""
"When there is no heading above a chapter, it may be visually better to start "
"the chapter number with a line space before it."
msgstr "Mi ara ulac azwel ɣef uxef, d ayen yelhan ugar i tmuɣli ad tebduḍ uṭṭun n uxef s tallunt n yizirig send-s."

msgid ""
"The amount of space given to the Bible book headings should not be too much."
msgstr "Talunt i d-ttwafkent i yizwal n yedlisen n Tira iqedsen ur ilaq ara ad tili d tameqqrant aṭas."

msgid "But they can do with some space above and below them."
msgstr "Maca zemrent ad sɛun kra n tallunt ddaw-sen d ufella-sen."

msgid ""
"Subheadings should not appear squashed amongst the rest of the text and "
"would benefit from some space."
msgstr "Izwal imeẓẓyanen ur ilaq ara ad ttbanen yettwaḍrusen gar uḍris-nniḍen u ad ilin d ilhan s kra n tallunt."

msgid "Subheadings do not need to be set on the grid."
msgstr "Izwal imeẓẓyanen ur ḥwaǧen ara ad ttwasbaden ɣef takala."

msgid "They are much better set a little closer to the text that follows."
msgstr "Ad ilin d ilhan ugar ma ttwasbaden qrib ɣer uḍris i d-iteddun."

msgid ""
"Subheadings are an addition and not Scripture, so it is appropriate to put "
"these in italics."
msgstr "Izwal imeẓẓyanen d timerniwt u mačči d Tira iqedsen, ihi yelha ad ttwarnun s uneɣli."

msgid ""
"The space between the text and footnotes should not be too tight neither "
"unnecessarily large."
msgstr "Talunt gar uḍris d tizmilin n uduɣ ur ilaq ara ad tili d tamecṭuḥt aṭas neɣ d tameqqrant war ilaq."

msgid ""
"Keep the gap between the references in the footer and the main block of text "
"as consistent as possible."
msgstr "Eǧǧ talunt gar tuccḍa n tuɣalin deg uḍfar d uḥric agejdan n uḍris ad tili tamṣadant ɣer wayen izemren."

msgid ""
"The footnotes and crossreferences should not have a large variation in how "
"far they finish from the foot of the page."
msgstr "Tizmilin n uduɣ d tuccḍa n tuɣalin ur ilaq ara ad sɛun amgirad ameqqran deg wamek ara ffɣent seg uḍfar n usebter."

msgid ""
"In the crossreferences it is pleasing to have the chapter and verse number "
"kept together with the book name, especially as the small font on long lines "
"gives scope for this."
msgstr "Deg tuccḍa n tuɣalin yelha ad nḥerz uṭṭun n uxef d tefyirt akked yisem n udlis, akken ugar acku tsefsit tamecṭuḥt ɣef yizirigen iɣezzfanen tmudd tallunt i waya."

msgid ""
"The columns should start at the same height and should be balanced at the "
"ends."
msgstr "Tigejdiyin ilaq ad bdunt deg yiwen n teɣzi u ad ttwarsent deg tgara."

msgid "The gap between the columns should be between 4 and 5 mm."
msgstr "Talunt gar tgejdiyin ilaq ad tili gar 4 d 5 mm."

msgid ""
"The centre line dividing the two columns should start about level or very "
"slightly above the top of the highest ascenders on the first line of text in "
"a column and finish about level with the bottom of the lowest descenders on "
"the bottom line."
msgstr "Izirig n wammas i yebḍan sin n tgejdiyin ilaq ad yebdu qrib deg yiwen n teɣzi neɣ ddaw n ufella n yisekkilen iɛlayen ɣef yizirig amezwaru n uḍris deg tgejdit, u ad yekfu qrib deg yiwen n teɣzi d wadda n yisekkilen iɣezzfanen ɣef yizirig aneggaru."

msgid "The centre line may also be omitted, as most modern Bibles do."
msgstr "Izirig n wammas izmer daɣen ad yettwaǧǧa, akken xedmen aṭas n Tira iqedsen n tura."

msgid "The pages looks cleaner then."
msgstr "Isebtar ad ttbanen d iceffafen ugar."

msgid ""
"The Psalm headers need consistent spaces before and after and should be "
"positioned closer to the Psalm that follows than to the Psalm before."
msgstr "Izwal n Tizmilin (Psalms) ilaq ad sɛun tallunt tamṣadant send d deffir u ilaq ad ttwasbaden qrib i Tizmilin i d-iteddun ugar n wid yezrin."

msgid "A 10 mm margin is okay for the top and bottom margins."
msgstr "Aɣrim n 10 mm yelha i yiɣrimen n ufella d wadda."

msgid "A 12 mm margin is good for the outer margin."
msgstr "Aɣrim n 12 mm yelha i uɣrim n beṛṛa."

msgid "The inner margin needs slightly more, for example 14 mm."
msgstr "Aɣrim n daxel yesra ugar kra, amedya 14 mm."

msgid ""
"For singable Psalms, readability would be helped by distinguishing the verse "
"numbers visually."
msgstr "I Tisefra n yimeɣbunen, tɣuri tettwallal s usemgirad s yitwali n uṭṭunen n tefyar."

msgid ""
"It is helpful to distinguish the running head, perhaps by using a semi-bold "
"version of the same font."
msgstr "Yelha ad tesmgireḍ aɣerbaz n yizirig, ahat s useqdec n lqem azuran ala n tsefsit-nni."

msgid ""
"One way in which the number of pages in a volume could be reduced without "
"loss of readability would be to choose a font with slightly shorter "
"ascenders and descenders and then tighten the leading (line spacing) "
"slightly."
msgstr "Yiwen n wabrid anda amḍan n yisebtar deg uḥric izemren ad yettwaɣus war aɣbel n tɣuri d ufran n tsefsit s yisekkilen iɛlayen d iɣezzfanen imecṭuḥen kra, u ad ssekkreḍ kra tallunt gar yizirigen."

msgid ""
"When producing PDF output, the text needs to be monochrome black, not black "
"consisting of three or four colours."
msgstr "Mi ara txedmeḍ asifeḍ PDF, aḍris ilaq ad yili d aberkan yiwen, mačči d aberkan yeffren s tlata neɣ s uṛbɛa n yiniten."

msgid ""
"The last line of a verse or paragraph should not appear on its own at the "
"top of a column."
msgstr "Izirig aneggaru n tefyirt neɣ n taseddart ur ilaq ara ad d-yettban weḥd-s deg ufella n tgejdit."

msgid ""
"The typesetting software will have a setting for 'orphans' to control this."
msgstr "Aseɣzan n taɣessa n yisekkilen ad yesɛu aɣewwaṛ i 'tiluẓin' i wakken ad yeḥkem aya."

msgid ""
"An elegant way of avoiding orphans is to increase or decrease the tracking "
"of the text."
msgstr "Abrid ilhan i usemmed n tiluẓin d asemɣer neɣ asenqes n uḍfar n uḍris."

msgid ""
"This is the overall spacing of the letters in a paragraph or on a line."
msgstr "Wagi d talunt tamatut n yisekkilen deg taseddart neɣ ɣef yizirig."

msgid "Avoid hyphenations in the headings."
msgstr "Ur seqdec ara tinneɣruftin deg yizwal."

msgid "It is helpful to remove all discretionary hyphens from the headings."
msgstr "Yelha ad tekkseḍ tinneɣruftin meṛṛa n usefran seg yizwal."

msgid ""
"Many book titles consist of a main title and a subtitle, like 'The gospel of "
"Matthew'."
msgstr "Aṭas n yizwal n yedlisen sɛan azwel agejdan d azwel ameẓẓyan, am 'Tazmilt n Matta'."

msgid "'Matthew' is the main title, and the rest is the subtitle."
msgstr "'Matta' d azwel agejdan, u wayen-nniḍen d azwel ameẓẓyan."

msgid "It is good if there is a clear contrast on size between these two."
msgstr "Yelha ma yella llan imgirad ibanen deg teɣzi gar sin-a."

msgid ""
"Say 24 points bold for the main title, and 14 points regular for the "
"subtitle."
msgstr "Ad nini 24 n tneqqiḍin s uzuran i uzwel agejdan, u 14 n tneqqiḍin s tira tamagnut i uzwel ameẓẓyan."

msgid ""
"The number of hyphens used in a row should be few for enhanced readability."
msgstr "Amḍan n tinneɣruftin yettwaseqdacen deg wudem imṣadan ilaq ad yili drus i tɣuri tilhant."

msgid ""
"The number of hyphens used in a row should not amount to more than three "
"consecutive hyphenated lines."
msgstr "Amḍan n tinneɣruftin yettwaseqdacen deg wudem imṣadan ilaq ad ur yezɛik ara tlata n yizirigen imṣadanen s tinneɣruftin."

msgid ""
"At times a word that is now hyphenated can be forced down onto the next "
"line, and become a non-hyphenated word there, without opening up the gaps "
"between the words too much on the line where the word came from."
msgstr "Kra n tikkal awal yettwarnan s tinneɣruft yezmer ad yettwajbed ɣer yizirig i d-iteddun, u ad yuɣal d awal war tinneɣruft dinna, war ma yeldi talunt gar wawalen aṭas ɣef yizirig anda d-yusa."

msgid ""
"Hyphenation should be set to the optimum result for the column width but "
"then it is usually necessary to go over every page and make corrections "
"manually."
msgstr "Aṭṭekkul n wawalen ilaq ad yettwasbadu ɣer tiririt yelhan i tehri n tgejdit, maca imiren s wudem amagnu yessefk ad ddun ɣer yal asebter u ad ttwaxedmen ṣṣeḥḥat s ufus."

msgid ""
"The main page numbering should start at the first page of Genesis, or "
"Matthew in case of New Testaments."
msgstr "Uṭṭun agejdan n yisebtar ad yebdu deg usebter amezwaru n Genesis, neɣ Matta ma yella d Uneggaru Amaynut."

msgid "To avoid what are sometimes referred to as 'rivers' in the text."
msgstr "I usemmed n wayen ttusemman kra n tikkal 'iṭṭawen' deg uḍris."

msgid ""
"This is where large spaces between words cause rivers of white space to be "
"seen running through the text."
msgstr "Wagi d wanda tallunt tameqqrant gar wawalen d ayen i d-yettaǧǧan iṭṭawen n tallunt tamellalt ad ttbanen ttedduyin deg uḍris."

msgid ""
"The use of hyphenation or tracking adjustments are tools that can be used to "
"minimise the problem."
msgstr "Aseqdec n tinneɣruftin neɣ n yibeddlen n uḍfar d ilemmasen izemren ad ttwaseqdacen i usenqes n ugur."

msgid "But as always they need to be used with discretion."
msgstr "Maca am yal tikkelt ilaq ad ttwaseqdacen s tilisa."

msgid "As a general rule text will be justified on the left and the right."
msgstr "Am ɣrayen imatuten, aḍris ad yettwasentel ɣer uzelmaḍ d uyeffus."

msgid ""
"A word, part of a word, or very short line should not appear by itself at "
"the end of a paragraph."
msgstr "Awal, aḥric n wawal, neɣ izirig ameẓẓyan aṭas ur ilaq ara ad d-yettban weḥd-s deg taggara n taseddart."

msgid ""
"This results in less much white space between paragraphs or at the bottom of "
"a page."
msgstr "Aya yerra drus n tallunt tamellalt gar tiseddarin neɣ deg ukessar n usebter."

msgid ""
"The main page numbering starts at the first page of the text of the "
"Scripture."
msgstr "Uṭṭun agejdan n yisebtar ad yebdu deg usebter amezwaru n uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"This first page of Scripture starts on the recto for left to right reading "
"scripts."
msgstr "Asebter amezwaru-a n Tira iqedsen ad yebdu ɣef recto i yiḍrisen n tɣuri seg uzelmaḍ ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "The recto is the right side of a two page spread."
msgstr "Recto d tama tayeffust n sin n yisebtar yemṣadan."

msgid "For right to left scripts it starts on the verso."
msgstr "I yiḍrisen n tɣuri seg uyeffus ɣer uzelmaḍ, ad yebdu ɣef verso."

msgid "This is the left side of a two page spread."
msgstr "Wagi d tama tazelmaḍt n sin n yisebtar yemṣadan."

msgid ""
"Due to subheadings starting in a new column, there may be spaces at the foot "
"of pages."
msgstr "Ɣef ssebba n yizwal imeẓẓyanen i ibedun deg tgejdit tamaynut, ahat llan tallunin deg ukessar n yisebtar."

msgid ""
"They can be filled by carefully adjusting tracking in one of the paragraphs."
msgstr "Zemrent ad ččuren s usnifel s tilisa n uḍfar deg yiwet n tiseddarin."

msgid "The paragraph would then take up an extra line to fill that space."
msgstr "Taseddart ad tesɛu izirig ugar iwakken ad teččur tallunt-nni."

msgid ""
"It may not always be possible to fill gaps completely without creating "
"unsightly spacing within paragraphs."
msgstr "Ahat ur yezmir ara ad yettwaččur akk s war ma d-ttbanent tallunin ur yelhin ara deg tiseddarin."

msgid "It needs to be handled with common sense."
msgstr "Ilaq ad yettwaxdem s tamusni tamatut."

msgid "The typesetting"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen"

msgid "The typesetting can be done in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen tezmer ad tettwaxdem deg LibreOffice."

msgid "Or in Scribus."
msgstr "Neɣ deg Scribus."

msgid "This is free software."
msgstr "Wagi d aseɣzan ilelli."

msgid ""
"The organisation may want to use specialized typesetting software like Adobe "
"InDesign."
msgstr "Tuddsa tezmer ad tebɣu ad tseqdec aseɣzan usrid n taɣessa n yisekkilen am Adobe InDesign."

msgid "Scrum-based translation process."
msgstr "Tarrayt n tsuqilt s Scrum."

msgid "Transparent, fair, and argued discussions"
msgstr "Idiwenniyen ibanen, imṣadan, u yettwasbadun s tiɣuri"

msgid "Use of reliable Hebrew and Greek manuscripts."
msgstr "Aseqdec n yifuyla n Tebrit d Tagrikit i yellan d imeɣtuyen."

msgid "Looking for and depending on the help of the Lord Jesus."
msgstr "Anadi d usmetti ɣef tallalt n Ssid Ɛisa."

msgid "Use of modern tools and technology."
msgstr "Aseqdec n yiɣbula d tiknulujiyin n tura."

msgid ""
"Goal: Deliver a reliable Bible translation within a reasonable time frame."
msgstr "Iswi: Ad d-nefk tasuqilt n Tira iqedsen taɣellsant deg wakud ilaqen."

msgid "Lean management"
msgstr "Asefrek ilɣaḍ"

msgid "Typesetting in LibreOffice"
msgstr "Taɣessa n yisekkilen deg LibreOffice"

msgid ""
"See the online help about typesetting for more information about some "
"general principles."
msgstr "Wali tallalt srid ɣef taɣessa n yisekkilen i ugar n talɣut ɣef kra n ɣrayen imatuten."

msgid "You have access to a copy of LibreOffice."
msgstr "Tesɛiḍ anekcum ɣer tanɣalt n LibreOffice."

msgid "Page count"
msgstr "Amḍan n yisebtar"

msgid ""
"Download the file with notes. It was exported above. It is called "
"00_Bible_notes.odt."
msgstr "Sider afaylu s tizmilin. Yettwasifeḍ ufella. Yettusemma 00_Bible_notes.odt."

msgid "Open the file in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Ldi afaylu deg LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"Let it repaginate. A good way of doing this is to press Ctrl-P as if going "
"to print the document. Then it will repaginate. Cancel the print dialog."
msgstr "Eǧǧ-it ad yales asebter. Abrid ilhan i waya d usit ɣef Ctrl-P am akken tebɣiḍ ad tsiggzeḍ asemli. Syin ad yales asebter. Sefsex asatal n usiggez."

msgid "It will now give the page count that the notes are likely to take up."
msgstr "Imiren ad d-yefk amḍan n yisebtar ara yeṭṭef tizmilin."

msgid "In our case, this is about 300 pages."
msgstr "Deg tegnatin-nneɣ, wagi d qrib 300 n yisebtar."

msgid ""
"Each chapter has headings. These headings do not belong to the notes. Thus "
"the page count is too high."
msgstr "Yal uxef yesɛa izwal. Izwal-a ur ttwasnasen ara ɣer tizmilin. Ihi amḍan n yisebtar d ameqqran aṭas."

msgid ""
"Notice that the paragraph style for these headings is called 'Heading 1'."
msgstr "Ɛlem belli tɣessa n taseddart n yizwal-a ttusemma 'Heading 1'."

msgid ""
"Hide the headings. This can be done like this. Right-click on a heading. "
"Choose 'Edit Paragraph Style'. A dialog comes up. Choose tab 'Font Effects'. "
"Tick option 'Hidden'."
msgstr "Ffer izwal. Aya yezmer ad yettwaxdem akka: sit s uḍad ayeffus ɣef uzwel. Fren 'Edit Paragraph Style'. Asatal ad d-yeffeɣ. Fren iccer 'Font Effects'. Rmed afran 'Hidden'."

msgid ""
"Repaginate, and notice the page count. In our case it is down to about 125."
msgstr "Ales asebter, u ɛlem amḍan n yisebtar. Deg tegnatin-nneɣ yeṛṛuḥ ɣer qrib 125."

msgid ""
"Download the OpenDocument file with text and note citations. It was exported "
"above. It is called 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."
msgstr "Sider afaylu OpenDocument s uḍris d yitennaren n yizmilen. Yettwasifeḍ ufella. Yettusemma 00_Bible_text_and_note_citations.odt."

msgid "The document has only one column."
msgstr "Asemli ɣur-s yiwet n tgejdit kan."

msgid "Repaginate and notice the page count. In our case this is 1750."
msgstr "Ales asebter u ɛlem amḍan n yisebtar. Deg tegnatin-nneɣ, wagi d 1750."

msgid ""
"This is not accurate since it applies to a column count of one rather than "
"two."
msgstr "Wagi ur yelli ara d aṣeḥḥan acku yerza amḍan n tgejdiyin n yiwen mačči n sin."

msgid "Set the whole document to have two columns."
msgstr "Sbadu asemli meṛṛa ad yesɛu sin n tgejdiyin."

msgid ""
"Go to menu Format / Page. Choose the Columns tab. Choose two columns. Set "
"the spacing to 0.2 cm. Set a thin separator line. Click Ok."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Amasal / Asebter. Fren iccer n Tgejdiyin. Fren sin n tgejdiyin. Sbadu talunt ɣer 0.2 cm. Sbadu izirig n usemgirad arqaq. Sit ɣef IH."

msgid "Repaginate and notice the page count. It is down to 1520."
msgstr "Ales asebter u ɛlem amḍan n yisebtar. Yeṛṛuḥ ɣer 1520."

msgid "We are now able to estimate the page count for the entire Bible:"
msgstr "Tura nezmer ad nḥseb amḍan n yisebtar n Tira iqedsen meṛṛa:"

msgid ""
"Text body 1520 pages. Notes 125 pages. Singable Psalms 200 pages. Estimated "
"total is 1845 pages."
msgstr "Aɣbel n uḍris 1520 n yisebtar. Tizmilin 125 n yisebtar. Tisefra n yimeɣbunen 200 n yisebtar. Asemday ameɣtu yettwaḥsben d 1845 n yisebtar."

msgid "Using LibreOffice for typesetting"
msgstr "Aseqdec n LibreOffice i taɣessa n yisekkilen"

msgid ""
"Having used LibreOffice for typesetting for some time, my experience is that "
"the program is suitable for typesetting Bibles."
msgstr "Mbaɛd ma seqdceɣ LibreOffice i taɣessa n yisekkilen kra n wakud, tamussni-iw d akken ahil-a yelha i taɣessa n yisekkilen n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"I'd like to give some hints about how to do typographic work in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Bɣiɣ ad d-fkeɣ kra n yiwellihen ɣef wamek ara texdem axeddim n tira deg LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"To meet the requirement that line spacing be consistent throughout and be "
"placed line on line across all pages, do the following:"
msgstr "I wakken ad tesemmeḍ ɣef usentel akken tallunt gar yizirigen ad tili tamṣadant deg yal adig, u ad tettwasers izirig ɣef yizirig deg yisebtar meṛṛa, xdem aya:"

msgid ""
"Go to menu Format / Page, and enable Register-true. Set the reference style "
"to 'Text Body'. Press OK."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Amasal / Asebter, u rmed Register-true. Sbadu tɣessa n uɣbalu ɣer 'Text Body'. Ssed ɣef IH."

msgid ""
"Select all the text, and go to menu Format / Paragraph, and activate "
"Register-true. Press OK."
msgstr "Fren aḍris meṛṛa, u ddu ɣer wumuɣ Amasal / Taseddart, u rmed Register-true. Ssed ɣef IH."

msgid ""
"The line spacing specified by the paragraph style 'Text Body' is now used as "
"the reference line spacing for all paragraphs that have the register-true "
"feature enabled."
msgstr "Tallunt gar yizirigen yettwasbadun s tɣessa n taseddart 'Text Body' tettwaseqdac tura d tallunt n uɣbalu i tiseddarin meṛṛa i yesɛan tazmert n register-true yettwarmed."

msgid ""
"The line spacing in the document is going to be consistent. It will be equal "
"to the line spacing of the reference style 'Text Body', or a multiple of it."
msgstr "Tallunt gar yizirigen deg usemli ad tili tamṣadant. Ad tili am tallunt n tɣessa n uɣbalu 'Text Body', neɣ amḍan-is."

msgid "Changing the line spacing."
msgstr "Abeddel n tallunt gar yizirigen."

msgid "Change the line spacing in paragraph style 'Text Body'."
msgstr "Beddel tallunt gar yizirigen deg tɣessa n taseddart 'Text Body'."

msgid "Press F11 to get the Styles and Formatting dialog."
msgstr "Ssed F11 i wakken ad d-tawiḍ asatal n Tɣessiwin d Umasal."

msgid "Locate style 'Text Body'."
msgstr "Af tɣessa 'Text Body'."

msgid "Right-click it with the mouse, and choose menu Modify."
msgstr "Sit fell-as s uḍad ayeffus, u fren umuɣ Beddel."

msgid "Go to tab Indents & Spacing."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer uccer Imsentṭen d Tallunin."

msgid ""
"Adjust the spacing above the paragraph, the spacing below the paragrap, and "
"the line spacing. Press OK."
msgstr "Seɣwes talunt n ufella n taseddart, talunt n wadda n taseddart, d tallunt gar yizirigen. Ssed ɣef IH."

msgid ""
"It may happen that some paragraphs in the text used to have a line spacing "
"equal to the line spacing of style 'Text Body', but now suddenly take up a "
"multiple of it. This may happen when you have tightened the line spacing a "
"bit."
msgstr "Yezmer ad yeḍru belli kra n tiseddarin deg uḍris sɛant tallunt gar yizirigen am tin n tɣessa 'Text Body', maca tura ttwaḥsabent d amḍan-is. Aya yezmer ad yeḍru mi ara tessenqseḍ tallunt gar yizirigen kra."

msgid ""
"To resolve this, make the line spacing of those paragraphs smaller than the "
"line spacing of style 'Text body'."
msgstr "I wakken ad tefruḍ aya, err tallunt gar yizirigen n tiseddarin-a d tamecṭuḥt ugar n tallunt gar yizirigen n tɣessa 'Text body'."

msgid "Updating a paragraph style."
msgstr "Aleqqem n tɣessa n taseddart."

msgid ""
"After exporting USFM text to OpenDocument, the paragraph styles of the USFM "
"document appear in LibreOffice."
msgstr "Mbaɛd asifeḍ n uḍris USFM ɣer OpenDocument, tɣessiwin n tiseddarin n usemli USFM ttbanent deg LibreOffice."

msgid ""
"To update a paragraph style, right-click the text of this paragraph, and "
"choose menu Edit Paragraph Style..., and make the desired settings."
msgstr "I wakken ad tleqqmeḍ tɣessa n taseddart, sit s uḍad ayeffus ɣef uḍris n taseddart-a, u fren umuɣ Edit Paragraph Style..., u xdem iɣewwaṛen i tebɣiḍ."

msgid "Exporting to PDF."
msgstr "Asifeḍ ɣer PDF."

msgid "See menu File / Export as PDF."
msgstr "Wali umuɣ Afaylu / Sifeḍ am PDF."

msgid "Hiding the soft hyphens and non-breaking spaces."
msgstr "Tuffra n tinneɣruftin timlellayin d tallunin ur nettwakkes ara."

msgid ""
"The soft hyphens and the non-breaking spaces are visible as grey fields that "
"clutter the page. To hide them, do this:"
msgstr "Tinneɣruftin timlellayin d tallunin ur nettwakkes ara ttbanent am yimsiggilen imellalen i yesɛewwiqen asebter. I wakken ad tent-tessfeḍ, xdem aya:"

msgid "Go to menu Tools / Options."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer wumuɣ Allalen / Ismenyifen."

msgid "Go to LibreOffice Writer / Formatting Aids."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer LibreOffice Writer / Tallalt n tseddart."

msgid "Untick display of custom hyphens."
msgstr "Kkes afran n uskan n tinneɣruftin tudmawanin."

msgid "Untick display of non-breaking spaces."
msgstr "Kkes afran n uskan n tallunin ur nettwakkes ara."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Android"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Android"

msgid "Install Bibledit from Google Play."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit seg Google Play."

msgid "Give it a while to initialize."
msgstr "Eǧǧ-it kra n wakud i usenker."

msgid "Alternative installation options:"
msgstr "Iferniyen-nniḍen n usbadu:"

msgid "Versions"
msgstr "Lqamen"

msgid ""
"There is a Bibledit version for Windows, for the Mac, for Android, for iOS, "
"and for Linux."
msgstr "Llan lqem n Bibledit i Windows, i Mac, i Android, i iOS, u i Linux."

msgid "These are all client editions of Bibledit."
msgstr "Wigi meṛṛa d lqamen n yimsaɣen n Bibledit."

msgid "There is also a server edition of Bibledit."
msgstr "Llan daɣen lqem n uqeddac n Bibledit."

msgid "That is 'Bibledit Cloud'."
msgstr "Wagi d 'Bibledit Cloud'."

msgid "It runs on the web."
msgstr "Yetteddu ɣef web."

msgid ""
"Bibledit Cloud has more capabilities than the standard Bibledit editions."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud yesɛa ugar n tezmert ɣef lqamen imagnuyen n Bibledit."

msgid ""
"The standard Bibledit editions connect to an instance of Bibledit Cloud for "
"collaboration, keeping the devices in sync, and for backup."
msgstr "Lqamen imagnuyen n Bibledit qqnen ɣer yiwen n umsaɣ n Bibledit Cloud i umɛiwen, i usenti n yibenkan, u i uḥraz."

msgid ""
"All Bibledit editions, including Bibledit Cloud, enable Bible translation."
msgstr "Lqamen meṛṛa n Bibledit, ula d Bibledit Cloud, ttmuddun tasuqilt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"With a fast internet connection, it is usually easiest to translate straight "
"in Bibledit Cloud through the web browser."
msgstr "S tuqqna n Internet taɛezzazt, yelha ad tsuqleḍ srid deg Bibledit Cloud s yiminig web."

msgid ""
"When the internet connection is slow, or when it is off at times, it is "
"recommended to translate through one of the standard Bibledit versions."
msgstr "Mi ara tili tuqqna n Internet d tamellalt, neɣ mi ara tettwasens kra n tikkal, yettwasumer ad tsuqleḍ s yiwen seg lqamen imagnuyen n Bibledit."

msgid ""
"The changes made in this way can be synchronized with Bibledit Cloud through "
"Send/receive."
msgstr "Isnifal i d-yettwaxedmen akka zemren ad ttwasenti d Bibledit Cloud s Azen/Aṭṭaf."

msgid "Bibledit on Windows"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef Windows"

msgid "Bibledit on Android"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef Android"

msgid "Bibledit on macOS"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef macOS"

msgid "Bibledit on Linux"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef Linux"

msgid "Bibledit on iOS"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef iOS"

msgid "Bibledit on Chrome OS"
msgstr "Bibledit ɣef Chrome OS"

msgid "Bibledit Cloud on Linux"
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud ɣef Linux"

msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "Aleqqem"

msgid ""
"A certain release of Bibledit can upgrade the most recent previous release, "
"but not older releases."
msgstr "Yiwen n wulqim n Bibledit izmer ad yeleqqem lqem aneggaru yezrin, maca mačči lqamen iqburen."

msgid "A new release can be installed over the previous release."
msgstr "Lqem amaynut yezmer ad yettwasbedd ɣef lqem yezrin."

msgid "There should be no loss of information."
msgstr "Ur ilaq ara ad yili ufuḥ n talɣut."

msgid ""
"Create a backup of the Bibledit folder before upgrading, just to be sure."
msgstr "Snulfu aḥraz n ukaram n Bibledit send aleqqem, i usemmed kan."

msgid "Clients"
msgstr "Imsaɣen"

msgid "The various Bibledit client editions store the data offline."
msgstr "Lqamen imgaraden n yimsaɣen n Bibledit ḥerzen isefka war tuqqna."

msgid "You can translate the Bible on a client."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ ad tsuqleḍ Tira iqedsen ɣef umsaɣ."

msgid ""
"The user needs to regularly synchronize the data on the client with the data "
"on Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Aseqdac ilaq ad yemtawi s wudem amagnu isefka ɣef umsaɣ d yisefka ɣef Bibledit Cloud."

msgid ""
"A Client is useful when the Internet connection to Bibledit Cloud is not "
"fast or not stable."
msgstr "Amsaɣ yelha mi ara tili tuqqna n Internet ɣer Bibledit Cloud ur teɛziz ara neɣ ur tuɣal ara d tamellalt."

msgid ""
"In the Bibledit client, connect to Bibledit Cloud once, and provide your "
"username and password as you normally log in on Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Deg umsaɣ n Bibledit, qqen ɣer Bibledit Cloud yiwet n tikkelt, u mudd isem n useqdac d wawal uffir am akken tkecmeḍ s wudem amagnu ɣer Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Also provide the port number."
msgstr "Mudd daɣen uṭṭun n tcuṭṭut."

msgid "Then synchronize the data."
msgstr "Syin mtawi isefka."

msgid ""
"The first time the client will download all Bible data and Notes from "
"Bibledit Cloud and store it offline."
msgstr "Tikkelt tamezwarut amsaɣ ad isider isefka meṛṛa n Tira iqedsen d Tizmilin seg Bibledit Cloud u ad ten-yeḥrez war tuqqna."

msgid "That may take a while."
msgstr "Aya yezmer ad yeṭṭef kra n wakud."

msgid "After that, synchronizing will send and receive the changes only."
msgstr "Mbaɛd waya, amtawa ad yazen u ad yeṭṭef isnifal kan."

msgid ""
"The client mode is useful in a situation where the Internet connection is "
"not optimal."
msgstr "Askar n umsaɣ yelha deg waddad anda tuqqna n Internet ur telli ara d tilhan."

msgid "All data is stored locally on your computing device."
msgstr "Isefka meṛṛa ttwaḥrezen s wudem adigan ɣef yibenk-ik n usiḍen."

msgid "During translation, the Internet connection is not used."
msgstr "Deg usuqel, tuqqna n Internet ur tettwaseqdac ara."

msgid "It is used during synchronization."
msgstr "Tettwaseqdac deg umtawa."

msgid "Bibledit Cloud works with email."
msgstr "Bibledit Cloud yettxeddem s imayl."

msgid ""
"After completing the installation of Bibledit, sending and receiving emails "
"does not yet work."
msgstr "Mbaɛd ma tfaket usbadu n Bibledit, uzen d uṭṭaf n yimaylen mazal ur ttxeddmen ara."

msgid "This needs to be set up."
msgstr "Aya yessefk ad yettwasbadu."

msgid ""
"Setting up the email means to pick an email address and setting details for "
"the mail servers in Bibledit."
msgstr "Asbadu n imayl yeɛni afran n tansa n imayl u asbadu n talɣut n yiqeddacen n imayl deg Bibledit."

msgid "This can be done from within the web application."
msgstr "Aya yezmer ad yettwaxdem seg uɣerbaz n usnas web."

msgid "Multiple translation teams"
msgstr "Aṭas n yigrawen n tsuqilt"

msgid "There are two ways to have multiple translation teams on one server."
msgstr "Llan sin n yibriden i wakken ad tesɛuḍ aṭas n yigrawen n tsuqilt ɣef yiwen n uqeddac."

msgid "Install multiple parallel copies of Bibledit on one server."
msgstr "Sbedd aṭas n tanɣalin timṣadanin n Bibledit ɣef yiwen n uqeddac."

msgid ""
"Unpack the installation zip archive in sub folders with different names."
msgstr "Ldi tarkiwt n usbadu zip deg yiḥricen yellan d yismawen yemgaraden."

msgid "Each copy has its own web address."
msgstr "Yal tanɣalt tesɛa tansa-is web."

msgid "Everything is completely separated between the parallel copies."
msgstr "Yal tiɣawsiwin ttwabḍant akk gar tanɣalin timṣadanin."

msgid "This includes the data and the databases."
msgstr "Aya yeɛni isefka d yifafen n yisefka."

msgid "Every copy has its own independent databases."
msgstr "Yal tanɣalt tesɛa yifafen n yisefka-is yellan weḥd-sen."

msgid "Use one installation of Bibledit."
msgstr "Seqdec yiwen n usbadu n Bibledit."

msgid "Give various users read or write access to various Bibles."
msgstr "Mudd iseqdacen yemgaraden anekcum n tɣuri neɣ n tira ɣer Tira iqedsen yemgaraden."

msgid ""
"Users with write access together constitute a translation team that can edit "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Iseqdacen s unekcum n tira ddukklen i usnulfu n ugraw n tsuqilt izemren ad yeẓreg Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Source code"
msgstr "Tangalt n uɣbalu"

msgid "The Bibledit source code is kept in git repositories."
msgstr "Tangalt n uɣbalu n Bibledit tettwaḥrez deg yikaramen n yisefka git."

msgid "Hosting"
msgstr "Taggazt"

msgid ""
"To run Bibledit Cloud, a Linux VPS (virtual private server) is needed."
msgstr "I wakken ad tseqdceḍ Bibledit Cloud, yeḥwaǧ Linux VPS (aqeddac usrid uslig)."

msgid "Good providers are:"
msgstr "Imuddan yelhan d:"

msgid ""
"Several Bibledit users offer free assistance in setting up inexpensive "
"server hosting for Bibledit."
msgstr "Kra n yiseqdacen n Bibledit ttmuddun tallalt tilelli deg usbadu n uqeddac n taggazt arkas i Bibledit."

msgid "If you would like this assistance, post a message to:"
msgstr "Ma tebɣiḍ tallalt-a, azen izen ɣer:"

msgid "Security"
msgstr "Tɣellist"

msgid ""
"There are various ways to improve the security of working with Bibledit."
msgstr "Llan waṭas n yibriden i usnerni n tɣellist n uxeddim d Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Securing traffic between a users' browsers and Bibledit Cloud, and between "
"Bibledit clients and Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Aḥraz n usnernni gar yiminigen n yiseqdacen d Bibledit Cloud, u gar yimsaɣen n Bibledit d Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Obfuscating Bibledit Cloud and Bibledit Linux clients."
msgstr "Asenṭer n Bibledit Cloud d yimsaɣen n Bibledit Linux."

msgid "Accessing Bibledit Cloud through a Tor browser."
msgstr "Anekcum ɣer Bibledit Cloud s yiminig Tor."

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Tawila"

msgid "Here is more information about how to configure Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Ha-t-an ugar n talɣut ɣef wamek ara tsbaduḍ Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Install Bibledit on macOS"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef macOS"

msgid "This assumes a standard installation of the operating system."
msgstr "Aya yettwali asbadu amagnu n unagraw n useqdec."

msgid "Install Bibledit from the App Store."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit seg App Store."

msgid "Download Bibledit.zip from"
msgstr "Sider Bibledit.zip seg"

msgid "Unpack it."
msgstr "Kkes-it seg tarkiwt."

msgid "But most likely macOS will already have done this for you."
msgstr "Maca ahat macOS ad yexdem aya yakan."

msgid "Drag Bibledit to the Applications folder."
msgstr "Jbed Bibledit ɣer ukaram n Isnasen."

msgid "Start it from the Applications."
msgstr "Bdu-t seg Isnasen."

msgid "Open Bibledit."
msgstr "Ldi Bibledit."

msgid "Bibledit is ready for online and offline use."
msgstr "Bibledit yewjed i useqdec s tuqqna d war tuqqna."

msgid ""
"Swiping right or left while displaying resources navigates to the previous "
"or next verse."
msgstr "Asegrew ɣer uyeffus neɣ ɣer uzelmaḍ mi ara d-teskaneḍ iɣbula yeddu ɣer tefyirt yezrin neɣ i d-iteddun."

msgid "The same applies to the two verse-based Bible text editors."
msgstr "Ayen yellan yeḥkem sin n yibeddlen n uḍris n Tira iqedsen i yebnan ɣef tefyirt."

msgid ""
"Swiping right or left in the two chapter-based Bible text editors navigates "
"to the previous of next chapter."
msgstr "Asegrew ɣer uyeffus neɣ ɣer uzelmaḍ deg sin n yibeddlen n uḍris n Tira iqedsen i yebnan ɣef uxef yeddu ɣer uxef yezrin neɣ i d-iteddun."

msgid "Install Bibledit on Linux"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Linux"

msgid "Supported Linux distributions:"
msgstr "Tabdart n yimsaɣen Linux yettwasesmen:"

msgid "Install Bibledit on Ubuntu and derivatives."
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit ɣef Ubuntu d wid yeffɣen seg-s."

msgid "Other Linux distributions:"
msgstr "Imsaɣen-nniḍen Linux:"

msgid "Follow the steps below to install Bibledit"
msgstr "Ḍfer iḥricen-a ddaw-a i wakken ad tsebdeḍ Bibledit"

msgid "Download the Bibledit Linux installer"
msgstr "Sider asbaddi n Bibledit Linux"

msgid "Put it in the home directory."
msgstr "Err-it deg ukaram agejdan."

msgid "Run the installer:"
msgstr "Sker asbaddi:"

msgid "Bibledit is an application for translating the Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit d asnas i tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "People can sign up for an account and log in."
msgstr "Imdanen zemren ad ttwaɣen d amiḍan u ad qqnen."

msgid "Each user has a certain role within the application."
msgstr "Yal aseqdac sɛa tamlilt tamatut deg usnas."

msgid ""
"The first role is Member. A member is somebody who has signed up to the "
"site, and has confirmed this signup through his email."
msgstr "Tamlilt tamezwarut d Aɛeggal. Aɛeggal d win i yeɣran ɣer usmel, u isentem aya s imayl-is."

msgid ""
"The second role is Consultant. Consultants are people who can be consulted "
"because of their knowledge of the original language such as Hebrew or Greek, "
"or because of their knowledge of their target language in case they are "
"language scholars, or for any other knowledge they have."
msgstr "Tamlilt tis snat d Amnadi. Imnadiyen d imdanen izemren ad ttwanadin ɣef tmusni-nsen n tutlayt tazarut am Tebrit neɣ Tagrikit, neɣ ɣef tmusni n tutlayt-nsen ma llan d inaẓuren n tutlayt, neɣ ɣef tmusni-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"The next role is Translator. These are the ones that have all the rights of "
"the Consultant, but in addition can change the Bible text."
msgstr "Tamlilt i d-iteddun d Amsuqel. Wigi d wid i yesɛan izerfan meṛṛa n Umnadi, maca zemren ad beddlen aḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"Then there's the Manager. The manager has all the privileges of the previous "
"levels, but in addition can add books to the Bible, delete books, add "
"chapters, copy Bibles, and so on. The manager can assign privileges to the "
"translators, consultants, and so on."
msgstr "Syin llan Amsefrek. Amsefrek yesɛa izerfan meṛṛa n tilɣa timezwura, maca izmer ad yernu idlisen ɣer Tira iqedsen, ad yekkes idlisen, ad yernu ixfawen, ad yenɣel Tira iqedsen, d wayen-nniḍen. Amsefrek izmer ad yefk izerfan i yimsuqal, imnadiyen, d wayen-nniḍen."

msgid ""
"Finally, there is the Administrator. The administrator has all rights to do "
"anything, and will do the technical setup and maintenance of the site."
msgstr "Taggara, llan Anedbal. Anedbal yesɛa izerfan meṛṛa i ixdem kra, u ad yexdem asbadu d uḥraz n tiknulujit n usmel."

msgid ""
"Everybody who has an account can enable the personal notifications. Those "
"who have switched the relevant notifications on can receive email from "
"Bibledit. They receive email when new consultation notes get created, or "
"when consultation notes get changed, or when consultation notes get assigned "
"to them. They can also get automatic daily email detailing the changes that "
"have been made in the Bible since the previous email."
msgstr "Yal yiwen yesɛan amiḍan izmer ad yesremd ilɣa udmawanen. Wid yerman ilɣa iwatan zemren ad ṭṭfen imayl seg Bibledit. Ṭṭafen imayl mi ara ttwasnulfun tizmilin n umɛiwen timaynutin, neɣ mi ara ttwabeddlen tizmilin n umɛiwen, neɣ mi ara ttwabrent tizmilin n umɛiwen fell-asen. Zemren daɣen ad ṭṭfen imayl awurman n yal ass s yisnifal i d-yettwaxedmen deg Tira iqedsen segmi i yimayl yezrin."

msgid ""
"Everybody who has an account can create consultation notes by email, and "
"respond to these by email."
msgstr "Yal yiwen yesɛan amiḍan izmer ad isnulfu tizmilin n umɛiwen s imayl, u ad d-yerr fell-asent s imayl."

msgid ""
"Members can view and download all exported Bibles and lists with recent "
"changes in the Bibles."
msgstr "Iɛeggalen zemren ad walin u ad sidren Tira iqedsen meṛṛa yettwasifḍen d tebdarin n yisnifal imaynuten deg Tira iqedsen."

msgid ""
"Consultants can create consultation notes online, view these, set parameters "
"for these, assign the notes to people, and delete notes."
msgstr "Imnadiyen zemren ad snulfun tizmilin n umɛiwen srid, ad ten-walin, ad sbadun iɣewwaṛen-nsent, ad beṛṛun tizmilin i yimdanen, u ad kksen tizmilin."

msgid "Translators can do the following things:"
msgstr "Imsuqal zemren ad xedmen tiɣawsiwin-a:"

msgid "Edit the Bible text."
msgstr "Ẓreg aḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Switch the stylesheet."
msgstr "Beddel tasebtayt."

msgid "View and suppress results of the automatic checks."
msgstr "Wali u sefsex igmuḍen n yisenqad imaṭṭafen."

msgid "Managers can do several things:"
msgstr "Imsefrak zemren ad xedmen aṭas n tɣawsiwin:"

msgid "Edit the Bible in raw USFM format."
msgstr "Ẓreg Tira iqedsen deg umasal USFM ussid."

msgid ""
"Send and receive the Bible text. This means that they can synchronize the "
"Bible text with a remote git repository. In this way they can collaborate "
"with people who use Bibledit-Gtk."
msgstr "Azen u ṭṭef aḍris n Tira iqedsen. Aya yeɛni belli zemren ad mtawin aḍris n Tira iqedsen d ukaram n yisefka git alɣaw. S wabrid-a zemren ad mɛiwnen d yimdanen i yesseqdacen Bibledit-Gtk."

msgid "View and clear the logbook."
msgstr "Wali u sfeḍ aɣmis."

msgid ""
"Process the changes, so that lists are created, and email is sent out."
msgstr "Ɛeddi isnifal, iwakken ad d-ttwarnun tebdarin, u ad ttwaznen imaylen."

msgid "View and edit people who have an account, and create new accounts."
msgstr "Wali u ẓreg imdanen yesɛan amiḍan, u snulfu imiḍanen imaynuten."

msgid "Create and delete Bibles, books, chapters, and import USFM data."
msgstr "Snulfu u kkes Tira iqedsen, idlisen, ixfawen, u kter isefka USFM."

msgid ""
"Initiate the daily export of selected Bibles to OpenDocument, USFM, html, "
"Online Bible."
msgstr "Bdu asifeḍ n yal ass n Tira iqedsen yettwafernen ɣer OpenDocument, USFM, html, Online Bible."

msgid "Create and edit versification systems."
msgstr "Snulfu u ẓreg inagrawen n tefyar."

msgid "Create and edit stylesheets."
msgstr "Snulfu u ẓreg tisebtayin."

msgid "Import consultation notes from Bibledit-Gtk and remove duplicates."
msgstr "Kter tizmilin n umɛiwen seg Bibledit-Gtk u kkes tiyugin."

msgid "Deal with automatic hyphenation when exporting to OpenDocument."
msgstr "Ɛeddi aṭṭekkul n wawalen awurman mi ara tsifḍeḍ ɣer OpenDocument."

msgid ""
"Make settings for the automatic check and select Bibles to run them on."
msgstr "Xdem iɣewwaṛen i usenqed awurman u fren Tira iqedsen ara yettwaxdem fell-asent."

msgid "Administrator can do several things:"
msgstr "Anedbal izmer ad yexdem aṭas n tɣawsiwin:"

msgid "Set up Bibledit's email account."
msgstr "Sbadu amiḍan n imayl n Bibledit."

msgid ""
"Set up collaboration through setting up a connection with a remote git "
"repository."
msgstr "Sbadu amɛiwen s usbadu n tuqqna d ukaram n yisefka git alɣaw."

msgid "Maintain the databases."
msgstr "Ḥrez yifafen n yisefka."

msgid "Set the site's timezone."
msgstr "Sbadu tallunt n wakud n usmel."

msgid "Set the site's language."
msgstr "Sbadu tutlayt n usmel."

msgid "Install Bibledit Cloud from source"
msgstr "Sbedd Bibledit Cloud seg uɣbalu"

msgid "Select the Linux distribution for which to show instructions."
msgstr "Fren anagraw n Linux i wakken ad d-banen iwellihen."

msgid "Then follow the steps below to install Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Syin ḍfer iḥricen-a ddaw-a i wakken ad tsebdeḍ Bibledit Cloud."

msgid "Update the software sources."
msgstr "Leqqem iɣbula n useɣzan."

msgid "Install and enable extra package repositories."
msgstr "Sbedd u rmed ikaramen n yiɣazen imaynuten."

msgid "Install the software Bibledit relies on:"
msgstr "Sbedd aseɣzan i yettwarna Bibledit fell-as:"

msgid "Go to the home directory."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer ukaram agejdan."

msgid "Download a recent version of Bibledit."
msgstr "Sider lqem amaynut n Bibledit."

msgid "Unpack the downloaded Bibledit in folder bibledit."
msgstr "Kkes Bibledit i d-tesdareḍ deg ukaram bibledit."

msgid ""
"Change the xxx above to the version number of Bibledit that was downloaded."
msgstr "Beddel xxx n ufella ɣer uṭṭun n lqem n Bibledit i d-tesdareḍ."

msgid "Change to the directory."
msgstr "Ddu ɣer ukaram."

msgid "Build Bibledit."
msgstr "Snulfu Bibledit."

msgid "This takes a while."
msgstr "Aya yeṭṭef kra n wakud."

msgid "There will be many technical messages, but there should be no errors."
msgstr "Ad llin aṭas n yiznan unnig, maca ur ilaq ara ad llin tuccḍiwin."

msgid "Open port 8080 in the firewall."
msgstr "Ldi tcuṭṭut 8080 deg ukayad n tmes."

msgid "Start Bibledit."
msgstr "Bdu Bibledit."

msgid "Most of Bibledit Cloud will now be working."
msgstr "Aṭas seg Bibledit Cloud ad yettxeddem tura."

msgid ""
"To get email services working, connect Bibledit to a gmail or other mail "
"account."
msgstr "I wakken ad xedmen tqedcin n imayl, qqen Bibledit ɣer umiḍan gmail neɣ amiḍan-nniḍen n imayl."

msgid "To get SWORD resources working, install the SWORD libraries."
msgstr "I wakken ad xedmen iɣbula SWORD, sbedd tisegzawin SWORD."

msgid ""
"Bibledit assists with checking how consistent words have been translated in "
"the Bible."
msgstr "Bibledit yettallal deg usenqed n wamek i d-ttwasuqlen wawalen s wudem imṣadan deg Tira iqedsen."

msgid "The suggested work-flow for consistency checking is this:"
msgstr "Abrid n uxeddim i yettwasumer i usenqed n umṣada d wa:"

msgid ""
"Create a Consultation Note, and enter the details of the desired consistency "
"check, plus the passages to check."
msgstr "Snulfu Tazmilt n Umɛiwen, u sekcem talɣut n usenqed n umṣada i tebɣiḍ, d tefyar ara yettwasenqden."

msgid "Open the Consistency tool in a new tab."
msgstr "Ldi allal n Umṣada deg iccer amaynut."

msgid ""
"Copy the passages from the Consultation Note and paste them in the "
"Consistency tool."
msgstr "Nɣel tifyar seg Tezmilt n Umɛiwen u senteḍ-itent deg allal n Umṣada."

msgid ""
"Enter the desired translation or translations in the Consistency tool."
msgstr "Sekcem tasuqilt neɣ tisuqilin i tebɣiḍ deg allal n Umṣada."

msgid ""
"The Consistency tool will display the verse texts from the active Bible."
msgstr "Allal n Umṣada ad d-yesken iḍrisen n tefyar seg Tira iqedsen tamirant."

msgid "It will mark the translations in the verse."
msgstr "Ad yecreḍ tisuqilin deg tefyirt."

msgid "To make corrections, click a Passage."
msgstr "I wakken ad txedmeḍ ṣṣeḥḥat, sit ɣef Tefyirt."

msgid "The text editor will open at the correct chapter and verse."
msgstr "Abeddel n uḍris ad yeldi deg uxef d tefyirt iwatan."

msgid "Changes can be made in the text."
msgstr "Isnifal zemren ad ttwaxedmen deg uḍris."

msgid "The Consistency tool will display any updates in the Bible."
msgstr "Allal n Umṣada ad d-yesken ileqqmen meṛṛa deg Tira iqedsen."

msgid "The Consistency tool can display extra Bibles."
msgstr "Allal n Umṣada izmer ad d-yesken Tira iqedsen-nniḍen."

msgid "This assists the checking process."
msgstr "Aya yettallal deg ukala n usenqed."

msgid "Several pages have a Passage Navigator on top."
msgstr "Kra n yisebtar sɛan Unaway n Tefyar deg ufella."

msgid "It consists of the name of the book, the chapter, and the verse."
msgstr "Yesɛa isem n udlis, uxef, d tefyirt."

msgid "Matthew 1:1."
msgstr "Matta 1:1."

msgid "The navigator enables you to go to another passage."
msgstr "Unaway ittaǧǧa-k ad tedduḍ ɣer tefyirt-nniḍen."

msgid "Click on the name of the book to navigate to another book."
msgstr "Sit ɣef yisem n udlis i wakken ad tedduḍ ɣer udlis-nniḍen."

msgid "In the same way you can click on the chapter and on the verse."
msgstr "S wudem am wa tzemreḍ ad tsitiḍ ɣef uxef d tefyirt."

msgid "You can also use the keyboard to navigate."
msgstr "Tzemreḍ daɣen ad tseqdceḍ unasiw i unnig."

msgid "On touch screens you can swipe to navigate."
msgstr "Ɣef yigdilen n tangalt tzemreḍ ad tesgerwed i unnig."

msgid "The Navigator shows two arrows:"
msgstr "Unaway d-yesken sin n tineɣrufin:"

msgid "Clicking"
msgstr "Asit"

msgid "goes back in the navigation history."
msgstr "yeddu ɣer deffir deg umazray n unnig."

msgid "goes forward in the navigation history."
msgstr "yeddu ɣer zdat deg umazray n unnig."

msgid "There are also keyboard shortcuts for it."
msgstr "Llan daɣen inegzumen n unasiw i waya."

msgid "A long click on any of these two arrows brings up the history menu."
