msgstr "Abeṭṭu n tmusni aswir 4"

msgid "Chapter number"
msgstr "Uṭṭun n uxef"

msgid "For the chapter number."
msgstr "I uṭṭun n uxef."

msgid "Alternate chapter number"
msgstr "Uṭṭun n uxef wayeḍ"

msgid ""
"Second or alternate chapter number. For coding dual versification. Useful "
"for places where different traditions of chapter breaks need to be supported "
"in the same translation."
msgstr "Uṭṭun wis sin neɣ wayeḍ n uxef. I tengalt n unagraw n tefyar amṣadan. Yelha deg yidgan anda tarrayin yemgaraden n tebḍut n yixfawen ilaq ad ttwasemmden deg yiwet n tsuqilt."

