msgstr "Asekkil n uxef yettwasuffɣen"

msgid ""
"Published chapter number. This is a chapter marking that would be used in "
"the published text."
msgstr "Uṭṭun n uxef yettwasuffɣen. Wagi d tacreḍt n uxef ara yettwaseqdac deg uḍris yettwasuffɣen."

