"Published verse marker. This is a verse marking that would be used in the "
"published text."
msgstr "Tacreḍt n tefyirt yettwasuffɣen. Wagi d tacreḍt n tefyirt ara yettwaseqdacen deg uḍris yettwasuffɣen."

