"Paragraph text, level 1 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart, aswir 1 n usentṭi ma yella aṭas n yisweren, s uzirig amezwaru yettwasentṭen; yettwaseqdac aṭas i udiwenni."

msgid "Indented paragraph level 2"
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen aswir 2"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, level 2 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart, aswir 2 n usentṭi ma yella aṭas n yisweren, s uzirig amezwaru yettwasentṭen; yettwaseqdac aṭas i udiwenni."

