"Paragraph text, level 3 indent if multiple levels, with first line indent; "
"often used for discourse."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart, aswir 3 n usentṭi ma yella aṭas n yisweren, s uzirig amezwaru yettwasentṭen; yettwaseqdac aṭas i udiwenni."

