"Margin paragraph text, indented, with no first line indent, often used for "
"discourse."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart n yiɣrim, yettwasentṭen, war uzirig amezwaru yettwasentṭen, yettwaseqdac aṭas i udiwenni."

