msgstr "War taguni d taseddart yezrin"

msgid ""
"Paragraph text, with no break from previous paragraph text at chapter "
"boundary."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart, war taguni d uḍris n taseddart yezrin deg tama n uxef."

msgid "Centered paragraph"
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasenṭen deg wammas"

msgid "Paragraph text, centered, for inscription."
msgstr "Aḍris n taseddart, yettwasenṭen deg wammas, i usekkil n tira."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent"
msgstr "Taseddart s usentṭi yettwajbed"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen s usentṭi yettwajbed."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 1"
msgstr "Taseddart s usentṭi yettwajbed aswir 1"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 1 if multiple levels."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen s usentṭi yettwajbed, aswir 1 ma yella aṭas n yisweren."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 2"
msgstr "Taseddart s usentṭi yettwajbed aswir 2"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 2."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen s usentṭi yettwajbed, aswir 2."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 3"
msgstr "Taseddart s usentṭi yettwajbed aswir 3"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 3."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen s usentṭi yettwajbed, aswir 3."

msgid "Paragraph with hanging indent level 4"
msgstr "Taseddart s usentṭi yettwajbed aswir 4"

msgid "Indented paragraph with hanging indent, level 4."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasentṭen s usentṭi yettwajbed, aswir 4."

msgid "Blank line"
msgstr "Izirig ilem"

msgid ""
"May be used to explicitly indicate additional white space between "
"paragraphs. Poetry text stanza break."
msgstr "Yezmer ad yettwaseqdec i usentem n tallunt tamellalt gar tiseddarin. Taggara n yiḍrisen n tmedyazt."

msgid "Poetic line"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt"

msgid "Poetry text, level 1 indent if single level."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, aswir 1 n usentṭi ma yella yiwen n uswir."

msgid "Poetry text, level 1 indent if multiple levels."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, aswir 1 n usentṭi ma yella aṭas n yisweren."

msgid "Poetry text, level 2 indent."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, aswir 2 n usentṭi."

msgid "Poetry text, level 3 indent."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, aswir 3 n usentṭi."

msgid "Right-aligned poetic line"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "Commonly used for a poetic refrain."
msgstr "S wudem amagnu yettwaseqdac i tuɣalin n tmedyazt."

msgid "Centered poetic line"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt yettwasenṭen deg wammas"

msgid "Poetry text, centered."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, yettwasenṭen deg wammas."

msgid "Selah"
msgstr "Selah"

msgid "Poetry text, Selah."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, Selah."

msgid "Acrostic heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tmedyazt s yisekkilen"

msgid "Poetry text, acrostic marker or heading."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, tacreḍt neɣ azwel n tmedyazt s yisekkilen."

msgid "Acrostic letter"
msgstr "Asekkil n tmedyazt s yisekkilen"

msgid ""
"Poetry text, acrostic markup of the first character of a line of acrostic "
"poetry."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, asecreḍ n usekkil amezwaru n yizirig n tmedyazt s yisekkilen."

msgid "Embedded text poetic line"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt n uḍris yettwarnan"

msgid "Poetry text, embedded, level 1 indent, if single level."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, yettwarnan, aswir 1 n usentṭi, ma yella yiwen n uswir."

msgid "Embedded text poetic line level 1"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt n uḍris yettwarnan aswir 1"

msgid "Poetry text, embedded, level 1 indent, if multiple levels."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, yettwarnan, aswir 1 n usentṭi, ma yella aṭas n yisweren."

msgid "Embedded text poetic line level 2"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt n uḍris yettwarnan aswir 2"

msgid "Poetry text, embedded, level 2 indent."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, yettwarnan, aswir 2 n usentṭi."

msgid "Embedded text poetic line level 3"
msgstr "Izirig n tmedyazt n uḍris yettwarnan aswir 3"

msgid "Poetry text, embedded, level 3 indent."
msgstr "Aḍris n tmedyazt, yettwarnan, aswir 3 n usentṭi."

msgid "Hebrew note"
msgstr "Tazmilt n Tebrit"

msgid ""
"A Hebrew musical performance comment similar in content to many of the "
"Hebrew Psalm titles, but placed at the end of the poetic section."
msgstr "Awennit n tigawt n tmedyazt s Tebrit yemṣada deg ugbur d waṭas n yizwal n Zzabur n Tebrit, maca yettwasers deg taggara n uḥric n tmedyazt."

msgid "List header"
msgstr "Azwel n tebdart"

msgid ""
"Some lists include an introductory and concluding remark. They are an "
"integral part of the list content, but are not list items. A list does not "
"require either or both of these elements."
msgstr "Kra n tebdarin sɛant awennit n tazwara d wayeḍ n taggara. Ttili d aḥric ameɣtu n ugbur n tebdart, maca mačči d iferdisen n tebdart. Tebdart ur teḥwaǧ ara yiwen neɣ sin seg yiferdisen-a."

msgid "List entry"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart"

msgid "List entry level 1"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart aswir 1"

msgid "List entry level 2"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart aswir 2"

msgid "List entry level 3"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart, aswir 3."

msgid "A list entry, level 3."
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart aswir 3"

msgid "List entry level 4"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart aswir 4"

msgid "A list entry, level 4."
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart, aswir 4."

msgid "List footer"
msgstr "Aḍfar n tebdart"

msgid "Embedded list entry"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart yettwarnan"

msgid ""
"An out-dented paragraph meant to highlight the items of an embedded list."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasenṭen ɣer beṛṛa i usentem n yiferdisen n tebdart yettwarnan."

msgid "Embedded list entry level 1"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart yettwarnan aswir 1"

msgid ""
"An out-dented paragraph meant to highlight the items of an embedded list, "
"level 1."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasenṭen ɣer beṛṛa i usentem n yiferdisen n tebdart yettwarnan, aswir 1."

msgid "Embedded list entry level 2"
msgstr "Aferdis n tebdart yettwarnan aswir 2"

msgid ""
"An out-dented paragraph meant to highlight the items of an embedded list, "
"level 2."
msgstr "Taseddart yettwasenṭen ɣer beṛṛa i usentem n yiferdisen n tebdart yettwarnan, aswir 2."

msgid "List entry total"
msgstr "Asemday n uferdis n tebdart"

msgid ""
"Use in accounting lists for denoting the total component of the text within "
"a list item."
msgstr "Seqdec deg tebdarin n uḥsab i usentem n uḥric n usemday n uḍris deg uferdis n tebdart."

msgid "List entry key"
msgstr "Tasarut n uferdis n tebdart"

msgid "For list entry key content."
msgstr "I ugbur n tsarut n uferdis n tebdart."

msgid "List entry value"
msgstr "Azal n uferdis n tebdart"

msgid "For list entry value content."
msgstr "I ugbur n uzal n uferdis n tebdart."

msgid "List entry value level 1"
msgstr "Azal n uferdis n tebdart aswir 1"

msgid "For list entry value content level 1."
msgstr "I ugbur n uzal n uferdis n tebdart aswir 1."

msgid "List entry value level 2"
msgstr "Azal n uferdis n tebdart aswir 2"

msgid "For list entry value content level 2."
msgstr "I ugbur n uzal n uferdis n tebdart aswir 2."

msgid "Table row start"
msgstr "Tazwara n uzirig n tfelwit"

msgid "A new table row."
msgstr "Azirig amaynut n tfelwit."

msgid "Table column 1 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 1 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table heading, column 1."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 1."

msgid "Table column 2 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 2 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table heading, column 2."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 2."

msgid "Table column 3 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 3 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table heading, column 3."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 3."

msgid "Table column 4 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 4 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table heading, column 4."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 4."

msgid "Right aligned table column 1 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 1 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table heading, column 1, right aligned."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 1, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table column 2 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 2 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table heading, column 2, right aligned."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 2, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table column 3 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 3 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table heading, column 3, right aligned."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 3, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table column 4 heading"
msgstr "Azwel n tgejdit 4 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table heading, column 4, right aligned."
msgstr "Azwel n tfelwit, tagejdit 4, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Table column 1 cell"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 1 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table cell item, column 1."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 1."

msgid "Table column 2 cell"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 2 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table cell item, column 2."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 2."

msgid "Table column 3 cell"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 3 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table cell item, column 3."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 3."

msgid "Table column 4 cell"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 4 n tfelwit"

msgid "A table cell item, column 4."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 4."

msgid "Right aligned table cell column 1"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 1 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table cell item, column 1, right aligned."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 1, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table cell column 2"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 2 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table cell item, column 2, right aligned."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 2, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table cell column 3"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 3 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table cell item, column 3, right aligned."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 3, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Right aligned table cell column 4"
msgstr "Tasulect n tgejdit 4 n tfelwit yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus"

msgid "A table cell item, column 4, right aligned."
msgstr "Aferdis n tasulect n tfelwit, tagejdit 4, yettwasentel ɣer uyeffus."

msgid "Footnote"
msgstr "Tazmilt n uduɣ"

msgid "A footnote text item."
msgstr "Aferdis n uḍris n tezmilt n uduɣ."

msgid "Endnote"
msgstr "Tazmilt n taggara"

msgid "An endnote text item."
msgstr "Aferdis n uḍris n tezmilt n taggara."

msgid "Footnote origin reference"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin n uɣbalu n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid "This is the chapter and verse or verses that note refers to."
msgstr "Wagi d uxef d tefyirt neɣ tefyar i yerzan tazmilt."

msgid "Footnote translation quotation"
msgstr "Tinfaliyt n tsuqilt n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"A quotation from the current scripture text translation for which the note "
"is being provided."
msgstr "Tinfaliyt seg tsuqilt tamirant n uḍris n Tira iqedsen i d-tettwafk tazmilt."

msgid "Footnote alternate translation"
msgstr "Tasuqilt-nniḍen n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"Used to distinguish between a quotation of the current scripture text "
"translation, and an alternate translation."
msgstr "Yettwaseqdac i usemgirad gar tinfaliyt n tsuqilt tamirant n uḍris n Tira iqedsen, d tsuqilt-nniḍen."

msgid "Footnote keyword"
msgstr "Awal agejdan n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"The specific keyword or term from the text for which the footnote is being "
"provided."
msgstr "Awal agejdan neɣ tasemlit seg uḍris i d-tettwafk tezmilt n uduɣ."

msgid "Footnote label text"
msgstr "Aḍris n tabalt n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"Can be used for labeling word(s) which are used consistently across certain "
"types of translation notes, such as the words 'Or' in an alternative "
"translation note, 'Others', 'Heb.', 'LXX' etc."
msgstr "Yezmer ad yettwaseqdec i usecreḍ n wawal(en) yettwaseqdacen s wudem imṣadan deg kra n wanawen n tizmilin n tsuqilt, am awal 'Neɣ' deg tezmilt n tsuqilt tayeḍ, 'Wiyaḍ', 'Heb.', 'LXX' d wayen-nniḍen."

msgid "Footnote witness list"
msgstr "Tabdart n inigan n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"For distinguishing a list of sigla representing witnesses in critical "
"editions."
msgstr "I usemgirad n tebdart n yisekkilen yettwaḥsben d inigan deg yisuffeɣen imeqqranen."

msgid "Footnote additional paragraph"
msgstr "Taseddart tamerniwt n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"Use this marker to if you need to indicate the start of a new paragraph "
"within a footnote."
msgstr "Seqdec tacreḍt-a ma tebɣiḍ ad d-tesnulfuḍ tazwara n taseddart tamaynut deg tezmilt n uduɣ."

msgid "Footnote verse number"
msgstr "Uṭṭun n tefyirt n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid "A verse number within the footnote text."
msgstr "Uṭṭun n tefyirt deg uḍris n tezmilt n uduɣ."

msgid "Footnote text"
msgstr "Aḍris n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid "The essential or explanatory text of the footnote."
msgstr "Aḍris yesra neɣ aḍris n uglam n tezmilt n uduɣ."

msgid "Footnote Deuterocanonical content"
msgstr "Agbur Deuterocanonique n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid ""
"Text between these markers is material to be included only in published "
"editions that contain the Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr "Aḍris gar tecraḍin-a d aḍris ara yettwarnun kan deg yisuffeɣen yesɛan idlisen Deuterocanonique."

msgid "Footnote reference mark"
msgstr "Tacreḍt n tuɣalin n tezmilt n uduɣ"

msgid "An additional footnote marker location for a previous footnote."
msgstr "Adig-nniḍen n tacreḍt n tezmilt n uduɣ i tezmilt n uduɣ yezrin."

msgid "Cross reference"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin"

msgid "A list of cross references."
msgstr "Tabdart n tuccḍa n tuɣalin."

msgid "Cross reference origin reference"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin n uɣbalu n tuɣalin"

msgid ""
"This is the chapter and verse or verses that target references are being "
"provided for."
msgstr "Wagi d uxef d tefyirt neɣ tefyar i d-ttwafkent tuɣalin n taɣda."

msgid "Cross reference keyword"
msgstr "Awal agejdan n tuccḍa n tuɣalin"

msgid ""
"A keyword from the scripture translation text which the target references "
"also refer to."
msgstr "Awal agejdan seg uḍris n tsuqilt n Tira iqedsen i yerzan daɣen tuɣalin n taɣda."

msgid "Cross reference quotation"
msgstr "Tinfaliyt n tuccḍa n tuɣalin"

msgid "A cross reference quotation from the scripture text."
msgstr "Tinfaliyt n tuccḍa n tuɣalin seg uḍris n Tira iqedsen."

msgid "Cross reference target references"
msgstr "Tuɣalin n taɣda n tuccḍa n tuɣalin"

msgid "The cross reference target references."
msgstr "Tuɣalin n taɣda n tuccḍa n tuɣalin."

msgid "Target references added text"
msgstr "Aḍris yettwarnan n tuɣalin n taɣda"

msgid "Used for marking text added to the target references."
msgstr "Yettwaseqdac i usecreḍ n uḍris yettwarnan ɣer tuɣalin n taɣda."

msgid "Published cross reference origin text"
msgstr "Aḍris n uɣbalu n tuccḍa n tuɣalin yettwasuffɣen"

msgid "Supplies the origin text intended for publishing."
msgstr "Yettmuddu aḍris n uɣbalu i usuffeɣ."

msgid "Cross reference Old Testament"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin n Uneggaru Aqbur"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Old Testament books."
msgstr "Agbur gar tecraḍin-a d ayen ara yettwarnun deg yisuffeɣen yesɛan idlisen n Uneggaru Aqbur."

msgid "Cross reference New Testament"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin n Uneggaru Amaynut"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"New Testament books."
msgstr "Agbur gar tecraḍin-a d ayen ara yettwarnun deg yisuffeɣen yesɛan idlisen n Uneggaru Amaynut."

msgid "Cross reference deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Tuccḍa n tuɣalin deuterocanonique"

msgid ""
"Content between these markers is for inclusion in editions that contain the "
"Deuterocanonical books."
msgstr "Agbur gar tecraḍin-a d ayen ara yettwarnun deg yisuffeɣen yesɛan idlisen Deuterocanonique."

msgid "Translator’s addition"
msgstr "Timerniwt n umsuqel"

msgid ""
"A translator’s explanation - words added by the translator for clarity – "
"text which is not literally a part of the original language, but which was "
"supplied to make the meaning of the original clear."
msgstr "Asumer n umsuqel - awalen yettwarnan sɣur umsuqel i usefru – aḍris ur yelli ara d aḥric usrid n tutlayt tazarut, maca yettwarna i wakken ad d-yeffeɣ lmeɛna n uḍris aẓar."

msgid "Quoted book title"
msgstr "Azwel n udlis yettwabder"

msgid "For the quoted name of a book."
msgstr "I yisem yettwabder n udlis."

msgid "Deuterocanonical"
msgstr "Deuterocanonique"

msgid ""
"Deuterocanonical / LXX additions or insertions in the Protocanonical text."
msgstr "Timerniwin neɣ tamerna n Deuterocanonique / LXX deg uḍris Protocanonique."

msgid "Keyword"
msgstr "Awal agejdan"

msgid "Keyword / keyterm."
msgstr "Awal agejdan / awal azadur."

msgid "Liturgical note"
msgstr "Tazmilt n tegnatin"

msgid ""
"A guide which tells the reader or worshipper that he should recite a prayer "
"or recitation etc."
msgstr "Allal i d-yeqqaren i uɣer neɣ i umeɛbed belli ilaq ad iɣer taɣuri neɣ asɣel d wayen-nniḍen."

msgid "Name of God"
msgstr "Isem n Ṛebbi"

msgid "For name of God (name of Deity)."
msgstr "I yisem n Ṛebbi (isem n Ṛebbi)."

msgid "Ordinal number ending"
msgstr "Taggara n uṭṭun n yiṭṭunen"

msgid "For the text portion of an ordinal number."
msgstr "I uḥric n uḍris n uṭṭun n yiṭṭunen."

msgid "Proper name"
msgstr "Isem ibanen"

msgid "For a proper name."
msgstr "I yisem ibanen."

msgid "Geographic proper name"
msgstr "Isem ibanen n tmurt"

msgid "For a geographic proper name."
msgstr "I yisem ibanen n tmurt."

msgid "Combined add and pn style"
msgstr "Anaw n tmerna d pn"

msgid "Support for overlapping pn ...pn* and add ...add* occurrences."
msgstr "Tallalt i d-yeḍran gar pn ...pn* d add ...add* i yemṣadan."

msgid "Quoted text"
msgstr "Aḍris yettwabder"

msgid "Old Testament quotations in the New Testament, or other quotations."
msgstr "Tinfaliyin n Uneggaru Aqbur deg Uneggaru Amaynut, neɣ tinfaliyin-nniḍen."

msgid "Signature of the author"
msgstr "Azmul n umeskar"

msgid "Signature of the author of a letter or epistle."
msgstr "Azmul n umeskar n tebrat neɣ n tebrat."

msgid "Secondary language source"
msgstr "Aɣbalu n tutlayt tis snat"

msgid ""
"Passage of text based on a secondary language or alternate text source."
msgstr "Aḥric n uḍris ibnan ɣef tutlayt tis snat neɣ ɣef uɣbalu n uḍris wayeḍ."

msgid "Transliterated text"
msgstr "Aḍris yettwabeddel"

msgid "Transliterated or foreign word or text."
msgstr "Awal neɣ aḍris yettwabeddel neɣ n beṛṛa."

msgid "Words of Jesus"
msgstr "Awalen n Sidna Ɛisa"

msgid "For marking the words of Jesus."
msgstr "I usecreḍ n wawalen n Sidna Ɛisa."

msgid "Emphasized text"
msgstr "Aḍris yettwasennaɣ"

msgid "For emphasizing a portion of text."
msgstr "I usennaɣ n uḥric n uḍris."

msgid "Bold text"
msgstr "Aḍris azuran"

msgid "For making a portion of text bold."
msgstr "I tuzurit n uḥric n uḍris."

msgid "Italic text"
msgstr "Aḍris uneɣli"

msgid "For putting some text in italics."
msgstr "I terra n kra n uḍris deg uneɣli."

msgid "Bold-italic text"
msgstr "Aḍris azuran-uneɣli"

msgid "For putting some text in bold and italics."
msgstr "I terra n kra n uḍris azuran u uneɣli."

msgid "Normal text"
msgstr "Aḍris amagnu"

msgid ""
"May be used when a larger paragraph element is set in an alternate font "
"style, e.g. italic, and a selected section of text should be displayed in "
"normal text."
msgstr "Yezmer ad yettwaseqdec mi ara yili uferdis ameqqran n taseddart s tɣessa n tsefsit tayeḍ, amedya uneɣli, u aḥric yettwafernen n uḍris ilaq ad d-yettwaskan s uḍris amagnu."

msgid "Small-cap text"
msgstr "Aḍris n yisekkilen imeqqranen imeẓẓyanen"

msgid "For putting some text in small capitals."
msgstr "I terra n kra n uḍris s yisekkilen imeqqranen imeẓẓyanen."

msgid "Superscript text"
msgstr "Aḍris uzzig"

msgid "Superscript text typically for use in critical edition footnotes."
msgstr "Aḍris uzzig yettwaseqdac s wudem amagnu deg tizmilin n uduɣ n yisuffeɣen imeqqranen."

msgid "Page break"
msgstr "Taggara n usebter"

msgid "Explicit page break."
msgstr "Taggara n usebter tuẓẓint."

msgid "Figure / illustration / map"
msgstr "Tugna / aglam / tkarḍa"

msgid "Illustration [columns to span, height, filename, caption text]."
msgstr "Aglam [tgejdiyin ara yezzin, teɣzi, isem n ufaylu, aḍris n uglam]."

msgid "Subject index entry"
msgstr "Asekcem n tafelwit n usentel"

msgid ""
"Surround a word or words with this markup to indicate that it should appear "
"in the subject index."
msgstr "Zzi awal neɣ awalen s tecraḍt-a i usken belli ilaq ad d-banen deg tafelwit n usentel."

msgid "Annotated base text"
msgstr "Aḍris azadur yettwarnan s tizmilin"

msgid "Used to mark the base text being annotated with ruby characters."
msgstr "Yettwaseqdac i usecreḍ n uḍris azadur yettwarnan s yisekkilen n ruby."

msgid "Pronunciation annotation"
msgstr "Tizmilt n usiwel"

msgid "For indicating pronunciation in CJK texts."
msgstr "I usken n usiwel deg yiḍrisen CJK."

msgid "Wordlist entry"
msgstr "Asekcem n tebdart n wawalen"

msgid ""
"Surround words with this markup to indicate that it should appear in the "
"word list."
msgstr "Zzi awalen s tecraḍt-a i usken belli ilaq ad d-banen deg tebdart n wawalen."

msgid "Greek word list entry"
msgstr "Asekcem n tebdart n wawalen n Tagrikit"

