msgid ""
"To which city was Paul travelling when a light from heaven shone round about "
"him?"
msgstr "Ɣer tamdint n wacu i yella Pawel i tuɣal mi i d-yeffeɣ ubrid n tafat seg igenni ɣer-s?"

msgid "Damascus"
msgstr "Dimicq"

msgid ""
"And while he travelled, he came near Damascus; and suddenly a light from "
"heaven shone round about him."
msgstr "U mi yella ittruḥ, yeqqerreb ɣer Dimicq; u deg tazzla yeffeɣ-d ɣer-s ubrid n tafat seg igenni."

msgid "What is the name of the brother of Aaron the high priest?"
msgstr "Acu-t yisem n gma n Haṛun, ameqqran n imedditen?"

msgid "Moses"
msgstr "Musa"

msgid ""
"And the anger of Jehova was kindled against Moses, and he said: Is not Aaron "
"the Levite your brother?"
msgstr "U yeṭṭef ṣṣeḥ ccan n Ṛebbi ɣef Musa, u yenna: Ma ur yelli ara Haṛun aɛewjis gma-k?"

msgid "What is the name of the city where Jesus was born?"
msgstr "Acu-t yisem n tmurt anda yella yettwaleɛ Sidna Ɛisa?"

msgid "Bethlehem"
msgstr "Bitlaḥem"

msgid ""
"When Jesus was born in Bethlehem of Judaea in the days of Herod the king, "
"behold, wise men from the east came to Jerusalem."
msgstr "Mi yettwaleɛ Sidna Ɛisa deg Bitlaḥem n Yahuda deg wussan n Ɛiṛud agellid, ẓret, imusnawen d-usan seg usammar ɣer Urcalim."

msgid "What is the name of the island where John was sent to?"
msgstr "Acu-t yisem n tegzirt anda yettwazen Yuḥenna?"

msgid "Patmos"
msgstr "Patmus"

msgid ""
"I, John, your brother and companion in the persecution, and in the kingdom "
"and endurance of Jesus Christ, was in the island called Patmos, because of "
"the word of God, and because of the testimony of Jesus Christ."
msgstr "Nekk Yuḥenna, gma-twen d umdukkel-nwen deg tmerkanti, d tgelda, d tezmert n Sidna Ɛisa Lmasiḥ, buɣeɣ deg tegzirt i d-yettusemman Patmus, ɣef ssebba n Wawal n Ṛebbi d tamsaksit n Sidna Ɛisa Lmasiḥ."

msgid "Who is the first person to acknowledge Jesus as the Christ?"
msgstr "Anwa i yella d amezwaru ibeggen belli Sidna Ɛisa d Lmasiḥ?"

msgid "Simeon"
msgstr "Simɛan"

msgid ""
"There was Simeon. A just and devout man. The Holy Spirit told him that he "
"will see Christ before his death."
msgstr "Yella Simɛan. D argaz n tidet u d amkellef. Ṛṛuḥ iqedsen yenna-yas belli ad iwali Lmasiḥ send ad yemmet."

msgid "To whom was the Acts Of Apostles written?"
msgstr "I wacu yettwarun lkitab n Tigawin n Imazan?"

msgid "Theophilus"
msgstr "Tiyufil"

msgid ""
"The former treatise have I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both "
"to do and teach,"
msgstr "Aḍris amezwaru i xedmeɣ, ay Tiyufil, ɣef wayen meṛṛa i d-yebda Sidna Ɛisa ad ixdem u ad yelmed,"

msgid "Where did Jesus met the woman from Samaria?"
msgstr "Anda i yemlal Sidna Ɛisa tamɣart n Sumeṛ?"

msgid "Jacob's well"
msgstr "Lbir n Yaɛqub"

msgid ""
"Jesus being wearied by his journey, sat on Jacob's well. Then came a woman "
"from Samaria to get water."
msgstr "Sidna Ɛisa yeɛya ɣef ubrid, yeqqim ɣef lbir n Yaɛqub. Syin tusa tmeṭṭut seg Sumeṛ ad d-tawi aman."

msgid "Who was the father of Abraham?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d baba n Ibrahim?"

msgid "Terah"
msgstr "Taraḥ"

msgid "And Terah took Abram his son,"
msgstr "U Taraḥ yeṭṭef Ibram, mmi-s,"

msgid "Who was the son of Cush, the mighty hunter before the Lord?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d mmi-s n Kuc, aḍnaqan ameqqran zdat n Ṛebbi?"

msgid "Nimrod"
msgstr "Nimrud"

msgid "And Cush bore Nimrod. He was a mighty hunter before the Lord."
msgstr "U Kuc yewlid Nimrud. Yella d aḍnaqan ameqqran zdat n Ṛebbi."

msgid "What is the name of Job's friend that answered him first?"
msgstr "Acu-t yisem n umdukkel n Ayub i yerran fell-as d amezwaru?"

msgid "Eliphaz"
msgstr "Ilifaz"

msgid "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said to Job."
msgstr "Syin Ilifaz Atemani yerra u yenna i Ayub."

msgid "What is the name of Ruth's husband?"
msgstr "Acu-t yisem n argaz n Rut?"

msgid "Boaz"
msgstr "Buɛaz"

msgid "So Boaz took Ruth as his wife."
msgstr "Ihi Buɛaz yeṭṭef Rut d tameṭṭut-is."

msgid "Who taught Lemuel Proverbs chapter 31?"
msgstr "Anwa i yellan i yelmden Lamwil Tinfalin uxef 31?"

msgid "Lemuel's mother"
msgstr "Yemma n Lamwil"

msgid "The words of king Lemuel, the prophecy that his mother taught him."
msgstr "Awalen n ugellid Lamwil, tenbaɛt i s-yelmed yemma-s."

msgid "Who is the chosen people of God in the Old Testament?"
msgstr "Anwa i yellan d agdud i d-yefren Ṛebbi deg Uneggaru Aqbur?"

msgid "Israel"
msgstr "Israyil"

msgid "Israel, you are the chosen people of the Lord your God."
msgstr "Ay Israyil, ahat d agdud i d-yefren Ssid Ṛebbi-inek."

msgid "Where did God rescue Israel from?"
msgstr "Seg wanda i yessuffeɣ Ṛebbi Israyil?"

msgid "Egypt"
msgstr "Maṣer"

msgid "Then with his mighty arm, he rescued you from Egypt."
msgstr "Syin s ufus-is aɛlayan, yessuffeɣ-kem seg Maṣer."

msgid "Who's the father of Abimelech?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d baba n Abimelek?"

msgid "Gideon"
msgstr "Jidɛun"

msgid "Abimelech the son of Gideon went to Shechem."
msgstr "Abimelek mmi-s n Jidɛun iṛuḥ ɣer Cakem."

msgid "Who's the father of Joshua the priest in the time of Ezra?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d baba n Yuccaɛ aqeddac deg wakud n Ɛezra?"

msgid "Jozadak"
msgstr "Yuzadaq"

msgid "The priest Joshua son of Jozadak."
msgstr "Aqeddac Yuccaɛ mmi-s n Yuzadaq."

msgid "Who's the king of Babylonia, that captures Israel?"
msgstr "Anwa i yellan d agellid n Babilun i yeṭṭfen Israyil?"

msgid "Nebuchadnezzar"
msgstr "Nabukudunuṣer"

msgid ""
"We were told that their people had made God angry, and he let them be "
"captured by Nebuchadnezzar, the king of Babylonia."
msgstr "Nnan-aɣ belli agdud-nsen yessemɣer Ṛebbi, u yeǧǧa-ten ad ttwaṭṭfen sɣur Nabukudunuṣer, agellid n Babilun."

msgid ""
"Who prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus the Persian?"
msgstr "Anwa i yelhan deg wakud n Daryus, u deg wakud n Kuris Afaris?"

msgid ""
"So this Daniel prospered in the reign of Darius, and in the reign of Cyrus "
"the Persian."
msgstr "Ihi Danyel-a yelha deg wakud n Daryus, u deg wakud n Kuris Afaris."

msgid "Who's Abram's brother's son?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d mmi-s n gma n Ibram?"

msgid "Lot"
msgstr "Luṭ"

msgid ""
"And they took Lot, Abram's brother's son, who dwelt in Sodom, and his goods, "
"and departed."
msgstr "U ṭṭfen Luṭ, mmi-s n gma n Ibram, i yeṭṭfen deg Sduma, d yiɣbula-s, u fɣen."

msgid "Who wrote Song of Songs?"
msgstr "Anwa i yeẓran Tizlit n Tezlatin?"

msgid "Solomon"
msgstr "Sliman"

msgid "This is Solomon's most beautiful song."
msgstr "Wagi d tizlit-nneɣ tabeɣṣant ugar n Sliman."

msgid "Who's the father of Hosea?"
msgstr "Anwa i d-yella d baba n Hucaɛ?"

msgid "Beeri"
msgstr "Biri"

msgid "I am Hosea son of Beeri."
msgstr "Nekk d Hucaɛ mmi-s n Biri."

msgid "Username should be at least four characters long"
msgstr "Isem n useqdac ilaq ad yesɛu ala 4 n yisekkilen"

msgid "The answer to the question is not correct"
msgstr "Tiririt i usteqsi ur tṣeḥḥa ara"

msgid "The username that you have chosen has already been taken."
msgstr "Isem n useqdac i tferneḍ yettwaṭṭef yakan."

msgid "Please choose another one."
msgstr "Ma ulac aɣilif fren wayeḍ."

msgid "The email address that you have chosen has already been taken."
msgstr "Tansa n imayl i tferneḍ tettwaṭṭef yakan."

msgid "Signup verification"
msgstr "Asenqed n uɣuṛ"

msgid "There is a request to open an account with this email address."
msgstr "Llan asuter n ldi n umiḍan s tansa n imayl-a."

msgid "Account opened"
msgstr "Amiḍan yeldi"

msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Anṣuf!"

msgid "Your account is now active and you have logged in."
msgstr "Amiḍan-ik yermed tura u teqqneḍ."

msgid "Username should be at least two characters long"
msgstr "Isem n useqdac ilaq ad yesɛu ugar n sin n yisekkilen"

msgid "Username or email address or password are not correct"
msgstr "Isem n useqdac neɣ tansa n imayl neɣ awal uffir ur ṣeḥḥan ara"
